
# game/a2s2.rpy:2
translate spanish a2s2_02747d86:

    # "Hearing that, my whole body numbs up."
    "Al oír eso, todo mi cuerpo se entumece."

# game/a2s2.rpy:3
translate spanish a2s2_e618ef9b:

    # "I can barely feel my feet hitting the ground, pumping my arms as I tear through the garden."
    "Apenas siento los pies golpear el suelo mientras muevo los brazos y atravieso el jardín a toda velocidad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:4
translate spanish a2s2_88c8798b:

    # "I don't even bother with the paths, instead crashing through the foliage and bushes, scratching up the skin on my arms and legs as I trample over something covered in thorns."
    "Ni siquiera sigo los caminos: me abro paso entre el follaje y los arbustos, arañándome brazos y piernas mientras piso algo cubierto de espinas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:5
translate spanish a2s2_60e1742a:

    # "I don't even care as I run straight through a ten foot-wide spiderweb, the massive spider in the middle hitting my chest then falling and disappearing under my feet."
    "Ni me importa atravesar de frente una telaraña de diez pies de ancho; la enorme araña del centro choca contra mi pecho, cae y desaparece bajo mis pies."

# game/a2s2.rpy:6
translate spanish a2s2_92ab23a1:

    # "The sound of Cato and Amicus struggling behind me has long since faded."
    "Los sonidos de Cato y Amicus forcejeando detrás de mí se han apagado hace tiempo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:7
translate spanish a2s2_4abeac96:

    # "Now all there is is my heavy breathing and the snapping and crashing of the plants around me."
    "Ahora solo se oyen mi respiración agitada y las plantas rompiéndose y chocando a mi alrededor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:8
translate spanish a2s2_178f35b5:

    # "I wonder if maybe I should stop making noise, try to hide instead...but I worry that Com will know exactly where I'm at."
    "Me pregunto si debería dejar de hacer ruido y tratar de esconderme...pero temo que Com sepa exactamente dónde estoy."

# game/a2s2.rpy:9
translate spanish a2s2_375b8bd7:

    # "I know they're following me right now, and ominously, I can't hear a damn thing."
    "Sé que me siguen ahora mismo y, de forma inquietante, no oigo absolutamente nada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:10
translate spanish a2s2_40fcc3f0:

    # "I can't see them either, just the flashes of branches and greenery around me."
    "Tampoco los veo; solo destellos de ramas y vegetación a mi alrededor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:12
translate spanish a2s2_52296950:

    # "When I finally make it to the main path to the palace, I catch my first glimpse of the drones."
    "Cuando por fin llego al camino principal hacia el palacio, veo los drones por primera vez."

# game/a2s2.rpy:13
translate spanish a2s2_b3122489:

    # "They're hovering further up the path, toward the amphitheater."
    "Flotan más adelante en el camino, hacia el anfiteatro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:14
translate spanish a2s2_bbb38b73:

    # "It makes me wonder if they're stuck on a grid somehow and had been unable to follow me into the actual garden."
    "Me pregunto si de algún modo están limitados a una cuadrícula y no han podido seguirme al interior del jardín."

# game/a2s2.rpy:15
translate spanish a2s2_dc8b60a0:

    # "I think about turning back and trying to hide in the garden again just as I rush through the entrance, but I realize immediately that they're too close."
    "Justo al cruzar la entrada pienso en volver atrás y esconderme de nuevo en el jardín, pero enseguida comprendo que están demasiado cerca."

# game/a2s2.rpy:16
translate spanish a2s2_f97e60a4:

    # "Sure enough, I hear a crack behind me just as I turn the corner in the main hall, toward Neferu's room."
    "En efecto, oigo un chasquido detrás de mí justo al doblar la esquina del salón principal hacia la habitación de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:18
translate spanish a2s2_d1265088:

    # "I get a glimpse of it out of the corner of my eye."
    "Lo entrevéo de reojo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:19
translate spanish a2s2_4fb1087c:

    # "I'm not sure what I expected the weaponry to be."
    "No sé qué clase de armas esperaba."

# game/a2s2.rpy:20
translate spanish a2s2_b57d7b1f:

    # "A red laser, an arc of electricity, actual bullets, maybe?"
    "¿Un láser rojo, un arco eléctrico, balas de verdad, quizá?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:21
translate spanish a2s2_db688664:

    # "What I do see is a strange bending of the air in the space I'd just been a second ago, like looking through a warped piece of glass before suddenly, it snaps back into place, making my ears pop and throwing my body sideways."
    "Lo que veo es una extraña deformación del aire donde estaba hace un segundo, como mirar a través de un vidrio torcido; de repente vuelve a su sitio, me hace chasquear los oídos y lanza mi cuerpo hacia un lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:22
translate spanish a2s2_c446bb14:

    # "I stumble, but I don't stop, Neferu's room just a few dozen feet ahead of me."
    "Tropiezo, pero no me detengo; la habitación de Neferu está a unas pocas decenas de pies."

# game/a2s2.rpy:23
translate spanish a2s2_68295adc:

    # "Now I can hear the drones; an odd, angry buzzing, like wasps."
    "Ahora oigo los drones: un zumbido extraño y furioso, como avispas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:24
translate spanish a2s2_7241fee4:

    # com "\"Halt, [mc].\""
    com "\"Detente, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:25
translate spanish a2s2_c44d7e73:

    # "I hear Com's gentle, calm voice; a stark contrast to what he's actually doing right now."
    "Oigo la voz suave y tranquila de Com, en marcado contraste con lo que está haciendo ahora mismo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:26
translate spanish a2s2_7b5c4940:

    # "It startles me and I put on an extra burst of speed just before I reach Neferu's door."
    "Me sobresalta y acelero aún más justo antes de llegar a la puerta de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:27
translate spanish a2s2_3a4011d5:

    # "I can only hope that he's there, otherwise I'm going to be cornered...it'll be where I die."
    "Solo puedo esperar que esté allí; de lo contrario quedaré acorralado...será donde muera."

# game/a2s2.rpy:28
translate spanish a2s2_085758eb:

    # "With my breath wheezing through my throat, I throw a hand out desperately, pressing it to the black panel on the door."
    "Con la respiración silbándome en la garganta, extiendo desesperadamente una mano y la aprieto contra el panel negro de la puerta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:29
translate spanish a2s2_97d7e1ff:

    # "...Nothing."
    "...Nada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:30
translate spanish a2s2_6e5da9af:

    # "It doesn't open, it's locked."
    "No se abre; está cerrada con llave."

# game/a2s2.rpy:31
translate spanish a2s2_6cade93b:

    # "I thought doors don't lock here?"
    "¿No se suponía que aquí las puertas no se cerraban con llave?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:32
translate spanish a2s2_f1b8dc93:

    # "I see the drones out of the corner of my eye and I pound on the door as hard as I can, screaming as loud as I can."
    "Veo los drones de reojo y golpeo la puerta con todas mis fuerzas, gritando todo lo que puedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:33
translate spanish a2s2_5b26751d:

    # m "\"NEFERU! NEFERU HELP!\""
    m "\"¡NEFERU! ¡NEFERU, AYUDA!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:34
translate spanish a2s2_9c62690e:

    # "There's a pause, and I hear something to my right that sounds like static, getting louder and louder and I press myself against the door, waiting for whatever it is the blast will do to me."
    "Hay una pausa; a mi derecha oigo algo parecido a estática, cada vez más fuerte. Me aprieto contra la puerta, esperando lo que sea que la descarga vaya a hacerme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:36
translate spanish a2s2_50efe45e:

    # "Then I'm falling through space."
    "Entonces caigo por el vacío."

# game/a2s2.rpy:37
translate spanish a2s2_1682b3b1:

    # "I'm convinced then that I've died, that this falling sensation is what it's like to die."
    "Estoy convencido de que he muerto, de que esta sensación de caída es lo que se siente al morir."

# game/a2s2.rpy:38
translate spanish a2s2_8c9e632a:

    # "Will I land on something, or just fall forever?"
    "¿Aterrizaré sobre algo o caeré para siempre?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:39
translate spanish a2s2_bdf23c9b:

    # "I get my answer almost immediately as I hit the ground face-first on the hard, marble floor."
    "Obtengo la respuesta casi enseguida al caer de cara contra el duro suelo de mármol."

# game/a2s2.rpy:43
translate spanish a2s2_aec90906:

    # "I'm dazed as there's a sharp crack behind me, and I feel the force of it sending a gust of air over me."
    "Quedo aturdido cuando suena un fuerte chasquido detrás de mí; siento su fuerza enviar una ráfaga de aire por encima de mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:44
translate spanish a2s2_7225e2ff:

    # n "\"Ahhotep!\""
    n "\"¡Ahhotep!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:45
translate spanish a2s2_8dd9306e:

    # "Neferu's voice yelps above me and I hear the sound of the door sliding shut."
    "La voz de Neferu grita sobre mí y oigo la puerta deslizarse hasta cerrarse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:48
translate spanish a2s2_638aec6b:

    # n "\"Com, what is going on!?\""
    n "\"¡¿Com, qué está pasando?!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:49
translate spanish a2s2_5542be78:

    # com "\"Disengage your door's security measures, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Desactiva las medidas de seguridad de tu puerta, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:51
translate spanish a2s2_f41c1a5a:

    # n "\"What's happening?\""
    n "\"¿Qué está pasando?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:52
translate spanish a2s2_0d8b9dad:

    # "Neferu is crouching over me now, and I think he's talking to me, but Com answers him instead as the jackal starts to help me to my feet."
    "Neferu está agachado sobre mí; creo que me habla, pero Com responde en su lugar mientras el chacal empieza a ayudarme a levantarme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:53
translate spanish a2s2_2a38b33d:

    # com "\"The child is to be terminated. Please disengage security to allow drone entry.\""
    com "\"El Hijo debe ser eliminado. Desactiva la seguridad para permitir la entrada de los drones.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:55
translate spanish a2s2_b3682948:

    # n "\"What!? No. [mc], what's happening?\""
    n "\"¡¿Qué?! No. [mc], ¿qué está pasando?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:56
translate spanish a2s2_aa390f5e:

    # "Neferu has pulled me to my feet at this point, looking me right in the eye."
    "Neferu ya me ha puesto de pie y me mira directamente a los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:57
translate spanish a2s2_9e74e174:

    # m "\"A—Ami—\""
    m "\"A—Ami—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:58
translate spanish a2s2_36fc7164:

    # "I find myself way more out of breath than I thought I was as I try to gasp out an answer."
    "Al tratar de responder entre jadeos, descubro que estoy mucho más agotado de lo que creía."

# game/a2s2.rpy:59
translate spanish a2s2_000ec750:

    # m "\"Amicus...lost emperorship—\""
    m "\"Amicus...perdió el trono—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:61
translate spanish a2s2_c6e756be:

    # ca "\"Neferu, open the damn door!\""
    ca "\"¡Neferu, abre la maldita puerta!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:62
translate spanish a2s2_f0ffef17:

    # "Cato's voice crackles through the speakers above me, making me jump."
    "La voz de Cato crepita en los altavoces sobre mí y me hace dar un salto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:63
translate spanish a2s2_dcab0d23:

    # "It's strained and breathing heavily, and I wonder what he's doing right now...what Amicus is doing."
    "Suena tensa y jadeante; me pregunto qué estará haciendo ahora...qué estará haciendo Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:65
translate spanish a2s2_8d207e9a:

    # "The jackal pushes me back to stand behind him, keeping himself between me and the door."
    "El chacal me empuja hacia atrás para que quede detrás de él, manteniéndose entre la puerta y yo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:66
translate spanish a2s2_d290924d:

    # "Even though he's got his face set into a stern glare, he's as calm as he always is."
    "Aunque tiene el rostro endurecido en una mirada severa, está tan tranquilo como siempre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:67
translate spanish a2s2_0905bc18:

    # n "\"Cato, what a pleasant surprise to hear your voice. May I ask why you want entry into my quarters?\""
    n "\"Cato, qué agradable sorpresa oír tu voz. ¿Puedo preguntar por qué deseas entrar en mis aposentos?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:68
translate spanish a2s2_9ae7ea22:

    # ca "\"The emperor's quarters, you dog. Com, override door security.\""
    ca "\"Los aposentos del emperador, perro. Com, anula la seguridad de la puerta.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:69
translate spanish a2s2_f0acee69:

    # com "\"Overriding security.\""
    com "\"Anulando la seguridad.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:71
translate spanish a2s2_67db27cc:

    # "There's a hiss and click from the door and suddenly it slides open."
    "La puerta sisea y chasquea; de pronto se desliza y se abre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:72
translate spanish a2s2_745a084f:

    # "Quickly, Neferu backs into me, much like Amicus did earlier this morning, and I find myself pressed back into one of the pillars, the jackal's body almost entirely covering me up."
    "Neferu retrocede rápidamente contra mí, como hizo Amicus esta mañana; termino apretado contra una columna, con el cuerpo del chacal cubriéndome casi por completo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:73
translate spanish a2s2_db967baa:

    # "Although I know Amicus is a good deal bigger than Neferu, I'm still struck by the jackal's size now that he's so close to me."
    "Aunque sé que Amicus es bastante más grande que Neferu, el tamaño del chacal me impresiona ahora que está tan cerca."

# game/a2s2.rpy:74
translate spanish a2s2_7764e23c:

    # com "\"Step aside, Neferu, or risk being shot.\""
    com "\"Apártate, Neferu, o te arriesgas a recibir un disparo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:75
translate spanish a2s2_afdf2c77:

    # ca "\"DON'T shoot the jackal. Neferu, what are you doing with it?\""
    ca "\"NO dispares al chacal. Neferu, ¿qué estás haciendo con eso?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:76
translate spanish a2s2_eb4dd846:

    # "Cato is breathing heavily, and it sounds like he's moving around."
    "Cato respira con dificultad y parece moverse de un lado a otro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:77
translate spanish a2s2_23aea082:

    # ca "\"Can't see a damn thing! Have you called a ship!?\""
    ca "\"¡No veo una mierda! ¡¿Habéis llamado a una nave?!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:78
translate spanish a2s2_8b7d6140:

    # al "\"Yes, your Imperial Majesty.\""
    al "\"Sí, Su Majestad Imperial.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:79
translate spanish a2s2_b83d4523:

    # "There's more muffled moving around, and I wonder what Cato's speaking into, maybe a drone."
    "Se oyen más movimientos amortiguados; me pregunto a través de qué habla Cato, quizá un dron."

# game/a2s2.rpy:80
translate spanish a2s2_5b539352:

    # ca "\"Neferu, I asked you a question!\""
    ca "\"¡Neferu, te he hecho una pregunta!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:82
translate spanish a2s2_624b42af:

    # n "\"Simply protecting a fellow Khemian.\""
    n "\"Solo protejo a un compatriota khemio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:83
translate spanish a2s2_d2781e7e:

    # "There's a moment of silence."
    "Hay un momento de silencio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:84
translate spanish a2s2_da47bde0:

    # ca "\"A what?\""
    ca "\"¿A un qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:86
translate spanish a2s2_3e2bb40b:

    # n "\"Khemian.\""
    n "\"Khemio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:87
translate spanish a2s2_7e8c91cb:

    # "Neferu enunciates very slowly, and I look up at the back of his head, just as confused as Cato."
    "Neferu articula muy despacio; miro hacia su nuca, tan confundido como Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:88
translate spanish a2s2_b24f8348:

    # ca "\"Agh! Don't press so damn hard, cat!\""
    ca "\"¡Agh! ¡No aprietes tan fuerte, maldito gato!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:89
translate spanish a2s2_efecbe3d:

    # ca "\"What do you mean, Neferu?\""
    ca "\"¿Qué quieres decir, Neferu?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:90
translate spanish a2s2_5902be0e:

    # "Cato's voice takes on a more growly tone as he turns his attention from whatever he was doing back on us."
    "La voz de Cato se vuelve más gruñona cuando aparta su atención de lo que estuviera haciendo y vuelve a nosotros."

# game/a2s2.rpy:91
translate spanish a2s2_0bbb3758:

    # n "\"I mean that the child has been granted citizenship in the Khemian kingdom, and it would be unwise to attack him.\""
    n "\"Que al Hijo se le ha concedido la ciudadanía del reino khemio y no sería prudente atacarlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:92
translate spanish a2s2_de5259dc:

    # "Neferu's voice takes on an almost smug tone."
    "La voz de Neferu adquiere un tono casi engreído."

# game/a2s2.rpy:93
translate spanish a2s2_93a188ea:

    # n "\"An attack on him would be an attack on us all. Surely you understand this, emperor.\""
    n "\"Un ataque contra él sería un ataque contra todos nosotros. Seguro que lo entiendes, emperador.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:94
translate spanish a2s2_d0bbda1f:

    # ca "\"You lie.\""
    ca "\"Mientes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:96
translate spanish a2s2_a73b0e63:

    # n "\"Would you like to test that?\""
    n "\"¿Quieres comprobarlo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:97
translate spanish a2s2_73970d06:

    # "There's a long pause."
    "Hay una larga pausa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:98
translate spanish a2s2_d4c35033:

    # "In the meantime, a low, rumbling sound grows, audible not only through the intercom, but through the floor of the palace as well."
    "Mientras tanto crece un retumbo grave, audible tanto por el intercomunicador como a través del suelo del palacio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:99
translate spanish a2s2_78026106:

    # al "\"The ship is arriving your Imperial Majesty.\""
    al "\"La nave está llegando, Su Majestad Imperial.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:100
translate spanish a2s2_d0e9a0fc:

    # ca "\"Yes, I can see that, cat. Neferu...\""
    ca "\"Sí, ya lo veo, gato. Neferu...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:101
translate spanish a2s2_fa5b4290:

    # "Another long pause."
    "Otra larga pausa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:102
translate spanish a2s2_025a2245:

    # ca "\"We will discuss this further once I'm back in the palace. I don't know what you and Amicus have planned, but know that I'll be keeping a very close eye on you. That creature is not to leave the palace.\""
    ca "\"Seguiremos hablando cuando vuelva al palacio. No sé qué habéis planeado Amicus y tú, pero ten por seguro que te vigilaré muy de cerca. Esa criatura no debe abandonar el palacio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:103
translate spanish a2s2_1a02fa06:

    # "The wolf suddenly grunts and I can hear the voices of other wolves as well."
    "El lobo gruñe de repente; también oigo las voces de otros lobos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:104
translate spanish a2s2_779080d9:

    # ca "\"I'm fine, I'm fine, just get me to hospital.\""
    ca "\"Estoy bien, estoy bien; llevadme al hospital.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:105
translate spanish a2s2_1223d402:

    # "There are more sounds of movement, grunting, cursing, and voices of concern before the wolf speaks to us again."
    "Se oyen más movimientos, gruñidos, maldiciones y voces preocupadas antes de que el lobo vuelva a hablarnos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:106
translate spanish a2s2_b5a96b73:

    # ca "\"And remember, you have no way off this moon at the moment. It would be wise to do as I say.\""
    ca "\"Y recuerda que ahora no tienes cómo salir de esta luna. Sería prudente hacer lo que te digo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:108
translate spanish a2s2_07573df4:

    # n "\"Of course, Your Majesty.\""
    n "\"Por supuesto, Su Majestad.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:109
translate spanish a2s2_34bf00aa:

    # "Cato grunts."
    "Cato gruñe."

# game/a2s2.rpy:110
translate spanish a2s2_81433756:

    # ca "\"Com, cancel last directive. Execute [mc] if he tries to leave the palace.\""
    ca "\"Com, cancela la última orden. Ejecuta a [mc] si intenta abandonar el palacio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:111
translate spanish a2s2_6123227d:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato.\""
    com "\"Sí, Cato.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:112
translate spanish a2s2_b3798bc0:

    # "The connection suddenly cuts off, and the two of us are left to stand in silence."
    "La conexión se corta de repente y ambos nos quedamos de pie en silencio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:113
translate spanish a2s2_6674d214:

    # "Finally, Neferu lets out a long, soft sigh."
    "Por fin Neferu suelta un suspiro largo y suave."

# game/a2s2.rpy:116
translate spanish a2s2_264cefef:

    # n "\"Damn.\""
    n "\"Maldición.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:117
translate spanish a2s2_f85c6915:

    # "The jackal finally takes a few steps forward before turning to face me."
    "El chacal da por fin unos pasos hacia delante y se vuelve hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:118
translate spanish a2s2_21628405:

    # n "\"Well, this situation is less than ideal. I receive news that you somehow rose from the dead last night, and now this. Com, send us the physician.\""
    n "\"Esta situación dista de ser ideal. Recibo noticias de que anoche resucitaste de algún modo y ahora esto. Com, envíanos al médico.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:119
translate spanish a2s2_f3dada3b:

    # "Even though I've caught my breath at this point, I realize that I'm sweaty and covered in scratches."
    "Aunque ya he recuperado el aliento, noto que estoy sudado y cubierto de arañazos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:120
translate spanish a2s2_e2a35d68:

    # com "\"Cannot comply with directive. Felix is currently in the dungeons.\""
    com "\"No puedo cumplir la orden. Felix está actualmente en las mazmorras.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:122
translate spanish a2s2_413b73c8:

    # n "\"What!? Why?\""
    n "\"¡¿Qué?! ¿Por qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:123
translate spanish a2s2_610c879d:

    # com "\"Under the orders of the emperor, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Por orden del emperador, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:125
translate spanish a2s2_264cefef_1:

    # n "\"Damn.\""
    n "\"Maldición.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:126
translate spanish a2s2_5f8a04f3:

    # "This time the jackal says it out of amazement rather than annoyance."
    "Esta vez el chacal lo dice por asombro más que por enfado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:127
translate spanish a2s2_740a9e74:

    # n "\"Well, send bandages and a salve, at least.\""
    n "\"Pues envía al menos vendas y una pomada.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:128
translate spanish a2s2_3fa27c24:

    # com "\"Yes, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Sí, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:131
translate spanish a2s2_40b2766f:

    # n "\"[mc]...what happened? Where's Amicus?\""
    n "\"[mc]...¿qué ha pasado? ¿Dónde está Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:132
translate spanish a2s2_99c6c22c:

    # "After a few more deep breaths, I begin to go over everything that just happened, starting at the point where we were woken up by Cato and ending where I'd attacked Cassius and made a run for Neferu's room."
    "Tras respirar hondo unas cuantas veces más, empiezo a contar lo ocurrido, desde que Cato nos despertó hasta que ataqué a Cassius y corrí hacia la habitación de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:133
translate spanish a2s2_86bc9f22:

    # "I try to keep things vague, like Cato just decided Amicus was unfit for the job and wanted to illegitimately put Cassius on the throne, but of course Neferu immediately realizes that I'm leaving things out."
    "Intento ser impreciso, como si Cato simplemente hubiese decidido que Amicus no era apto y quisiera poner a Cassius en el trono ilegítimamente, pero Neferu enseguida nota que omito cosas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:135
translate spanish a2s2_9564dcea:

    # n "\"Then why does he want you executed? It seems odd he'd suddenly decide to do all of this now.\""
    n "\"Entonces, ¿por qué quiere ejecutarte? Parece extraño que de pronto haya decidido hacer todo esto ahora.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:136
translate spanish a2s2_310baa64:

    # "I hesitate, and it's at this moment that the door slides open, causing me to jump and cower as a drone enters."
    "Vacilo; en ese momento la puerta se abre y me hace saltar y encogerme cuando entra un dron."

# game/a2s2.rpy:138
translate spanish a2s2_6fe2e7b6:

    # n "\"Steady, [mc], it's just the medical supplies I requested. Have a seat on the bed.\""
    n "\"Tranquilo, [mc]; solo son los suministros médicos que pedí. Siéntate en la cama.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:139
translate spanish a2s2_96cbd4bd:

    # "There are two beds, but the jackal gestures at the smaller one."
    "Hay dos camas, pero el chacal señala la pequeña."

# game/a2s2.rpy:140
translate spanish a2s2_1770000d:

    # "Dumbly, I point this out to him."
    "Se lo señalo tontamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:141
translate spanish a2s2_2868e8ca:

    # m "\"Why do you have two beds?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué tienes dos camas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:142
translate spanish a2s2_f3ad8b01:

    # "As I sit, Neferu sets the supplies, all laid out on a metal tray, to the side, uncorking a bottle and dipping a brush into it."
    "Mientras me siento, Neferu deja a un lado los suministros, dispuestos en una bandeja metálica; destapa una botella y moja un pincel en ella."

# game/a2s2.rpy:143
translate spanish a2s2_d288d868:

    # "He then starts to apply a dark, orange liquid to the cuts on my arms and legs."
    "Luego aplica un líquido naranja oscuro a los cortes de mis brazos y piernas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:145
translate spanish a2s2_69714a97:

    # n "\"Well, one for the emperor and, interestingly enough, this one for the emperor's pet. Lift your arm.\""
    n "\"Una es para el emperador y, curiosamente, esta otra para su mascota. Levanta el brazo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:146
translate spanish a2s2_b71f7594:

    # "I do as he says, still feeling numb as he starts to coat a rather deep cut on the underside of my arm."
    "Hago lo que dice, todavía entumecido, mientras empieza a cubrir un corte bastante profundo en la parte inferior de mi brazo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:147
translate spanish a2s2_bac355e0:

    # m "\"Can we go find Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Podemos ir a buscar a Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:149
translate spanish a2s2_f6c19511:

    # n "\"Where is Amicus, Com?\""
    n "\"¿Dónde está Amicus, Com?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:150
translate spanish a2s2_66293a06:

    # com "\"That information is confidential and only accessible by the emperor, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Esa información es confidencial y solo el emperador puede acceder a ella, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:152
translate spanish a2s2_83ddf71f:

    # "I see the jackal's eyes narrow as my stomach twists."
    "Veo al chacal entrecerrar los ojos mientras se me retuerce el estómago."

# game/a2s2.rpy:153
translate spanish a2s2_9406e39b:

    # m "\"What does that mean?\""
    m "\"¿Qué significa eso?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:154
translate spanish a2s2_4c7aa90b:

    # n "\"Could mean any number of things.\""
    n "\"Podría significar muchas cosas.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:155
translate spanish a2s2_5096bbb0:

    # "I clutch my hands together, feeling my anxiety grow."
    "Entrelazo las manos y siento crecer mi ansiedad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:156
translate spanish a2s2_bf46e7ba:

    # m "\"But is he alright? What if Cato did something to him—\""
    m "\"Pero ¿está bien? ¿Y si Cato le ha hecho algo—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:157
translate spanish a2s2_ac6ce3f2:

    # "Neferu rests a paw on my shoulder."
    "Neferu posa una mano en mi hombro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:159
translate spanish a2s2_f2342e00:

    # n "\"I understand your worry for Amicus's safety, but also understand that Cato would not even think of taking Amicus's life. Your wolf is likely imprisoned somewhere after what he did.\""
    n "\"Entiendo tu preocupación por Amicus, pero entiende también que Cato ni siquiera pensaría en quitarle la vida. Tu lobo probablemente está encarcelado en alguna parte después de lo que hizo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:160
translate spanish a2s2_1a70ba86:

    # "That doesn't make me feel all that much better, but I manage to hold still as the jackal continues to treat me."
    "Eso no me tranquiliza demasiado, pero consigo quedarme quieto mientras el chacal sigue curándome."

# game/a2s2.rpy:161
translate spanish a2s2_25846949:

    # "After a period of silence though, Neferu sighs."
    "Después de un rato en silencio, Neferu suspira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:163
translate spanish a2s2_e2ad9316:

    # n "\"So...at this point it seems we're in a rather precarious situation. I promised Amicus that if something happened to him, I would do everything in my power to keep you safe.\""
    n "\"Así que...parece que estamos en una situación bastante precaria. Prometí a Amicus que, si le ocurría algo, haría todo lo posible por mantenerte a salvo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:164
translate spanish a2s2_60c8e14c:

    # "Neferu pauses, and only continues when I look up to meet his eyes."
    "Neferu hace una pausa y solo continúa cuando levanto la vista y lo miro a los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:165
translate spanish a2s2_927987e0:

    # n "\"It would seem that what he worried about has come to pass, and now I must carry out that promise, but to do that...I need you to be honest with me so that I may know exactly what we are dealing with.\""
    n "\"Parece que sus temores se han cumplido y ahora debo cumplir esa promesa. Pero para hacerlo...necesito que seas sincero conmigo y saber exactamente a qué nos enfrentamos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:166
translate spanish a2s2_86db693b:

    # "I gaze at Neferu for a while, wondering how much is at stake right now."
    "Miro a Neferu un rato, preguntándome cuánto está en juego."

# game/a2s2.rpy:167
translate spanish a2s2_7c27b66b:

    # "The events of the past hour have left me emotionally drained, numb aside from the twisting anxiety of wondering what's happening to Amicus right now."
    "Lo ocurrido en la última hora me ha dejado emocionalmente agotado y entumecido, salvo por la ansiedad que me retuerce al pensar qué le estará pasando a Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:168
translate spanish a2s2_4c28d073:

    # "I feel myself deflate."
    "Siento que me desinflo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:169
translate spanish a2s2_a0adc871:

    # m "\"...Amicus made First Contact with me. Cato found out.\""
    m "\"...Amicus hizo el Primer Contacto conmigo. Cato lo descubrió.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:170
translate spanish a2s2_de41e865:

    # "I wait for a moment, wondering if the jackal is just going to toss me out into the hall after learning such a terrible secret."
    "Espero un momento, preguntándome si el chacal me echará al pasillo tras conocer un secreto tan terrible."

# game/a2s2.rpy:171
translate spanish a2s2_05786aec:

    # "But when Neferu doesn't say anything, I look up."
    "Pero, como Neferu no dice nada, levanto la vista."

# game/a2s2.rpy:173
translate spanish a2s2_2b831b4c:

    # "I guess I expected to see a look of shock, or even horror on the jackal's face, but it mostly just looks annoyed."
    "Creo que esperaba ver sorpresa o incluso horror en su rostro; en cambio, parece sobre todo molesto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:174
translate spanish a2s2_fde63e3e:

    # n "\"You know, I had suspected such a thing considering all of the odd quirks you possess, but I had also thought that even Amicus would not be so foolish enough to do it.\""
    n "\"Había sospechado algo así, dadas todas tus peculiaridades, pero también pensaba que ni siquiera Amicus sería tan tonto como para hacerlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:175
translate spanish a2s2_ed07d11a:

    # "I feel myself grow a little defensive."
    "Me pongo un poco a la defensiva."

# game/a2s2.rpy:176
translate spanish a2s2_e9f8af50:

    # m "\"Hey, he didn't know. We'd been contacted by the wolves before, but we lost the history of it somehow.\""
    m "\"Oye, no lo sabía. Los lobos ya habían contactado con nosotros, pero de algún modo perdimos la historia de aquello.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:177
translate spanish a2s2_7d5b33aa:

    # n "\"Even so, he should have taken more care.\""
    n "\"Aun así, debería haber sido más cuidadoso.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:179
translate spanish a2s2_afac4355:

    # n "\"That's in the past now, however. We must focus on the present.\""
    n "\"Pero eso ya ha pasado. Debemos centrarnos en el presente.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:180
translate spanish a2s2_699a6bcd:

    # m "\"Aren't you worried about getting in trouble?\""
    m "\"¿No te preocupa meterte en problemas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:182
translate spanish a2s2_8c05a777:

    # n "\"Me? Why would I be worried?\""
    n "\"¿A mí? ¿Por qué iba a preocuparme?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:183
translate spanish a2s2_5ca7dae1:

    # m "\"Isn't unauthorized First Contact like, really, really bad?\""
    m "\"¿No es muy, muy grave un Primer Contacto no autorizado?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:184
translate spanish a2s2_0b06eeb0:

    # n "\"Well, yes, but I'm not the one that commited the crime. The burden rests on Amicus and on the wolves. I'm merely here to help a sapient that I did not know was an un-contacted alien.\""
    n "\"Sí, pero yo no cometí el delito. La responsabilidad recae sobre Amicus y los lobos. Solo ayudo a un ser sapiente que no sabía que era un alienígena aún no contactado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:185
translate spanish a2s2_beb53b74:

    # "Neferu starts to wrap the bandages around the deepest cut on my arm."
    "Neferu empieza a vendar el corte más profundo de mi brazo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:186
translate spanish a2s2_1b982da1:

    # m "\"And how did I become a citizen?\""
    m "\"¿Y cómo me hice ciudadano?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:188
translate spanish a2s2_bf0156a3:

    # n "\"I authorized it at the embassy shortly after the deal I made with Amicus. You were never officially his pet, thus never a member of the empire. We thought it best to simply grant you citizenship in the meantime.\""
    n "\"Lo autoricé en la embajada poco después de mi acuerdo con Amicus. Nunca fuiste oficialmente su mascota ni, por tanto, miembro del imperio. Creímos mejor concederte la ciudadanía mientras tanto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:189
translate spanish a2s2_6f98858f:

    # m "\"You can just...do that?\""
    m "\"¿Puedes...hacerlo sin más?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:191
translate spanish a2s2_158cece4:

    # n "\"Well yes, I'm the son of the Pharaoh.\""
    n "\"Sí, soy hijo del faraón.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:192
translate spanish a2s2_49db7a95:

    # m "\"Don't I have to sign something..or something?\""
    m "\"¿No tengo que firmar algo...o algo así?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:193
translate spanish a2s2_d137aae8:

    # n "\"It has been taken care of.\""
    n "\"Ya está resuelto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:194
translate spanish a2s2_bf992361:

    # m "\"How?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:196
translate spanish a2s2_6060c90b:

    # n "\"Again; son of the pharaoh.\""
    n "\"Repito: hijo del faraón.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:197
translate spanish a2s2_ad46aba7:

    # "I sit in silence for a while, trying to comprehend all of this while still worrying about Amicus."
    "Me quedo sentado en silencio un rato, intentando asimilarlo todo mientras sigo preocupado por Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:198
translate spanish a2s2_9ad6d811:

    # m "\"Can we find out where Amicus is?\""
    m "\"¿Podemos averiguar dónde está Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:199
translate spanish a2s2_6e84a551:

    # n "\"We will shortly.\""
    n "\"Lo haremos pronto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:200
translate spanish a2s2_bf992361_1:

    # m "\"How?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:201
translate spanish a2s2_b7c284f3:

    # n "\"Even if it was supposedly a secret, word spreads fast in these halls.\""
    n "\"Aunque supuestamente sea un secreto, las noticias corren deprisa por estos pasillos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:202
translate spanish a2s2_4fd6da99:

    # m "\"Why are you helping me? This is all so...crazy.\""
    m "\"¿Por qué me ayudas? Todo esto es tan...absurdo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:204
translate spanish a2s2_57b4a069:

    # n "\"I've told you before [mc], it is the duty of a Khemian to help a sapient in distress.\""
    n "\"Ya te lo dije, [mc]: un khemio tiene el deber de ayudar a un ser sapiente en apuros.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:205
translate spanish a2s2_c98c8996:

    # "I stare at the jackal."
    "Miro fijamente al chacal."

# game/a2s2.rpy:206
translate spanish a2s2_5f0d9f6e:

    # m "\"Uh-huh, and why else?\""
    m "\"Ajá, ¿y qué más?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:207
translate spanish a2s2_1de069de:

    # "Neferu smiles gently at me."
    "Neferu me sonríe con suavidad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:209
translate spanish a2s2_49c4517b:

    # n "\"Despite our past interactions, I consider Amicus a friend. You are very important to him, and I see it as my duty to keep you safe...and would it be strange that I consider {i}you{/i} a friend as well?\""
    n "\"Pese a nuestros encuentros anteriores, considero a Amicus un amigo. Eres muy importante para él y creo que es mi deber protegerte...¿y sería extraño que también te considerase a {i}ti{/i} un amigo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:210
translate spanish a2s2_14b90d82:

    # "Friend."
    "Amigo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:211
translate spanish a2s2_070a335a:

    # m "\"Does this have to do with the alliance?\""
    m "\"¿Tiene que ver con la alianza?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:212
translate spanish a2s2_c53ab923:

    # "Neferu continues to smile."
    "Neferu sigue sonriendo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:213
translate spanish a2s2_347ce1ff:

    # n "\"I suppose there {i}are{/i} a few other reasons.\""
    n "\"Supongo que {i}hay{/i} algunas razones más.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:214
translate spanish a2s2_972b19f0:

    # "Those reasons are pretty easy to figure out."
    "Es bastante fácil deducir esas razones."

# game/a2s2.rpy:215
translate spanish a2s2_f4b08ce7:

    # "Keeping me protected will keep Amicus happy, and Amicus knowing that Neferu did that will make the alliance more likely...assuming we get out of this mess"
    "Protegerme mantendrá contento a Amicus; saber que Neferu lo hizo hará más probable la alianza...si salimos de este desastre"

# game/a2s2.rpy:216
translate spanish a2s2_80402a17:

    # "Obviously Neferu won't say, but knowing this is most likely the main reason actually makes me feel a bit better."
    "Neferu no lo dirá, pero saber que probablemente es la razón principal me tranquiliza un poco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:217
translate spanish a2s2_e048ed7c:

    # "I don't have to worry that the jackal has some other nefarious plan in store for me."
    "No tengo que temer que el chacal tenga algún otro plan siniestro para mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:218
translate spanish a2s2_960cb6ac:

    # com "\"Virginia requests access to your quarters, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Virginia solicita acceso a tus aposentos, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:220
translate spanish a2s2_5442246f:

    # n "\"Ah, and here might be the answer to your earlier question. Granted, Com.\""
    n "\"Ah, aquí podría estar la respuesta a tu pregunta anterior. Concedido, Com.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:222
translate spanish a2s2_ecace549:

    # "The door slides open, revealing Virginia."
    "La puerta se desliza y deja ver a Virginia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:225
translate spanish a2s2_798a37f1:

    # "She doesn't look happy."
    "No parece contenta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:226
translate spanish a2s2_1300969e:

    # "Immediately, she stalks into the room, eyes on me, glaring."
    "Entra inmediatamente con paso airado, mirándome con severidad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:227
translate spanish a2s2_805369e1:

    # "I wonder what exactly it is she's waiting for, then the door slides shut."
    "Me pregunto qué está esperando exactamente; entonces la puerta se cierra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:229
translate spanish a2s2_faa38439:

    # v "\"What in the name of the Romanus have you done, alien?\""
    v "\"¿Qué has hecho, por Romanus, alienígena?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:230
translate spanish a2s2_adaeddad:

    # "Neferu chuckles."
    "Neferu suelta una risita."

# game/a2s2.rpy:232
translate spanish a2s2_c5215e39:

    # n "\"Easy, Virginia. He's been through quite a lot in the past hour.\""
    n "\"Tranquila, Virginia. Ha pasado por mucho en la última hora.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:234
translate spanish a2s2_9fe64ac8:

    # v "\"Easy? Cassius and Cato are in hospital. Amicus is in the dungeons...Cassius is to become emperor! Our plans are in ruins, Neferu!\""
    v "\"¿Tranquila? Cassius y Cato están en el hospital. Amicus está en las mazmorras...¡Cassius será emperador! ¡Nuestros planes están arruinados, Neferu!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:235
translate spanish a2s2_826f5b1c:

    # "The wolf folds her arms and walks around slowly so that she can better look at me."
    "La loba cruza los brazos y camina despacio alrededor para mirarme mejor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:237
translate spanish a2s2_df803c26:

    # v "\"What happened?\""
    v "\"¿Qué pasó?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:238
translate spanish a2s2_816d8c09:

    # "My first instinct is to stay quiet, cross my eyes in that dull, vacant stare and pretend not to understand."
    "Mi primer impulso es callar, poner los ojos bizcos con aquella mirada apagada y vacía y fingir que no entiendo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:239
translate spanish a2s2_3cdc5d3a:

    # "But then I realize I don't have to anymore."
    "Pero entonces comprendo que ya no tengo que hacerlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:240
translate spanish a2s2_562a757c:

    # "I'd come to this realization after the second trial, but now that everything has fallen apart, now that I actually have some protection, I find myself bristling at the she-wolf's accusing stare."
    "Ya lo había comprendido tras la segunda prueba, pero ahora que todo se ha derrumbado y tengo cierta protección, me indigno ante la mirada acusadora de la loba."

# game/a2s2.rpy:241
translate spanish a2s2_eab91f31:

    # m "\"Cato's a complete monster. He staged the third trial so that Amicus would lose. I used the nervo on Cassius and should have done the same to Cato, then Amicus ripped his visor off.\""
    m "\"Cato es un auténtico monstruo. Amañó la tercera prueba para que Amicus perdiera. Usé el nervo con Cassius y debería haber hecho lo mismo con Cato; luego Amicus le arrancó el visor.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:243
translate spanish a2s2_15c598e5:

    # "Virginia gives me a look of surprise, probably not expecting me to be so honest...or maybe she's just shocked at how brutal things got."
    "Virginia me mira sorprendida, quizá porque no esperaba tanta sinceridad...o quizá por lo brutal que se volvió todo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:244
translate spanish a2s2_630a93ec:

    # "She then looks to Neferu who nods in response."
    "Después mira a Neferu, que asiente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:246
translate spanish a2s2_09f50656:

    # v "\"But why?\""
    v "\"¿Pero por qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:247
translate spanish a2s2_c9f08ce3:

    # "That's when I hesitate again, but again, I feel like it doesn't matter much anymore."
    "Vuelvo a vacilar, aunque una vez más siento que ya no importa mucho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:248
translate spanish a2s2_933bd775:

    # m "\"Amicus made First Contact with my species.\""
    m "\"Amicus hizo el Primer Contacto con mi especie.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:250
translate spanish a2s2_3c70118a:

    # v "\"WHAT!?\""
    v "\"¡¿QUÉ?!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:251
translate spanish a2s2_970ff615:

    # "The wolf looks horrified, bringing a paw to her muzzle."
    "La loba parece horrorizada y se lleva una mano al hocico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:252
translate spanish a2s2_f85767aa:

    # "Now this is the kind of reaction I'd expect."
    "Esta sí es la reacción que esperaba."

# game/a2s2.rpy:253
translate spanish a2s2_5f35bab5:

    # v "\"Why would he do such a thing?\""
    v "\"¿Por qué haría algo así?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:254
translate spanish a2s2_63e86c88:

    # m "\"I don't know...his research on my planet told him otherwise, I think.\""
    m "\"No lo sé...creo que sus investigaciones sobre mi planeta le indicaron otra cosa.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:255
translate spanish a2s2_2574aae5:

    # "Virginia just stares at me, then looks away, toward the door."
    "Virginia me mira fijamente y luego aparta la vista hacia la puerta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:257
translate spanish a2s2_333fc668:

    # n "\"Honestly, knowing your brother, it's not all that surprising.\""
    n "\"Sinceramente, conociendo a tu hermano, no resulta tan sorprendente.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:259
translate spanish a2s2_bd0f1f61:

    # v "\"I know my brother is an idiot. I did not know he's psychotic.\""
    v "\"Sé que mi hermano es idiota. No sabía que era psicótico.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:260
translate spanish a2s2_c69c49fc:

    # "Now I really bristle."
    "Ahora sí me indigno."

# game/a2s2.rpy:261
translate spanish a2s2_a54a971c:

    # "The idiot thing might be kind of true, but talking about Amicus like this after everything that's happened, while he's sitting in the \"dungeons\", wherever those are, it makes me angry."
    "Lo de idiota quizá tenga algo de verdad, pero hablar así de Amicus después de lo ocurrido, mientras está en las \"mazmorras\", dondequiera que estén, me enfurece."

# game/a2s2.rpy:262
translate spanish a2s2_8c6a0983:

    # m "\"Hey, he had no reason to believe we weren't part of the {i}Galaxias{/i}. The library, or archives, or whatever told him that we were. He just panicked and rushed things when he found out the truth...\""
    m "\"Oye, no tenía motivos para creer que no éramos parte de la {i}Galaxias{/i}. La biblioteca, los archivos o lo que fuera le dijeron que sí. Simplemente entró en pánico y precipitó las cosas al descubrir la verdad...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:264
translate spanish a2s2_91a21646:

    # "Neferu and Virginia stare at me, looking unconvinced."
    "Neferu y Virginia me miran sin parecer convencidos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:265
translate spanish a2s2_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:266
translate spanish a2s2_0c6a8b9b:

    # m "\"So where are the dungeons? Is he okay, can I see him?\""
    m "\"¿Dónde están las mazmorras? ¿Está bien? ¿Puedo verlo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:267
translate spanish a2s2_e24b1a83:

    # "Virginia paces around to the side, staring into the fountain."
    "Virginia se desplaza a un lado, mirando la fuente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:268
translate spanish a2s2_e21865e9:

    # v "\"He was stunned by a drone, but was conscious as he was escorted. The dungeons are under the palace...possibly just under our feet.\""
    v "\"Un dron lo aturdió, pero estaba consciente cuando se lo llevaron. Las mazmorras están bajo el palacio...quizá justo bajo nuestros pies.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:269
translate spanish a2s2_9b72840e:

    # "I look down automatically at the marble floor, picturing the wolf sitting down there."
    "Miro automáticamente el suelo de mármol, imaginándome al lobo sentado ahí abajo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:270
translate spanish a2s2_73c53b2f:

    # m "\"Can I see him?\""
    m "\"¿Puedo verlo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:271
translate spanish a2s2_eb8edf22:

    # v "\"Obviously not. Cato has allowed access only for himself. That authority will pass on to Cassius when he becomes emperor.\""
    v "\"Evidentemente no. Cato solo se ha permitido el acceso a sí mismo. Esa autoridad pasará a Cassius cuando sea emperador.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:272
translate spanish a2s2_24316088:

    # "I continue to stare at the floor."
    "Sigo mirando el suelo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:273
translate spanish a2s2_90c1adf6:

    # "I feel better now that I know that he's at least alive, but I want to see him...I NEED to see him."
    "Me alivia saber que al menos está vivo, pero quiero verlo...NECESITO verlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:274
translate spanish a2s2_ed1c2dfd:

    # v "\"So what do we do now?\""
    v "\"¿Qué hacemos ahora?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:275
translate spanish a2s2_993b3b13:

    # "I look up to see that Virginia's talking to Neferu."
    "Levanto la vista y veo que Virginia habla con Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:277
translate spanish a2s2_65c22092:

    # n "\"I'm working on it. This will take time to sort out.\""
    n "\"Estoy en ello. Resolverlo llevará tiempo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:278
translate spanish a2s2_ac9ba8cc:

    # v "\"And it was all going so well.\""
    v "\"Y todo iba tan bien.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:279
translate spanish a2s2_538511ae:

    # n "\"As it often does before it falls apart.\""
    n "\"Como suele ir antes de venirse abajo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:280
translate spanish a2s2_a4ffe513:

    # m "\"What are you talking about?\""
    m "\"¿De qué habláis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:281
translate spanish a2s2_4181d482:

    # "Virginia glances at me in mild surprise, like she forgot I was there."
    "Virginia me mira algo sorprendida, como si hubiese olvidado mi presencia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:283
translate spanish a2s2_f7667f32:

    # v "\"It does not concern you, [mc]. You look injured, why don't you rest?\""
    v "\"No te incumbe, [mc]. Pareces herido; ¿por qué no descansas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:284
translate spanish a2s2_1950528a:

    # "I stand up."
    "Me levanto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:285
translate spanish a2s2_c7f1b84d:

    # m "\"Look, I think by now you should know that I'm not some idiot slave for you to order around anymore. It was an act. I understand everything you say, and I know all of you have your own little agendas.\""
    m "\"Mira, ya deberías saber que no soy un esclavo idiota al que puedas dar órdenes. Era una actuación. Entiendo todo lo que decís y sé que todos tenéis vuestros propios planes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:286
translate spanish a2s2_1fa05feb:

    # "I see Virginia bristling, but I just don't care anymore."
    "Veo que Virginia se indigna, pero ya no me importa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:287
translate spanish a2s2_71704244:

    # m "\"But honestly, I don't really give a fuck what either of you want. I just want to help Amicus. So if that's part of this plan you're talking about, then I want to know about it.\""
    m "\"Sinceramente, me importa una mierda lo que queráis. Solo quiero ayudar a Amicus. Si eso forma parte del plan del que habláis, quiero saberlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:288
translate spanish a2s2_e95fa0ec:

    # "The two aliens stare at me."
    "Los dos alienígenas me miran."

# game/a2s2.rpy:290
translate spanish a2s2_4faf0456:

    # "Then Neferu starts laughing, but I cut him off."
    "Neferu empieza a reírse, pero lo interrumpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:291
translate spanish a2s2_019176c0:

    # m "\"Stop acting like everything's so fucking amusing to you! This isn't funny. Amicus is in trouble, and even though he put me in this mess, he's the only one I know for sure that gives damn about what happens to me.\""
    m "\"¡Deja de actuar como si todo te hiciera tanta puta gracia! Esto no es divertido. Amicus está en apuros y, aunque me metió en este lío, es el único del que sé con certeza que le importa lo que me pase.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:293
translate spanish a2s2_2917827c:

    # "Thankfully, the Jackal does stop laughing, regarding me with those blue eyes."
    "Por suerte, el chacal deja de reír y me observa con sus ojos azules."

# game/a2s2.rpy:294
translate spanish a2s2_de33c459:

    # n "\"You're right, [mc], I apologize. I was just not expecting such a powerful retort. I like it.\""
    n "\"Tienes razón, [mc]; lo siento. No esperaba una respuesta tan contundente. Me gusta.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:295
translate spanish a2s2_f2e42d7a:

    # "He then turns to Virginia."
    "Luego se vuelve hacia Virginia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:296
translate spanish a2s2_703a6ab8:

    # n "\"He's a part of this as much as we are. I believe he should know what we are up to.\""
    n "\"Forma parte de esto tanto como nosotros. Creo que debe saber qué tramamos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:297
translate spanish a2s2_3d947017:

    # "Virginia sniffs."
    "Virginia resopla."

# game/a2s2.rpy:298
translate spanish a2s2_a1dd1ed5:

    # v "\"Granting him Khemian citizenship seems to have bolstered his boldness. I wonder if that was a mistake.\""
    v "\"Concederle la ciudadanía khemia parece haber aumentado su osadía. Me pregunto si fue un error.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:299
translate spanish a2s2_92c78e39:

    # n "\"It was necessary.\""
    n "\"Era necesario.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:300
translate spanish a2s2_4aa09714:

    # "Neferu then turns to me."
    "Neferu se vuelve hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:301
translate spanish a2s2_7f062213:

    # n "\"[mc], these 'plans' were meant to be set in motion once Amicus became emperor. We both have...interests in Amicus becoming emperor.\""
    n "\"[mc], estos 'planes' debían ponerse en marcha cuando Amicus fuera emperador. Ambos tenemos...intereses en que lo sea.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:302
translate spanish a2s2_40baac0a:

    # n "\"We did not interfere during the trials, but we did plan to begin our work when it was all but confirmed he would become emperor.\""
    n "\"No interferimos durante las pruebas, pero planeábamos empezar nuestro trabajo cuando su ascenso al trono estuviera prácticamente confirmado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:303
translate spanish a2s2_8b60562d:

    # m "\"What 'interests'?\""
    m "\"¿Qué 'intereses'?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:304
translate spanish a2s2_ee4165a4:

    # n "\"Well, it may come as no surprise that I wish to have the alliance. Virginia on the other hand...\""
    n "\"No te sorprenderá que yo quiera la alianza. Virginia, por su parte...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:305
translate spanish a2s2_adaff685:

    # "Neferu glances at her."
    "Neferu la mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:306
translate spanish a2s2_a3e2a6fd:

    # "The wolf barely seems interested and shrugs her shoulders."
    "La loba apenas parece interesada y se encoge de hombros."

# game/a2s2.rpy:307
translate spanish a2s2_553f7fa8:

    # v "\"To be his chief advisor.\""
    v "\"Ser su asesora principal.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:308
translate spanish a2s2_97bc9266:

    # n "\"In the end, we both agreed that Amicus would be best to fulfill both our interests as opposed to Cassius. We simply agreed to help each other accomplish these plans of ours.\""
    n "\"Al final acordamos que Amicus, mejor que Cassius, satisfaría los intereses de ambos. Simplemente decidimos ayudarnos a llevar a cabo nuestros planes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:309
translate spanish a2s2_4bde5c03:

    # "Interests."
    "Intereses."

# game/a2s2.rpy:310
translate spanish a2s2_27ebbcf7:

    # "I guess that's the appropriate word to describe what most relationships hinge on in this stupid empire."
    "Creo que es la palabra adecuada para describir de qué dependen casi todas las relaciones en este estúpido imperio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:311
translate spanish a2s2_b4b747f3:

    # m "\"Do you even care that your brother is in the dungeons?\""
    m "\"¿Te importa siquiera que tu hermano esté en las mazmorras?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:312
translate spanish a2s2_c54eb3a8:

    # "I ask Virginia directly, surprising myself."
    "Se lo pregunto directamente a Virginia, sorprendiéndome a mí mismo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:313
translate spanish a2s2_41b3f785:

    # m "\"Or do you just care about what {i}interests{/i} you?\""
    m "\"¿O solo te importa lo que te {i}interesa{/i}?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:316
translate spanish a2s2_84b40305:

    # "Virginia scoffs at me and Neferu gives me what I can only imagine is a warning look."
    "Virginia se burla de mí y Neferu me lanza lo que solo puedo interpretar como una advertencia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:317
translate spanish a2s2_e6b9b565:

    # v "\"I care deeply about many things. What I don't care for is being lectured by an alien who does not understand the meaning of wolven legacy.\""
    v "\"Muchas cosas me importan profundamente. Lo que no me gusta es recibir lecciones de un alienígena que no entiende el legado de los lobos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:318
translate spanish a2s2_1cad72d0:

    # "I don't say anything and Neferu coughs."
    "No digo nada y Neferu tose."

# game/a2s2.rpy:320
translate spanish a2s2_eb696e60:

    # n "\"Anyway, we have plans to work together to see if there might not be a way to redeem Amicus and place him on the throne.\""
    n "\"En cualquier caso, planeamos trabajar juntos para ver si hay una forma de rehabilitar a Amicus y ponerlo en el trono.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:321
translate spanish a2s2_28a13001:

    # m "\"Already? Wait, did you already have plans to unseat Cassius if he won?\""
    m "\"¿Ya? Espera, ¿ya teníais planes para destronar a Cassius si ganaba?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:323
translate spanish a2s2_fa71c540:

    # n "\"...Yes.\""
    n "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:324
translate spanish a2s2_b3a4f6c6:

    # "I shake my head, realizing just how much of a facade this entire empire really is."
    "Sacudo la cabeza, comprendiendo hasta qué punto todo este imperio es una fachada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:325
translate spanish a2s2_76fe843c:

    # m "\"Well, then I want to help.\""
    m "\"Entonces quiero ayudar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:327
translate spanish a2s2_354b698d:

    # v "\"And what would you be able to do?\""
    v "\"¿Y qué podrías hacer tú?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:328
translate spanish a2s2_570c40ff:

    # "While I never had a problem with Virginia while I was pretending to be a pet, I find talking with her directly to be rather unpleasant."
    "Nunca tuve problemas con Virginia mientras fingía ser una mascota, pero hablarle directamente resulta bastante desagradable."

# game/a2s2.rpy:329
translate spanish a2s2_005488cc:

    # "But I guess it makes sense that she'd be bitter towards me."
    "Aunque supongo que tiene sentido que me guarde rencor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:330
translate spanish a2s2_3ba4dda8:

    # "I'm technically the reason her brother is in the dungeons, and her chance of being advisor is now zero under Cassius."
    "Técnicamente soy la razón de que su hermano esté en las mazmorras y, con Cassius, sus posibilidades de ser asesora son nulas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:331
translate spanish a2s2_fd2775ce:

    # n "\"Virginia may be right, [mc]. You're on unstable ground with Cato and Cassius...the two most powerful wolves on the moon. You should probably stay hidden in my quarters for the foreseeable future.\""
    n "\"Quizá Virginia tenga razón, [mc]. Tu situación con Cato y Cassius es inestable...los dos lobos más poderosos de la luna. Deberías permanecer oculto en mis aposentos por ahora.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:332
translate spanish a2s2_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a2s2.rpy:333
translate spanish a2s2_97be9352:

    # m "\"All day...every day?\""
    m "\"¿Todo el día...todos los días?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:334
translate spanish a2s2_d0c65d3d:

    # n "\"Yes.\""
    n "\"Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:335
translate spanish a2s2_7928cab4:

    # "I don't like the sound of that at all."
    "La idea no me gusta en absoluto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:336
translate spanish a2s2_34b4fbdf:

    # v "\"Well, you could be useful if the third trial was truly staged. Obviously your word won't hold much weight, but if we can find footage to go along with it, we might be able to put a dent in Cato and Cassius's image.\""
    v "\"Podrías ser útil si la tercera prueba fue amañada. Tu palabra tendrá poco peso, pero, si encontramos imágenes que la respalden, quizá podamos dañar la imagen de Cato y Cassius.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:337
translate spanish a2s2_b04dc1fe:

    # "I look at Virginia, but she's already stalking off toward the door."
    "Miro a Virginia, pero ya se dirige airadamente hacia la puerta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:339
translate spanish a2s2_4077e4a8:

    # v "\"Unfortunately, I have to attend a meeting in Cato's stead, for obvious reasons. We'll have to discuss all of this in depth later.\""
    v "\"Por desgracia, debo asistir a una reunión en lugar de Cato, por razones obvias. Tendremos que hablar de todo esto a fondo más tarde.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:340
translate spanish a2s2_9602b926:

    # "As she reaches out for the black panel, I suddenly have an idea."
    "Cuando extiende la mano hacia el panel negro, se me ocurre una idea."

# game/a2s2.rpy:341
translate spanish a2s2_efaba556:

    # m "\"Virginia?\""
    m "\"¿Virginia?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:342
translate spanish a2s2_e1872096:

    # "She doesn't say anything, but her ears perk."
    "No dice nada, pero levanta las orejas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:343
translate spanish a2s2_6bbdd771:

    # m "\"Could you...could you talk to Cassius when he's emperor about letting me see Amicus? I just want to make sure he's okay.\""
    m "\"¿Podrías...hablar con Cassius, cuando sea emperador, para que me deje ver a Amicus? Solo quiero asegurarme de que está bien.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:344
translate spanish a2s2_f2c4d707:

    # "There's a short pause, as the door opens before I see her nod her head."
    "Hay una breve pausa mientras se abre la puerta; después la veo asentir."

# game/a2s2.rpy:345
translate spanish a2s2_4e9cfe0e:

    # v "\"I'll see what can be done.\""
    v "\"Veré qué se puede hacer.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:348
translate spanish a2s2_abb52d0a:

    # "With that, she steps out and the door closes behind her."
    "Con eso sale y la puerta se cierra detrás de ella."

# game/a2s2.rpy:349
translate spanish a2s2_59bde580:

    # "I'm left alone with the jackal, my new...well, not master."
    "Me quedo solo con el chacal, mi nuevo...bueno, no amo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:350
translate spanish a2s2_442e441d:

    # "I guess more of a partner."
    "Más bien un compañero."

# game/a2s2.rpy:351
translate spanish a2s2_88cb6798:

    # "He smirks at me."
    "Me sonríe de medio lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:353
translate spanish a2s2_93d9df43:

    # n "\"Try not to antagonize her too much in the future.\""
    n "\"Procura no enemistarte demasiado con ella en el futuro.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:354
translate spanish a2s2_94dcc097:

    # m "\"She started it.\""
    m "\"Ella empezó.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:355
translate spanish a2s2_0868c412:

    # n "\"I recognize that, and it was wise of you to put your foot down not only with her, but with me as well—\""
    n "\"Lo reconozco; hiciste bien en plantarte tanto ante ella como ante mí—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:356
translate spanish a2s2_c194fb52:

    # n "\"—but she's very, very smart, and it's essential we have her on our side.\""
    n "\"—pero es muy, muy inteligente y es esencial tenerla de nuestro lado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:357
translate spanish a2s2_5098215e:

    # "He's not wrong."
    "No se equivoca."

# game/a2s2.rpy:358
translate spanish a2s2_255036e3:

    # "I realized just before she left that she's basically my only connection to Cato and Cassius, both of whom I'd doubt would want to talk to me."
    "Justo antes de irse comprendí que es prácticamente mi único vínculo con Cato y Cassius; dudo que ninguno de ellos quiera hablar conmigo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:359
translate spanish a2s2_6e90eae3:

    # n "\"Now—\""
    n "\"Ahora—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:360
translate spanish a2s2_ce3e3f99:

    # "The Jackal moves to the door himself, calling over his shoulder."
    "El chacal se dirige a la puerta y me habla por encima del hombro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:361
translate spanish a2s2_dc17fe48:

    # n "\"Unfortunately, I also must take my leave. I'm going to gather a bit of information from the city. I'll be back toward the end of the day. Again, try to stay inside this room. It's locked to everyone but the emperor.\""
    n "\"Por desgracia, yo también debo irme. Voy a recabar información en la ciudad. Volveré al final del día. Insisto: intenta quedarte en esta habitación. Está cerrada para todos salvo el emperador.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:364
translate spanish a2s2_1558f17a:

    # "With that, the jackal leaves the room as well, leaving me alone in the room."
    "El chacal también se marcha y me deja solo en la habitación."

# game/a2s2.rpy:365
translate spanish a2s2_f3994895:

    # "I lay back, wondering how things went so wrong, so fast."
    "Me recuesto, preguntándome cómo todo salió tan mal tan deprisa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:366
translate spanish a2s2_d2c76dec:

    # "I don't like any of this, and just like my first day on this moon, I feel out of place and completely out of my element."
    "No me gusta nada de esto y, como el primer día en esta luna, me siento fuera de lugar y totalmente perdido."

# game/a2s2.rpy:367
translate spanish a2s2_d1cc0a89:

    # "I just wish Amicus were here."
    "Solo desearía que Amicus estuviera aquí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:368
translate spanish a2s2_a33578e0:

    # "I roll over, hugging the pillow as I try to fall asleep."
    "Me giro y abrazo la almohada mientras intento dormirme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:372
translate spanish a2s2_cc37fe39:

    # "The idea of me staying in Neferu's room constantly for the foreseeable future doesn't last long."
    "La idea de quedarme permanentemente en la habitación de Neferu durante un tiempo no dura mucho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:373
translate spanish a2s2_db88b18a:

    # "In fact, a few hours later, I find myself leaving his quarters and wandering the halls of the palace like I have so many times before."
    "De hecho, unas horas después salgo de sus aposentos y recorro los pasillos del palacio, como tantas otras veces."

# game/a2s2.rpy:374
translate spanish a2s2_7b6f6680:

    # "Cato and Cassius probably won't be back for a little while, so I don't really have anything to be worried about as far as I know."
    "Cato y Cassius probablemente tardarán un poco en volver; por lo que sé, no tengo nada que temer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:375
translate spanish a2s2_2c03ddae:

    # "Just as I'm thinking this, I see something out of the corner of my eye."
    "Justo cuando pienso eso, veo algo de reojo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:378
translate spanish a2s2_1e071ed5:

    # "A gray tail, green stripes..."
    "Una cola gris, rayas verdes..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:379
translate spanish a2s2_f830a01c:

    # "Alexios."
    "Alexios."

# game/a2s2.rpy:380
translate spanish a2s2_d5b7a0e8:

    # "Seeing the cat suddenly reminds me of all those suspicions I've been keeping bottled up about him, if only to keep the peace in the palace."
    "Ver al gato me recuerda de pronto todas mis sospechas sobre él, que había contenido aunque solo fuera para mantener la paz del palacio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:381
translate spanish a2s2_1ace3202:

    # "Again, with all that thrown out the window, I find myself fast-walking in Alex's direction, determined to confront him."
    "Ahora que todo eso ha quedado atrás, camino deprisa hacia Alex, decidido a encararlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:382
translate spanish a2s2_4faf68c3:

    # "While I feel like complete shit after what's happened, I also feel completely liberated."
    "Aunque me siento como una mierda después de lo ocurrido, también me siento completamente libre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:383
translate spanish a2s2_83ff813f:

    # "Cat's out of the bag."
    "El gato ya ha salido del saco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:384
translate spanish a2s2_f26006df:

    # "I can basically say whatever I want now."
    "Ahora puedo decir prácticamente lo que quiera."

# game/a2s2.rpy:385
translate spanish a2s2_f2e470f8:

    # "Well...mostly, definitely should still be careful."
    "Bueno...casi; desde luego debo seguir teniendo cuidado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:386
translate spanish a2s2_cabf6a62:

    # "I turn the corner as I'm thinking this and find myself standing just a dozen feet away from the cat, Alex bent over as he waters one of the plants."
    "Doblo la esquina mientras pienso eso y quedo a solo una docena de pies del gato; Alex está inclinado, regando una planta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:389
translate spanish a2s2_def6e2b9:

    # "He's humming again, and he's smiling when he looks up at me."
    "Vuelve a tararear y sonríe al levantar la vista hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:392
translate spanish a2s2_54ee6b45:

    # "That smile immediately vanishes."
    "La sonrisa desaparece al instante."

# game/a2s2.rpy:393
translate spanish a2s2_c18b7a21:

    # "He drops his watering can, sending it and the contents spilling across the floor with a clanging noise."
    "Deja caer la regadera, que se derrama por el suelo con un ruido metálico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:394
translate spanish a2s2_2ca540ef:

    # "He basically lost all chance of looking not-suspicious in the first second he saw me."
    "Prácticamente ha perdido toda posibilidad de parecer inocente en el primer segundo de verme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:395
translate spanish a2s2_374ce464:

    # al "\"Aaah!\""
    al "\"¡Aaah!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:397
translate spanish a2s2_778a256b:

    # al "\"Uh, I mean...ah, [mc], how are you this fine morning?\""
    al "\"Eh, quiero decir...ah, [mc], ¿cómo estás esta hermosa mañana?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:398
translate spanish a2s2_f9e0bab6:

    # m "\"Terrible. What are you doing?\""
    m "\"Fatal. ¿Qué estás haciendo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:400
translate spanish a2s2_3049470f:

    # al "\"Oh! I'm...I'm so sorry to hear that. Are you feeling ill? What happened to your arm?\""
    al "\"¡Oh! Yo...siento mucho oírlo. ¿Te encuentras enfermo? ¿Qué te ha pasado en el brazo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:401
translate spanish a2s2_30469cd8:

    # "Alex's eyes go to the bandage on my bicep, but I ignore him, taking a step forward."
    "Alex mira la venda de mi bíceps, pero lo ignoro y avanzo un paso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:403
translate spanish a2s2_89e4ae61:

    # "In response, he takes one back."
    "Él retrocede uno en respuesta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:404
translate spanish a2s2_19b7a102:

    # m "\"What have you been up to?\""
    m "\"¿Qué has estado tramando?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:405
translate spanish a2s2_e066636a:

    # al "\"Up to?\""
    al "\"¿Tramando?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:406
translate spanish a2s2_f6e1e148:

    # "His eyes dart left and right, as if looking for an escape."
    "Sus ojos van de un lado a otro, como buscando una salida."

# game/a2s2.rpy:407
translate spanish a2s2_cc6375c2:

    # m "\"Telling Neferu about me, telling the triumvirates about what I told you.\""
    m "\"Hablarle de mí a Neferu, contarles a los triunviratos lo que te dije.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:408
translate spanish a2s2_c3b0ad22:

    # "I don't know if he actually did that last one, but his reaction seems to tell me."
    "No sé si realmente hizo lo último, pero su reacción parece confirmarlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:410
translate spanish a2s2_54a8508b:

    # "His eyes widen as he backs away."
    "Abre mucho los ojos mientras retrocede."

# game/a2s2.rpy:411
translate spanish a2s2_f726992e:

    # al "\"I have no idea—\""
    al "\"No tengo ni idea—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:412
translate spanish a2s2_99e758a8:

    # m "\"Did you talk to Cato yesterday, after you saw me in the gardens last night? You realize what's happening right now, right?\""
    m "\"¿Hablaste con Cato ayer, después de verme en los jardines anoche? Sabes lo que está pasando, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:414
translate spanish a2s2_6309bfbd:

    # al "\"[mc], you're scaring me...\""
    al "\"[mc], me estás asustando...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:415
translate spanish a2s2_5b826ac8:

    # "The cat continues to back away."
    "El gato sigue retrocediendo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:416
translate spanish a2s2_c165da08:

    # "I follow, and that's when Alex just gives up on his act, turns tail and sprints down the hall."
    "Lo sigo y entonces Alex abandona la actuación, se da la vuelta y corre por el pasillo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:419
translate spanish a2s2_45a68153:

    # "Before I know it, I'm running after him, eyes focused on his thrashing tail as his sandals slap against the marbled floor."
    "Antes de darme cuenta corro tras él, mirando su cola agitada mientras sus sandalias golpean el mármol."

# game/a2s2.rpy:420
translate spanish a2s2_718cb439:

    # al "\"Stop chasing me! I don't know what you want!\""
    al "\"¡Deja de perseguirme! ¡No sé qué quieres!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:421
translate spanish a2s2_84a97689:

    # "I don't bother responding, starting to reach out to grab the back of his robes."
    "No me molesto en responder; extiendo una mano para agarrarlo por la espalda de la túnica."

# game/a2s2.rpy:422
translate spanish a2s2_6efd6cce:

    # "Just as I make contact though, he comes to a sudden halt, pressing himself against the wall so that I stumble and slide past him."
    "Justo al tocarlo se detiene de golpe y se pega a la pared, haciendo que tropiece y me deslice de largo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:423
translate spanish a2s2_ec06f327:

    # "He's at a door, and he presses his paw to the black panel so that it slides open before he dashes inside."
    "Está junto a una puerta; aprieta el panel negro, la abre y se precipita dentro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:424
translate spanish a2s2_fceb64d5:

    # "I don't think he was really thinking about where he was going to end up, because I know that that's the bathing room, and I know he's trapped."
    "Creo que no pensaba realmente adónde acabaría yendo: sé que ese es el baño y que está atrapado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:426
translate spanish a2s2_2b1c41c6:

    # "I turn around and run inside after him, just in time to see him (still sprinting) slip dramatically on the wet floor, flying through the air for a moment before landing painfully on the corner of the bath."
    "Me vuelvo y entro corriendo tras él, justo a tiempo para verlo, todavía corriendo, resbalar espectacularmente en el suelo mojado, volar un instante y golpearse dolorosamente con una esquina de la bañera."

# game/a2s2.rpy:428
translate spanish a2s2_ba91f865:

    # "I hear him wheeze before he plunges into the hot water."
    "Lo oigo jadear antes de hundirse en el agua caliente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:430
translate spanish a2s2_09f5b56f:

    # "If he lost his breath, it's back as he comes back up with a gasp, letting that all out in a scream of pain."
    "Si había perdido el aliento, lo recupera al salir a la superficie con un jadeo y expulsarlo todo en un grito de dolor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:431
translate spanish a2s2_3dc25a3b:

    # al "\"AHHHH! HOT!\""
    al "\"¡AHHHH! ¡QUEMA!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:432
translate spanish a2s2_8bfac41d:

    # "The cat scrambles out of the water clumsily, scrabbling at the sides with his claws before finally rolling out, looking small and disheveled with his fur all matted up against his skin."
    "El gato intenta salir torpemente, arañando los bordes hasta rodar fuera; parece pequeño y desaliñado, con el pelo pegado a la piel."

# game/a2s2.rpy:433
translate spanish a2s2_c7ceaa49:

    # "He curls up and, to my surprise, I see that he's crying."
    "Se acurruca y, para mi sorpresa, veo que llora."

# game/a2s2.rpy:436
translate spanish a2s2_1ace0cab:

    # "This sight alone is enough to give me some doubts that Alex is the conniving saboteur I think him to be."
    "Solo verlo así basta para hacerme dudar de que Alex sea el saboteador intrigante que creo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:437
translate spanish a2s2_0b0309e9:

    # "He looks so...pathetic right now."
    "Ahora parece tan...patético."

# game/a2s2.rpy:438
translate spanish a2s2_ba8f45c3:

    # "I stand over him for a bit, looking down at his pitiful form before clearing my throat."
    "Me quedo sobre él un rato, mirando su lamentable figura antes de aclararme la garganta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:439
translate spanish a2s2_b8a72137:

    # m "\"Um...you okay?\""
    m "\"Eh...¿estás bien?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:441
translate spanish a2s2_ca4def9d:

    # al "\"Okay!? I think you broke my ribs!\""
    al "\"¡¿Bien?! ¡Creo que me has roto las costillas!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:442
translate spanish a2s2_14eeaaa2:

    # m "\"ME!? You're the one that ran away for no reason!\""
    m "\"¡¿YO?! ¡Tú huiste sin motivo!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:444
translate spanish a2s2_75071334:

    # al "\"No reason? You advanced upon me in a threatening manner!\""
    al "\"¿Sin motivo? ¡Te acercaste de forma amenazadora!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:445
translate spanish a2s2_f907e305:

    # "The cat curls up again and makes some more sobbing noises, and I'm between believing him and believing that he's flat-out faking."
    "El gato se encoge y vuelve a sollozar; no sé si creerlo o pensar que está fingiendo descaradamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:446
translate spanish a2s2_be9ba7e9:

    # m "\"Sit on the bench.\""
    m "\"Siéntate en el banco.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:447
translate spanish a2s2_f64446a3:

    # "I reach down a hand to help him up, but he swats it away."
    "Le ofrezco una mano para ayudarlo a levantarse, pero la aparta de un manotazo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:448
translate spanish a2s2_0cd535bd:

    # "I narrow my eyes."
    "Entrecierro los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:449
translate spanish a2s2_341e0da9:

    # m "\"Answer my questions, Alex.\""
    m "\"Contesta mis preguntas, Alex.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:450
translate spanish a2s2_24993c56:

    # "The cat finally sits up, sniffling and rubbing at his nose while the other paw clutches at his side."
    "El gato por fin se incorpora, sorbiéndose y frotándose la nariz mientras se sujeta el costado con la otra mano."

# game/a2s2.rpy:451
translate spanish a2s2_76005d64:

    # al "\"I have no answers. I'm simply a pet.\""
    al "\"No tengo respuestas. Solo soy una mascota.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:452
translate spanish a2s2_38069bad:

    # "Painfully, Alex gets to his feet before setting himself gingerly on the bench while stripping off his wet robe."
    "Alex se levanta con dolor y se sienta con cuidado en el banco mientras se quita la túnica mojada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:453
translate spanish a2s2_dd61b0d1:

    # m "\"Yeah, and I was simply a pet just yesterday. I'm not as stupid as you think, Alexios.\""
    m "\"Sí, y ayer yo también era solo una mascota. No soy tan estúpido como crees, Alexios.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:455
translate spanish a2s2_f7bb9f54:

    # "Alex looks up at me, that pathetic, sad look replaced by one that I can't really explain."
    "Alex me mira; su expresión patética y triste cambia por otra que no sé explicar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:456
translate spanish a2s2_cb0d52de:

    # "When he remains quiet, I try again."
    "Como sigue callado, vuelvo a intentarlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:457
translate spanish a2s2_3f79192f:

    # m "\"I know everyone has 'interests' here. What are yours...maybe we have the same ones?\""
    m "\"Sé que todos tienen 'intereses' aquí. ¿Cuáles son los tuyos...quizá sean los mismos?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:458
translate spanish a2s2_1d22ebce:

    # al "\"You're not being very subtle, are you?\""
    al "\"No estás siendo muy sutil, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:459
translate spanish a2s2_a1e944a6:

    # m "\"What you did yesterday wasn't subtle at all. Who else would have told Cato that I was conscious again, that me and Amicus are lovers?\""
    m "\"Lo que hiciste ayer no fue nada sutil. ¿Quién más le habría dicho a Cato que estaba consciente otra vez y que Amicus y yo somos amantes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:461
translate spanish a2s2_386573ed:

    # "Alex frowns then shrugs."
    "Alex frunce el ceño y se encoge de hombros."

# game/a2s2.rpy:462
translate spanish a2s2_47e0539f:

    # al "\"How am I supposed to know? I told Cassius last night. He could have told a number of people, especially Cato.\""
    al "\"¿Cómo voy a saberlo? Se lo conté a Cassius anoche. Pudo decírselo a muchas personas, sobre todo a Cato.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:463
translate spanish a2s2_665f9952:

    # "That makes me pause."
    "Eso me hace detenerme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:464
translate spanish a2s2_740e2f16:

    # "Of course Alex talks to Cassius on a regular basis, probably every night."
    "Por supuesto, Alex habla habitualmente con Cassius, probablemente cada noche."

# game/a2s2.rpy:465
translate spanish a2s2_1b70da13:

    # "It would make much more sense that the wolf was the one to tell Cato, rather than Alexios."
    "Tendría mucho más sentido que el lobo se lo contara a Cato, no Alexios."

# game/a2s2.rpy:466
translate spanish a2s2_4defcac6:

    # m "\"But what about the lovers thing? You were the only one that suspected.\""
    m "\"¿Y lo de ser amantes? Solo tú lo sospechabas.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:467
translate spanish a2s2_4c52ffdd:

    # "Well, him and Neferu, but I know Neferu wouldn't tell."
    "Bueno, él y Neferu, pero sé que Neferu no lo contaría."

# game/a2s2.rpy:469
translate spanish a2s2_4aa5c8a8:

    # "Alex scoffs, having taken off his robe and in the process of examining his side."
    "Alex resopla; ya se ha quitado la túnica y está examinándose el costado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:470
translate spanish a2s2_cdb02323:

    # "It looks fine to me, no blood or anything, but he winces as he prods at it."
    "A mí me parece bien, sin sangre ni nada, pero hace una mueca al palparlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:471
translate spanish a2s2_610e406d:

    # al "\"You think it wasn't obvious? It was a prominent rumor ever since the first trial.\""
    al "\"¿Crees que no era obvio? Era un rumor muy conocido desde la primera prueba.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:472
translate spanish a2s2_91907f2b:

    # "That...and I guess Cato did walk in on us in bed together."
    "Eso...y Cato nos sorprendió juntos en la cama."

# game/a2s2.rpy:473
translate spanish a2s2_54d9618a:

    # "I feel my resolve failing a bit, but then I remember Neferu again."
    "Siento flaquear mi determinación, pero vuelvo a recordar a Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:474
translate spanish a2s2_53122dbb:

    # m "\"But Neferu told me that you confessed my intelligence to him...why would you do that?\""
    m "\"Pero Neferu me dijo que le revelaste mi inteligencia...¿por qué harías eso?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:476
translate spanish a2s2_1b242024:

    # "This time the cat's reaction is rather different, his ears blushing as he looks away."
    "Esta vez el gato reacciona de otra manera; las orejas se le sonrojan mientras aparta la vista."

# game/a2s2.rpy:477
translate spanish a2s2_44a6539f:

    # al "\"He was...he was curious about you, and he can be persuasive. I'm sorry I told him, but again I thought it was obvious...and I didn't think he'd tell you.\""
    al "\"Él...tenía curiosidad por ti y sabe ser persuasivo. Lamento habérselo contado, pero creía que era evidente...y no pensé que te lo diría.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:479
translate spanish a2s2_3d303d39:

    # "Alex scowls, massaging his ribs."
    "Alex frunce el ceño mientras se masajea las costillas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:480
translate spanish a2s2_e2120fce:

    # "I glare at the cat, wondering if I'd just made a huge mistake."
    "Miro al gato con severidad, preguntándome si acabo de cometer un enorme error."

# game/a2s2.rpy:481
translate spanish a2s2_4bcc1167:

    # m "\"But...what about the triumvirates. I told you first and then they all suddenly found out somehow.\""
    m "\"Pero...¿y los triunviratos? Te lo conté primero y después, de pronto, todos lo supieron de algún modo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:483
translate spanish a2s2_31a6ccac:

    # "Alex quirks his head."
    "Alex ladea la cabeza."

# game/a2s2.rpy:484
translate spanish a2s2_b11a55ea:

    # al "\"Well, Cassius was discussing it with someone else, wasn't he?\""
    al "\"Cassius hablaba del tema con alguien más, ¿no?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:485
translate spanish a2s2_180a4bd0:

    # "Virginia."
    "Virginia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:486
translate spanish a2s2_b63c568d:

    # al "\"Maybe it was that person?\""
    al "\"¿Quizá fuera esa persona?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:487
translate spanish a2s2_8e9297c9:

    # "Neferu had said they hadn't interfered at all in the trials, and Virginia didn't show any indication that she might have sabotaged her own brother."
    "Neferu había dicho que no interfirieron en las pruebas y Virginia no dio señales de haber saboteado a su hermano."

# game/a2s2.rpy:488
translate spanish a2s2_c0cc995a:

    # "But then again, I have the feeling that she's probably a lot better at acting than anyone else here."
    "Pero también sospecho que ella actúa mucho mejor que cualquiera de aquí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:489
translate spanish a2s2_2d4d4b32:

    # "I know I can't really trust anyone now...except Amicus...and maybe Neferu."
    "Sé que ahora no puedo confiar en nadie...salvo Amicus...y quizá Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:490
translate spanish a2s2_bbf660ba:

    # "I'd been so confident just moments ago, and now I find myself feeling guilty as I watch the sopping wet cat clutch himself, hunched over."
    "Hace unos instantes estaba tan seguro y ahora me siento culpable al ver al gato empapado, encorvado y abrazándose el cuerpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:491
translate spanish a2s2_d3b1a112:

    # "I don't trust him to be telling me the truth, not at all, but I also don't trust myself in being so confident that he's lying."
    "No confío en que diga la verdad, en absoluto, pero tampoco confío en mi propia certeza de que miente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:492
translate spanish a2s2_c37a3bd4:

    # "So, shamefully, I reach out a hand, resting it on his shoulder."
    "Así que, avergonzado, le pongo una mano en el hombro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:493
translate spanish a2s2_75f4b547:

    # "He flinches, then glares up at me."
    "Se sobresalta y me mira con hostilidad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:495
translate spanish a2s2_79ec4dd9:

    # m "\"Sorry...I just thought...I'm just trying to figure out what's happening.\""
    m "\"Perdona...pensaba...solo intento entender lo que ocurre.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:496
translate spanish a2s2_d8bd57d2:

    # "Alex carefully moves my hand off his shoulder, but he doesn't seem all that angry."
    "Alex aparta con cuidado mi mano del hombro, aunque no parece demasiado enfadado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:498
translate spanish a2s2_e788f16b:

    # al "\"That's fine, just...don't do it in such a brutish manner next time. You frightened me.\""
    al "\"Está bien, pero...la próxima vez no seas tan bruto. Me asustaste.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:499
translate spanish a2s2_6960dfed:

    # m "\"Yeah, and sorry about your ribs too, even if you did it to yourself.\""
    m "\"Sí, y siento lo de tus costillas, aunque te lo hicieras tú solo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:500
translate spanish a2s2_713c846c:

    # "Alex probably hears the smile creeping into my voice at the end of the sentence because he glares at me again."
    "Alex probablemente nota la sonrisa que se cuela en mi voz al terminar, porque vuelve a fulminarme con la mirada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:502
translate spanish a2s2_ee37ea5a:

    # al "\"That {i}really{/i} hurt, you know. And now I have to go to the city to see a physician. I'll have to take the awful, bumpy carriage too since Cassius forbids me from flying.\""
    al "\"Eso dolió {i}de verdad{/i}, ¿sabes? Ahora tengo que ir a la ciudad a ver a un médico. Y en ese horrible carruaje lleno de baches, porque Cassius me prohíbe volar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:503
translate spanish a2s2_25f90e96:

    # "Alexios shakes his head."
    "Alexios sacude la cabeza."

# game/a2s2.rpy:504
translate spanish a2s2_567984cf:

    # "I rub my arm awkwardly."
    "Me froto el brazo con incomodidad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:505
translate spanish a2s2_51e734c7:

    # m "\"Why's that?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:506
translate spanish a2s2_0147a4a2:

    # "Alexios looks up at me."
    "Alexios me mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:508
translate spanish a2s2_54dcb6a2:

    # al "\"Ever since his father's ship crashed and the investigation was botched, he's petrified of it.\""
    al "\"Desde que se estrelló la nave de su padre y la investigación se hizo mal, le aterra volar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:509
translate spanish a2s2_23da56fc:

    # m "\"Botched?\""
    m "\"¿Se hizo mal?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:510
translate spanish a2s2_b9240da5:

    # al "\"Yes, so they don't know how it crashed. Odd thing, isn't it?\""
    al "\"Sí, por eso no saben cómo se estrelló. Curioso, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:511
translate spanish a2s2_6bff4e6b:

    # m "\"...Yeah.\""
    m "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:512
translate spanish a2s2_cad81d4d:

    # "Just when I was having my doubts, I get another flare of suspicion as to why he's telling me something like this, but I brush it aside for now."
    "Justo cuando dudaba, vuelve a surgir la sospecha de por qué me cuenta algo así, pero la aparto por ahora."

# game/a2s2.rpy:513
translate spanish a2s2_cc5da70a:

    # m "\"So you know about everything that's happened?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿sabes todo lo que ha pasado?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:514
translate spanish a2s2_f3765cd2:

    # al "\"Vaguely, though I'd rather not be involved. Anyway, I suppose it's not so inconvenient for me that I go. I was meaning to visit Cassius in hospital today anyway.\""
    al "\"Vagamente, aunque prefiero no involucrarme. En fin, tampoco me viene tan mal ir. De todos modos pensaba visitar hoy a Cassius en el hospital.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:515
translate spanish a2s2_53a5ffe1:

    # "The cat stands up, bending down with a grimace to pick up his robes."
    "El gato se levanta y se agacha con una mueca para recoger la túnica."

# game/a2s2.rpy:517
translate spanish a2s2_8cec16e9:

    # al "\"And...I am sorry about what happened to your wolf. I hope you're able to figure it out.\""
    al "\"Y...siento lo que le ocurrió a tu lobo. Espero que puedas resolverlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:519
translate spanish a2s2_803d6e2e:

    # "And with that, the cat walks out of the bathing room, his tail dragging limply behind him."
    "Con eso sale del baño, arrastrando lánguidamente la cola."

# game/a2s2.rpy:520
translate spanish a2s2_4a600b16:

    # "I want to say more to him, to figure out exactly what he's up to."
    "Quiero hablarle más para averiguar exactamente qué trama."

# game/a2s2.rpy:521
translate spanish a2s2_be295f1d:

    # "I might have been wrong about him, but I also don't feel satisfied with his explanations."
    "Puede que me equivocara sobre él, pero sus explicaciones tampoco me satisfacen."

# game/a2s2.rpy:522
translate spanish a2s2_c535c1da:

    # "I can tell now that we're not exactly friends anymore, even before I caused him to shatter his ribs and boil in the hot tub."
    "Ahora veo que ya no somos precisamente amigos, incluso antes de que yo le hiciera romperse las costillas y cocerse en el baño."

# game/a2s2.rpy:523
translate spanish a2s2_dae7b446:

    # "I sit on the bench for a while, thinking about soaking in the bath."
    "Me siento un rato en el banco, pensando en sumergirme en el baño."

# game/a2s2.rpy:524
translate spanish a2s2_3f66df55:

    # "I realize then that the last time I did that was with Amicus, and doing so now, alone, would be way too depressing."
    "Comprendo que la última vez lo hice con Amicus; hacerlo ahora, solo, sería demasiado deprimente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:525
translate spanish a2s2_407fac9b:

    # "I get up and leave, hoping that Virginia took my request seriously."
    "Me levanto y me voy, esperando que Virginia se haya tomado en serio mi petición."

# game/a2s2.rpy:526
translate spanish a2s2_bf60fd8a:

    # "Imagining the wolf below me, alone, is too much to think about."
    "Imaginar al lobo abajo, solo, es demasiado doloroso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:528
translate spanish a2s2_5cc624f3:

    # "So I head back out into the halls, deciding to just go back to Neferu's room and stay there like I'd been told to."
    "Regreso a los pasillos y decido volver a la habitación de Neferu y quedarme allí como me dijeron."

# game/a2s2.rpy:531
translate spanish a2s2_e393d82c:

    # "A few days pass like this."
    "Pasan así unos días."

# game/a2s2.rpy:532
translate spanish a2s2_7b3af0a9:

    # "There's a bizarre calm in the air."
    "Hay una calma extraña en el ambiente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:533
translate spanish a2s2_13dc9331:

    # "The palace is quiet despite the absolute chaos that the top echelon of the empire is in right now."
    "El palacio está silencioso pese al caos absoluto de los altos cargos del imperio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:534
translate spanish a2s2_a69f555a:

    # "In the meantime, Cassius becomes emperor with surprisingly little fanfare."
    "Mientras tanto, Cassius se convierte en emperador con una ceremonia sorprendentemente discreta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:535
translate spanish a2s2_16b242db:

    # "I watch it on the screens, the young white wolf's right leg and left arm in casts (which is explained several times to have happened in the third trial) as he's coroneted by Cato, who is now missing his visor."
    "Lo veo en las pantallas: el joven lobo blanco tiene la pierna derecha y el brazo izquierdo escayolados —explican varias veces que ocurrió en la tercera prueba— mientras Cato, ya sin visor, lo corona."

# game/a2s2.rpy:536
translate spanish a2s2_4f6f2bd3:

    # "That isn't explained to the viewers at all."
    "Eso no se explica en absoluto a los espectadores."

# game/a2s2.rpy:537
translate spanish a2s2_6a53447f:

    # "I don't feel much as this happens."
    "No siento gran cosa mientras ocurre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:538
translate spanish a2s2_d1b504a2:

    # "Realizing how...fake all of this is, how it doesn't seem to mean anything despite how much I'm told it means—"
    "Comprender lo...falso que es todo, cómo parece no significar nada pese a lo mucho que insisten en su importancia—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:539
translate spanish a2s2_f2b2c71a:

    # "—It's all theatrics."
    "—Todo es teatro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:540
translate spanish a2s2_e62e580d:

    # "What matters most now is taking the two of them down, and getting Amicus up and out from that dungeon."
    "Ahora lo más importante es derribar a ambos y sacar a Amicus de esa mazmorra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:541
translate spanish a2s2_b2ad53b9:

    # "Even now, I'm not really thinking about getting home despite the fact that the Stretch Drive {i}should{/i} be returning at any moment now, if it hasn't already."
    "Ni siquiera ahora pienso mucho en volver a casa, aunque la Propulsión Dilatatoria {i}debería{/i} estar disponible de nuevo en cualquier momento, si no lo está ya."

# game/a2s2.rpy:542
translate spanish a2s2_429d9cf1:

    # "There are bigger things at stake here, the main one being my best friend's life."
    "Hay cosas mayores en juego, principalmente la vida de mi mejor amigo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:543
translate spanish a2s2_ed95eb50:

    # "And that's why on the third day after the fake trial, I find myself eagerly involving myself in a discussion with Neferu as he tells me his plans."
    "Por eso, al tercer día de la prueba amañada, participo con entusiasmo en una conversación con Neferu mientras me cuenta sus planes."

# game/a2s2.rpy:544
translate spanish a2s2_a0c3c2a2:

    # "Cato is due back in the palace that day, and we both suspect he'll be making a trip to our room."
    "Cato regresará al palacio ese día y ambos sospechamos que visitará nuestra habitación."

# game/a2s2.rpy:548
translate spanish a2s2_e7052c68:

    # n "\"So the most important thing to the wolves is drama, a scene, something memorable. That's all they seem to care about around here.\""
    n "\"Para los lobos lo más importante es el drama, una escena, algo memorable. Parece lo único que les importa aquí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:550
translate spanish a2s2_947f4089:

    # "Neferu sniffs dismissively as he sips at his wine, and I find myself starting to see why Amicus might find him so irritating."
    "Neferu resopla con desdén mientras bebe vino; empiezo a entender por qué puede resultar tan irritante para Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:551
translate spanish a2s2_8caa68d7:

    # "Not that he's wrong though, and I usually find myself agreeing with him."
    "Aunque no se equivoca y suelo estar de acuerdo con él."

# game/a2s2.rpy:552
translate spanish a2s2_d7ca4a8a:

    # m "\"So...make a scene that makes Cato and Cassius look bad?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿montar una escena que deje mal a Cato y Cassius?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:553
translate spanish a2s2_6c77ce37:

    # n "\"Well, most importantly we need to find...or even make up information about them that will irreparably damage their reputation in the public sphere.\""
    n "\"Lo principal es encontrar...o incluso inventar información que dañe irreparablemente su reputación pública.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:554
translate spanish a2s2_ce754e61:

    # m "\"Like what Cassius did to Amicus during the second trial?\""
    m "\"¿Como lo que Cassius hizo a Amicus en la segunda prueba?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:556
translate spanish a2s2_f93f2b76:

    # "Neferu smirks."
    "Neferu sonríe de medio lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:557
translate spanish a2s2_4d519c10:

    # n "\"Even worse than that, [mc], preferably something that shows disloyalty, or insults the pride of the wolves in general. That is something they often can't look past.\""
    n "\"Aún peor, [mc]; preferiblemente algo que revele deslealtad o hiera el orgullo de los lobos en general. Eso suele ser algo que no pueden pasar por alto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:558
translate spanish a2s2_33a9c7bd:

    # m "\"Didn't Amicus having sex with you show disloyalty...or hurt their pride?\""
    m "\"¿Que Amicus tuviera sexo contigo no mostró deslealtad...o hirió su orgullo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:560
translate spanish a2s2_ec35e7f1:

    # "Neferu waves his paw dismissively in the air."
    "Neferu agita una mano con desdén."

# game/a2s2.rpy:561
translate spanish a2s2_9593d90e:

    # n "\"No, it's been established amongst the public that he was simply furthering his goal of an alliance with my species, which was completely in line with his character.\""
    n "\"No; el público entiende que solo avanzaba hacia su objetivo de una alianza con mi especie, algo completamente coherente con su carácter.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:563
translate spanish a2s2_19ef8b35:

    # n "\"As for pride, well, he wasn't the one raising his tail.\""
    n "\"Y en cuanto al orgullo, él no era quien levantaba la cola.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:564
translate spanish a2s2_3f739ce1_1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:565
translate spanish a2s2_8623f08a:

    # m "\"So we need something about Cassius and Cato that's out of their character?\""
    m "\"¿Necesitamos algo de Cassius y Cato que no encaje con su carácter?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:566
translate spanish a2s2_ff99e2b0:

    # n "\"Yes, something that shows them to be not who they say they are. The public must distrust them.\""
    n "\"Sí, algo que demuestre que no son quienes dicen ser. El público debe desconfiar de ellos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:568
translate spanish a2s2_21067664:

    # "Neferu strokes his chin."
    "Neferu se acaricia la barbilla."

# game/a2s2.rpy:569
translate spanish a2s2_76d348b2:

    # n "\"Would be convenient to have all that footage that Virginia was talking about, but considering how secure it might be, that could be impossible.\""
    n "\"Sería conveniente tener las grabaciones que mencionó Virginia, pero quizá sea imposible por lo bien protegidas que puedan estar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:570
translate spanish a2s2_0b07a1af:

    # m "\"Worth trying to get though.\""
    m "\"Aun así, vale la pena intentar conseguirlas.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:571
translate spanish a2s2_efdf166c:

    # n "\"Yes, I'll have to discuss that further with Virginia.\""
    n "\"Sí, tendré que hablar más del tema con Virginia.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:572
translate spanish a2s2_0bb958dd:

    # m "\"So...what should I be doing?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿qué debería hacer yo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:573
translate spanish a2s2_62bce323:

    # "While it feels good to {i}talk{/i} about what can be done to help Amicus, I personally want to {i}do{/i} something."
    "Aunque está bien {i}hablar{/i} de cómo ayudar a Amicus, yo quiero {i}hacer{/i} algo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:574
translate spanish a2s2_b64ec806:

    # "Neferu pauses, then smiles at me."
    "Neferu hace una pausa y me sonríe."

# game/a2s2.rpy:576
translate spanish a2s2_972a01a0:

    # n "\"[mc], my duty is to not put you in danger, as I've said. I won't have you—\""
    n "\"[mc], como dije, mi deber es no ponerte en peligro. No permitiré que—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:577
translate spanish a2s2_8b534487:

    # m "\"Well, I don't care. I need to help. I'll do whatever I have to do.\""
    m "\"No me importa. Necesito ayudar. Haré lo que tenga que hacer.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:579
translate spanish a2s2_cb251dd7:

    # "Neferu raises an eyebrow at me."
    "Neferu arquea una ceja."

# game/a2s2.rpy:580
translate spanish a2s2_e8900594:

    # n "\"Oh yes? Even if it might risk your own life? Cato is only barely tolerating the protective line that being a Khemian citizen affords you. I would not push him further.\""
    n "\"¿Ah, sí? ¿Aunque arriesgues tu vida? Cato apenas tolera la protección de tu ciudadanía khemia. Yo no lo provocaría más.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:581
translate spanish a2s2_e98119fb:

    # m "\"Then I'll do things behind the scenes. I don't care, I just want to do {i}something{/i}.\""
    m "\"Entonces actuaré entre bastidores. Me da igual; solo quiero hacer {i}algo{/i}.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:582
translate spanish a2s2_32a0b6df:

    # "Neferu sighs deeply."
    "Neferu suspira profundamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:584
translate spanish a2s2_68f8d597:

    # n "\"We'll see. Just keep in mind that the most important thing to Amicus is that you stay alive. That's what you can do that will help him the most.\""
    n "\"Ya veremos. Recuerda que para Amicus lo más importante es que sigas vivo. Eso es lo que puedes hacer para ayudarlo más.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:585
translate spanish a2s2_0a1dfa8a:

    # "I take that in, still not fully convinced that there's nothing I can do."
    "Lo asimilo, sin estar del todo convencido de que no pueda hacer nada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:587
translate spanish a2s2_e860a6a9:

    # n "\"But I'll certainly let you know if I believe there's a way for you to help. As for me, my status leaves me untouchable, unless Cato wants to risk another war, which I guarantee you he does not.\""
    n "\"Pero te avisaré si creo que puedes ayudar. Mi posición me hace intocable, salvo que Cato quiera arriesgarse a otra guerra; te garantizo que no quiere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:588
translate spanish a2s2_8e11c874:

    # m "\"I'd imagine. He has first-hand experience.\""
    m "\"Me lo imagino. Tiene experiencia de primera mano.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:589
translate spanish a2s2_e4456107:

    # n "\"Indeed.\""
    n "\"Así es.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:591
translate spanish a2s2_823fa6e7:

    # com "\"Neferu, Cato wishes to enter your quarters.\""
    com "\"Neferu, Cato desea entrar en tus aposentos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:592
translate spanish a2s2_1350736e:

    # "I jump, wondering if the walls are thin enough for the old wolf to have heard us."
    "Doy un salto y me pregunto si las paredes serán lo bastante finas para que el viejo lobo nos haya oído."

# game/a2s2.rpy:593
translate spanish a2s2_359145d8:

    # "Neferu doesn't seem surprised though."
    "Neferu no parece sorprendido."

# game/a2s2.rpy:594
translate spanish a2s2_44be1822:

    # n "\"Ah, as we expected. Com, please tell him to hold for a moment. I'm in the nude.\""
    n "\"Ah, como esperábamos. Com, dile que espere un momento, por favor. Estoy desnudo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:595
translate spanish a2s2_3fa27c24_1:

    # com "\"Yes, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Sí, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:596
translate spanish a2s2_6a0b1014:

    # "Neferu looks at me."
    "Neferu me mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:598
translate spanish a2s2_2ab1c2ca:

    # n "\"I suppose our mission starts now. I have my own drone recording in the corner there, hopefully to catch the old man saying something incriminating.\""
    n "\"Supongo que la misión comienza ahora. Mi dron está grabando en esa esquina; espero captar al viejo diciendo algo incriminatorio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:599
translate spanish a2s2_fb7498bc:

    # n "\"What I'd like you to do is to crouch behind those bushes, keep hidden and quiet.\""
    n "\"Quiero que te agaches tras esos arbustos y te quedes oculto y callado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:600
translate spanish a2s2_22e1f324:

    # m "\"What? I thought I was supposed to be involv—\""
    m "\"¿Qué? Pensaba que iba a partici—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:601
translate spanish a2s2_7d5ebf16:

    # n "\"You will be, but I'd rather he not filter himself because of you.\""
    n "\"Participarás, pero prefiero que no se contenga por tu presencia.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:602
translate spanish a2s2_b26feabb:

    # "I hesitate for a second, then quickly do as I'm told, even though I do feel bitter at the feeling of being tossed aside once again."
    "Vacilo un segundo y obedezco deprisa, aunque me amarga sentir que vuelven a dejarme de lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:604
translate spanish a2s2_6d86b2c8:

    # ca "\"Neferu, I will override the security again if you do not—\""
    ca "\"Neferu, volveré a anular la seguridad si no—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:605
translate spanish a2s2_e45d8975:

    # "Cato's voice crackles over the speakers, but that's when the jackal opens the door, and for a moment, his voice comes from two places at once."
    "La voz de Cato crepita por los altavoces, pero el chacal abre entonces la puerta y, por un momento, su voz viene de dos lugares a la vez."

# game/a2s2.rpy:606
translate spanish a2s2_89d8e88e:

    # "I'm pretty well hidden behind a few trees and bushes, my surroundings dark enough that I'm pretty sure Cato wouldn't be able to see me through the leaves and twigs I'm peeking through."
    "Estoy bien oculto tras unos árboles y arbustos; la oscuridad alrededor me hace casi seguro de que Cato no me verá entre las hojas y ramitas por las que miro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:607
translate spanish a2s2_013aa70c:

    # "The two males stand awkwardly across from each other before Cato suddenly strides in, forcing the jackal to step aside, though Neferu keeps that smug smile on his face."
    "Los dos machos se quedan incómodamente frente a frente; Cato entra de pronto con paso decidido y obliga al chacal a apartarse, aunque Neferu conserva su sonrisa engreída."

# game/a2s2.rpy:609
translate spanish a2s2_28f9d232:

    # n "\"What a pleasure it is for you to visit me today.\""
    n "\"Qué placer que me visites hoy.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:610
translate spanish a2s2_db7eddf8:

    # "As Cato walks in, I get a look at his face for the first time."
    "Al entrar Cato, veo su rostro por primera vez."

# game/a2s2.rpy:612
translate spanish a2s2_43d69664:

    # "I'd seen that he lacked his visor in the broadcast, but seeing it up close..."
    "Ya había visto en la transmisión que no tenía visor, pero verlo de cerca..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:613
translate spanish a2s2_97434863:

    # "The stern looks I'd always imagined under his now-broken machinery is definitely there."
    "La severidad que siempre imaginé bajo su maquinaria, ahora rota, está claramente ahí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:614
translate spanish a2s2_2218f92c:

    # "His eyes have a milky, gray quality to them, heavily scarred."
    "Sus ojos son grisáceos y lechosos, muy marcados por cicatrices."

# game/a2s2.rpy:615
translate spanish a2s2_9b9d6a7f:

    # "The old wolf stops just in front of the fountain, his ears perked up high."
    "El viejo lobo se detiene justo ante la fuente, con las orejas muy levantadas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:616
translate spanish a2s2_43432064:

    # "I wonder if he can see anything at all, and Neferu asks just that."
    "Me pregunto si ve algo; Neferu pregunta eso mismo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:618
translate spanish a2s2_d966e5e5:

    # n "\"How is your sight, Your Former Highness?\""
    n "\"¿Cómo está tu vista, Su Antigua Alteza?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:619
translate spanish a2s2_c355d82d:

    # "I see one of those ears twitch before the wolf slowly turns around."
    "Veo moverse una oreja antes de que el lobo se vuelva despacio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:621
translate spanish a2s2_d068ce07:

    # ca "\"Non-existent, young prince.\""
    ca "\"Inexistente, joven príncipe.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:622
translate spanish a2s2_666e96b7:

    # n "\"Oh please, just call me Nef—\""
    n "\"Oh, por favor, llámame Nef—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:623
translate spanish a2s2_9e1d0a9d:

    # ca "\"Where is the alien?\""
    ca "\"¿Dónde está el alienígena?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:624
translate spanish a2s2_9064acb9:

    # "Neferu pauses."
    "Neferu se detiene."

# game/a2s2.rpy:626
translate spanish a2s2_55c4bea0:

    # n "\"Alex? Or do you mean—\""
    n "\"¿Alex? ¿O te refieres a—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:627
translate spanish a2s2_32da7a70:

    # ca "\"You know damn well who I'm referring to, jackal.\""
    ca "\"Sabes perfectamente a quién me refiero, chacal.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:628
translate spanish a2s2_9c769902:

    # "Neferu raises his paws defensively, even though Cato can't see."
    "Neferu alza las manos defensivamente, aunque Cato no pueda verlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:630
translate spanish a2s2_196b4dd9:

    # n "\"Apologies, Cato. [mc] told me he would be in the gardens doing landscaping work.\""
    n "\"Perdona, Cato. [mc] dijo que estaría trabajando en los jardines.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:631
translate spanish a2s2_33b5c5e5:

    # "Cato snorts."
    "Cato resopla."

# game/a2s2.rpy:633
translate spanish a2s2_2a5c8d76:

    # ca "\"I didn't hear him out there.\""
    ca "\"No lo he oído ahí fuera.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:635
translate spanish a2s2_5f541b5a:

    # n "\"It is a rather large garden. A very beautiful one as well.\""
    n "\"El jardín es bastante grande. Y muy hermoso.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:637
translate spanish a2s2_d7ba8ad3:

    # "Cato doesn't respond, instead staring about the room."
    "Cato no responde; mira alrededor de la habitación."

# game/a2s2.rpy:639
translate spanish a2s2_4c3d52d9:

    # n "\"Would you like some wine?\""
    n "\"¿Quieres vino?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:640
translate spanish a2s2_14f0b3a7:

    # "Neferu gestures at the bedside table, picking up his own goblet to take a sip...loudly."
    "Neferu señala la mesilla y levanta su copa para beber...ruidosamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:641
translate spanish a2s2_a8e34772:

    # "I see Cato's ears twitch again before he turns to the jackal."
    "Veo moverse de nuevo las orejas de Cato antes de que se vuelva hacia el chacal."

# game/a2s2.rpy:642
translate spanish a2s2_7d2c921b:

    # ca "\"What is your plan with the alien?\""
    ca "\"¿Qué planeas hacer con el alienígena?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:643
translate spanish a2s2_19355011:

    # "Neferu frowns."
    "Neferu frunce el ceño."

# game/a2s2.rpy:645
translate spanish a2s2_8e868ae6:

    # n "\"Plan?\""
    n "\"¿Planear?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:649
translate spanish a2s2_00715c79:

    # ca "\"Do not ever play games with me. That will be my only warning to you jackal.\""
    ca "\"Nunca juegues conmigo. Será mi única advertencia, chacal.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:651
translate spanish a2s2_51c567ae:

    # "Cato's voice is so cold and ominous that even Neferu's grin wavers, but he recovers quickly, taking another loud slurp of wine."
    "La voz de Cato es tan fría y amenazante que incluso la sonrisa de Neferu vacila, pero se repone deprisa y da otro sorbo ruidoso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:653
translate spanish a2s2_9bca9df2:

    # n "\"Mmh, such good wine. One of the few superior products your people produce. Now, as for [mc], I'm simply fulfilling a promise to Amicus.\""
    n "\"Mmh, qué buen vino. Uno de los pocos productos superiores que hace tu pueblo. Sobre [mc], solo cumplo una promesa a Amicus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:655
translate spanish a2s2_03756327:

    # ca "\"I see. That wasn't so hard to tell me then, was it?\""
    ca "\"Ya veo. No era tan difícil decírmelo, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:656
translate spanish a2s2_e5dd1961:

    # n "\"Speaking of, quite astonishing that he was so easily beaten by Cassius, of all people.\""
    n "\"Hablando de él, sorprende que lo derrotara tan fácilmente nada menos que Cassius.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:657
translate spanish a2s2_49112564:

    # ca "\"Quite.\""
    ca "\"Mucho.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:658
translate spanish a2s2_4ff94688:

    # n "\"I wonder how he was able to accomplish such a feat.\""
    n "\"Me pregunto cómo logró tal hazaña.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:659
translate spanish a2s2_9b0afdd0:

    # ca "\"It was broadcast. You would have been able to see it.\""
    ca "\"Se transmitió. Podrías haberlo visto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:660
translate spanish a2s2_52b6518c:

    # n "\"Ah, well, I don't watch Adastran broadcasts; too much melodrama and propaganda for my tastes.\""
    n "\"No veo las transmisiones adastranas: demasiado melodrama y propaganda para mi gusto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:661
translate spanish a2s2_e15ad2b9:

    # ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} is a combination of skill and luck, and it's not always the strongest that wins.\""
    ca "\"El {i}Pugnu{/i} combina habilidad y suerte; no siempre gana el más fuerte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:663
translate spanish a2s2_d8820af9:

    # n "\"Of course. Though I have to wonder...might any of that luck have been, well...manufactured?\""
    n "\"Por supuesto. Aunque me pregunto...¿pudo parte de esa suerte ser...fabricada?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:664
translate spanish a2s2_7881f3ba:

    # "Cato is silent for a moment."
    "Cato calla un momento."

# game/a2s2.rpy:665
translate spanish a2s2_9ee7aa7c:

    # "Cato being silent is when you know that something is very wrong."
    "Cuando Cato calla, sabes que algo va muy mal."

# game/a2s2.rpy:667
translate spanish a2s2_1d3b7c36:

    # ca "\"Are you implying something, jackal?\""
    ca "\"¿Insinúas algo, chacal?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:669
translate spanish a2s2_d92e77ec:

    # n "\"Oh no, I'm simply curious. I came to study the politics and workings of the empire while also trying to improve relations between our species. I feel knowing all the facets of wolven politics is important.\""
    n "\"No, solo tengo curiosidad. Vine a estudiar la política y el funcionamiento del imperio y a mejorar las relaciones entre nuestras especies. Creo importante conocer todas las facetas de la política de los lobos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:670
translate spanish a2s2_f031b388:

    # "Cato sneers."
    "Cato hace una mueca de desprecio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:672
translate spanish a2s2_5a844cb7:

    # ca "\"There's a fine line between studying and spying here.\""
    ca "\"Aquí la línea entre estudiar y espiar es muy fina.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:673
translate spanish a2s2_adaeddad_1:

    # "Neferu chuckles."
    "Neferu suelta una risita."

# game/a2s2.rpy:675
translate spanish a2s2_286ef92a:

    # n "\"Well, what I do know is that you wolves often go about things in a theatrical fashion, and it's sometimes hard to tell what's real or not. I assumed the fight to be, well...somewhat staged.\""
    n "\"Sé que los lobos soléis actuar de forma teatral y a veces cuesta distinguir lo real. Supuse que el combate estaba...algo amañado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:676
translate spanish a2s2_5e0b83c6:

    # ca "\"Heh.\""
    ca "\"Je.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:677
translate spanish a2s2_61322697:

    # "Cato chuckles, and immediately I know that Neferu is making a lot of mistakes here."
    "Cato se ríe y sé inmediatamente que Neferu está cometiendo muchos errores."

# game/a2s2.rpy:678
translate spanish a2s2_27758e99:

    # "I'm not sure what his plan is, maybe he'd thought that Cato would be more friendly with him, or that he could lull the old wolf into a false sense of security somehow."
    "No sé qué planea; quizá pensó que Cato sería más amable o que podría darle al viejo lobo una falsa sensación de seguridad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:679
translate spanish a2s2_5b52700b:

    # "Maybe he's just trying to feel the old man out."
    "Quizá solo intenta sondearlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:680
translate spanish a2s2_733bb542:

    # "I also get the feeling that maybe he shouldn't have had all that wine before doing this."
    "También siento que quizá no debería haber bebido tanto vino antes."

# game/a2s2.rpy:681
translate spanish a2s2_ed0f0d91:

    # "His suave, care-free attitude works on most, either to charm, or to annoy, but Cato is not someone I feel it will work particularly well on."
    "Su actitud elegante y despreocupada funciona con casi todos, ya sea para encantarlos o irritarlos, pero no creo que resulte muy eficaz con Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:682
translate spanish a2s2_b8cbc92e:

    # "Either way, it's clear Cato knows exactly what's happening."
    "En cualquier caso, está claro que Cato sabe exactamente qué pasa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:683
translate spanish a2s2_6b6e68ce:

    # ca "\"I know Khemians pride themselves on their own intelligence, but I have to wonder why considering your extreme stupidity.\""
    ca "\"Sé que los khemios presumen de inteligencia, pero me pregunto por qué, viendo tu extrema estupidez.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:685
translate spanish a2s2_e7179fa0:

    # n "\"Oh?\""
    n "\"¿Ah, sí?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:686
translate spanish a2s2_41dcd7f3:

    # "Neferu casually sloshes his wine about in his goblet."
    "Neferu mueve despreocupadamente el vino en su copa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:687
translate spanish a2s2_f4668fea:

    # ca "\"Your arrogance amazes me, young one. I know you were fortunate enough to have been birthed after the war, but it's as if you were never taught the history between our peoples.\""
    ca "\"Tu arrogancia me asombra, joven. Sé que tuviste la suerte de nacer después de la guerra, pero parece que nunca te enseñaron la historia de nuestros pueblos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:688
translate spanish a2s2_cac15ba2:

    # n "\"I've spent countless hours studying this history, Cato, and that's mostly why I'm here.\""
    n "\"He pasado incontables horas estudiándola, Cato. Principalmente por eso estoy aquí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:689
translate spanish a2s2_5ab60353:

    # ca "\"Mostly. It seems the rest of that reason is to fuck with the delicate balance our empire is currently in.\""
    ca "\"Principalmente. El resto parece ser joder el delicado equilibrio de nuestro imperio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:691
translate spanish a2s2_29890f9c:

    # n "\"Certainly not. I am merely an observer.\""
    n "\"En absoluto. Solo soy un observador.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:692
translate spanish a2s2_c9cc744f:

    # "I want to tell Neferu to shut up, to just tell Cato to go look for me out in the gardens, or something."
    "Quiero decirle a Neferu que se calle y mande a Cato a buscarme a los jardines o algo así."

# game/a2s2.rpy:693
translate spanish a2s2_7bbb9892:

    # "I can see the hackles on Cato's shoulders rising, and I can only hope that the jackal was right about being untouchable."
    "Veo erizarse el pelo de los hombros de Cato; solo puedo esperar que el chacal tuviera razón al decir que era intocable."

# game/a2s2.rpy:694
translate spanish a2s2_d6451289:

    # ca "\"I know I offered you to stay in this palace as long as you pleased, and I never withdraw an offer without good reason, but have you thought of moving out to the city? There are many more accommodations out there.\""
    ca "\"Te ofrecí quedarte cuanto quisieras y nunca retiro una oferta sin buen motivo, pero ¿has pensado en mudarte a la ciudad? Hay muchos más alojamientos allí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:696
translate spanish a2s2_7c164873:

    # n "\"Oh, no thank you. I much prefer it here. Everyone is so...interesting.\""
    n "\"No, gracias. Prefiero mucho más estar aquí. Todos son tan...interesantes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:697
translate spanish a2s2_105d7592:

    # ca "\"Heh, it is just like a Khemian to take full advantage of a wolf's tolerance.\""
    ca "\"Je, típico de un khemio aprovecharse al máximo de la tolerancia de un lobo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:698
translate spanish a2s2_d56e9c5b:

    # "Neferu quirks an eyebrow."
    "Neferu levanta una ceja."

# game/a2s2.rpy:700
translate spanish a2s2_b6d6fe1b:

    # n "\"Tolerance? Not a word I often associate with a wolf.\""
    n "\"¿Tolerancia? No suelo asociar esa palabra con los lobos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:701
translate spanish a2s2_bb5325b6:

    # "I can tell that Neferu's losing his cool as well."
    "Veo que Neferu también está perdiendo la calma."

# game/a2s2.rpy:703
translate spanish a2s2_72ed3674:

    # ca "\"Our tolerance for your arrogance was unprecedented.\""
    ca "\"Nuestra tolerancia hacia vuestra arrogancia no tenía precedentes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:704
translate spanish a2s2_244e0b9d:

    # "Neferu seems confused for a moment."
    "Neferu parece confundido un momento."

# game/a2s2.rpy:705
translate spanish a2s2_ec88dc44:

    # n "\"Oh, are you referring to the war? I'm sorry, we're quite a bit more blunt where I'm from, so I did not realize what you were getting at.\""
    n "\"¿Te refieres a la guerra? Perdona; de donde vengo somos más directos, así que no entendí adónde querías llegar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:707
translate spanish a2s2_f93f2b76_1:

    # "Neferu smirks."
    "Neferu sonríe de medio lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:708
translate spanish a2s2_f38003bb:

    # n "\"For a moment, I thought you were coming on to me much like Amicus did.\""
    n "\"Por un momento creí que te insinuabas, como hizo Amicus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:710
translate spanish a2s2_53bb83f7:

    # "Defnitely too much to drink, or this jackal is a lot crazier than I thought he was."
    "Ha bebido demasiado, desde luego; o este chacal está mucho más loco de lo que creía."

# game/a2s2.rpy:711
translate spanish a2s2_5eb26e84:

    # n "\"You wolves tend to be aggressive like th-GRK!\""
    n "\"Los lobos soléis ser agresivos de esa for-GRK!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:717
translate spanish a2s2_3e35f0d7:

    # "Cato becomes a blur, closing the five foot distance between the two of them in less than a second."
    "Cato se vuelve una mancha borrosa y cruza los cinco pies que los separan en menos de un segundo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:719
translate spanish a2s2_cb6075bb:

    # "The next thing I know, Cato has the jackal up against one of the pillars, slamming Neferu so hard against it that I see the plaster crack and fall away."
    "Al instante tiene al chacal contra una columna; golpea a Neferu con tanta fuerza que veo agrietarse y caer el yeso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:720
translate spanish a2s2_339f987f:

    # "Neferu gasps loudly, kicking out at Cato a few times as he struggles with the old wolf's thick arms."
    "Neferu jadea con fuerza y lanza varias patadas a Cato mientras forcejea con los gruesos brazos del viejo lobo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:721
translate spanish a2s2_b8f7df3d:

    # n "\"G—get...off!\""
    n "\"¡S—suélta...me!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:722
translate spanish a2s2_7fa384f1:

    # "Neferu kicks out again, this time at Cato's groin."
    "Neferu vuelve a lanzar una patada, esta vez a la entrepierna de Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:723
translate spanish a2s2_f11567ec:

    # "If the old wolf felt anything, he doesn't show it, instead holding Neferu tightly in place while he snarls in his face."
    "Si el viejo lobo siente algo, no lo demuestra; mantiene a Neferu inmóvil y le gruñe a la cara."

# game/a2s2.rpy:724
translate spanish a2s2_098399bf:

    # ca "\"Speaking of tolerance...I have tolerated YOUR arrogance for far too long...just because you are the Pharaoh's son.\""
    ca "\"Hablando de tolerancia...he tolerado TU arrogancia demasiado tiempo...solo por ser hijo del faraón.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:725
translate spanish a2s2_2a2569bd:

    # ca "\"The {i}second{/i} son, and of a ruler who has so little power over his kingdom in the first place. I shouldn't be surprised—\""
    ca "\"El {i}segundo{/i} hijo, además, de un gobernante que apenas controla su propio reino. No debería sorprenderme—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:727
translate spanish a2s2_0566bb53:

    # "Cato pulls Neferu forward then slams him back against the pillar again, causing more plaster to fall and the jackal's teeth to clack together loud enough that I can hear it."
    "Cato tira de Neferu hacia delante y lo golpea otra vez contra la columna; cae más yeso y los dientes del chacal chocan tan fuerte que los oigo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:728
translate spanish a2s2_622a6b0e:

    # ca "\"You're all the fucking same, every single one of you, but somehow you're the worst I've yet to meet.\""
    ca "\"Sois todos iguales, joder, cada uno de vosotros; pero tú eres el peor que he conocido.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:730
translate spanish a2s2_16d6610c:

    # "Again, Cato slams Neferu against the pillar, and I start to stand up, wishing I had a nervo."
    "Cato vuelve a golpearlo contra la columna y empiezo a levantarme, deseando tener un nervo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:731
translate spanish a2s2_0e9fbcdf:

    # "Neferu growls, trying another kick."
    "Neferu gruñe e intenta otra patada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:732
translate spanish a2s2_25c58b11:

    # ca "\"Is this the next generation of Khemian we must deal with? I know you weren't alive for the war, but it seems another one is inevitable if you're an example of what's to come!\""
    ca "\"¿Esta es la próxima generación de khemios con la que debemos lidiar? No vivías durante la guerra, pero otra parece inevitable si eres un ejemplo de lo que viene.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:733
translate spanish a2s2_3ea3480d:

    # "Neferu tries to speak, but lets out a choked cough."
    "Neferu intenta hablar, pero suelta una tos ahogada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:734
translate spanish a2s2_dfbc9ee1:

    # ca "\"Hmm?\""
    ca "\"¿Hmm?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:735
translate spanish a2s2_fabe3b89:

    # "Cato loosens his grasp and Neferu gasps a few times."
    "Cato afloja la presa y Neferu jadea varias veces."

# game/a2s2.rpy:736
translate spanish a2s2_2aa2e1cf:

    # n "\"You...know...Amicus was...a bit less rough...but if you wanted to put your paws on me, you only had to—\""
    n "\"Sabes...Amicus era...un poco menos brusco...pero, si querías ponerme las manos encima, solo tenías que—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:738
translate spanish a2s2_98e4f76a:

    # "This time, Cato almost lifts the jackal off his feet, cutting Neferu off with a horrific gag, like he's throwing up."
    "Cato casi levanta al chacal del suelo; Neferu se interrumpe con una arcada horrible, como si vomitara."

# game/a2s2.rpy:739
translate spanish a2s2_52f9f5b4:

    # ca "\"I must say, you have a funny way of going about building an alliance. It's as if you thought tail-raising would get you whatever you wanted.\""
    ca "\"Tienes una forma curiosa de construir una alianza. Como si levantar la cola pudiera darte todo lo que quieres.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:740
translate spanish a2s2_94424998:

    # "Now Neferu really starts to struggle, kicking around aimlessly, throwing his head left and right, sending drool flinging from his muzzle."
    "Neferu empieza a forcejear de verdad, pataleando sin rumbo y sacudiendo la cabeza de lado a lado, salpicando saliva."

# game/a2s2.rpy:741
translate spanish a2s2_ae28f6e2:

    # "Cato doesn't relent, and I know this is my cue to do something."
    "Cato no cede; sé que me toca hacer algo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:742
translate spanish a2s2_328b1bee:

    # ca "\"It's been a while since I've killed a jackal. My paws have been itching to do it again. Maybe you'll be my next?\""
    ca "\"Hace tiempo que no mato a un chacal. Mis manos están deseando volver a hacerlo. ¿Quizá seas el siguiente?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:743
translate spanish a2s2_23157c03:

    # "I don't know what to do exactly."
    "No sé exactamente qué hacer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:744
translate spanish a2s2_6c4b1d89:

    # "I have no weapon, but I wonder if maybe I can at least distract the wolf long enough for Neferu to get away, to breathe again."
    "No tengo armas, pero quizá pueda distraer al lobo lo bastante para que Neferu escape y vuelva a respirar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:745
translate spanish a2s2_25ea1c44:

    # "So I run out of my hiding spot, rustling the branches and leaves as I do."
    "Salgo corriendo del escondite y hago crujir las ramas y hojas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:746
translate spanish a2s2_c4d9e78a:

    # "Cato is so focused on what he's doing to Neferu that he doesn't seem to even hear me."
    "Cato está tan centrado en lo que hace a Neferu que ni parece oírme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:747
translate spanish a2s2_cd8e76bb:

    # "As I run at him, I can see the wolf grinning maniacally into Neferu's face, like this really is something he's been wanting to do for a very long time."
    "Al correr hacia él veo su sonrisa maniática frente a Neferu, como si llevara muchísimo tiempo deseando esto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:748
translate spanish a2s2_64ea04f5:

    # "He finally seems to hear me at the last second, turning his head in my direction before I lower my shoulder to try and tackle him off of Neferu."
    "Parece oírme en el último segundo y vuelve la cabeza; bajo el hombro para embestirlo y apartarlo de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:752
translate spanish a2s2_8de6df84:

    # "It's like hitting a brick wall covered in fur."
    "Es como golpear un muro de ladrillos cubierto de pelo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:753
translate spanish a2s2_3b6eb23e:

    # "I make contact with the old man's side, and for a moment I get a whiff of musk and perfume before I'm sent right back down on my ass."
    "Choco contra su costado; percibo un instante almizcle y perfume antes de acabar otra vez sentado en el suelo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:754
translate spanish a2s2_017afb26:

    # "I wonder for a moment if I've dislocated my shoulder, looking up in a daze at what result my attack might have had, if any."
    "Me pregunto si me he dislocado el hombro mientras miro aturdido qué resultado tuvo mi ataque, si tuvo alguno."

# game/a2s2.rpy:755
translate spanish a2s2_4b3aa748:

    # "To my relief, I see Neferu on his paws and knees, gagging and coughing, drool stringing from his muzzle."
    "Para mi alivio, Neferu está a cuatro patas, con arcadas y tos, y saliva colgándole del hocico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:756
translate spanish a2s2_bd18ac9b:

    # "Cato is standing slightly to the side, looking in my direction, over my head, but he clearly knows where I am."
    "Cato está un poco a un lado, mirando en mi dirección por encima de mi cabeza, pero sabe claramente dónde estoy."

# game/a2s2.rpy:757
translate spanish a2s2_1848f4fa:

    # "He only focuses on me for a moment though, then he turns his head in the direction of the coughing jackal, Neferu crawling away at this point."
    "Solo me presta atención un instante; luego gira hacia el chacal que tose y ya se aleja a gatas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:758
translate spanish a2s2_17476a28:

    # "Cato makes his way towards him before drawing back a foot."
    "Cato se acerca a él y echa un pie hacia atrás."

# game/a2s2.rpy:759
translate spanish a2s2_3768a9e6:

    # "I can only reach out, not even having enough time to ask Cato to stop before the wolf kicks the jackal between the legs."
    "Solo puedo extender una mano; ni tengo tiempo de pedir que pare antes de que le dé una patada al chacal entre las piernas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:761
translate spanish a2s2_1ebb5a77:

    # "He does it so hard that I see Neferu's knees skip off the ground for a moment before he pitches face-first into the marble, on his knees and clutching at himself as he lets out a howl of agony."
    "Lo hace tan fuerte que las rodillas de Neferu saltan del suelo un momento; cae de cara contra el mármol, de rodillas y sujetándose mientras aúlla de dolor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:762
translate spanish a2s2_78be6c62:

    # "I cringe, immediately thinking of the time I kicked Amicus, and how much harder Cato must have kicked Neferu."
    "Hago una mueca, recordando mi patada a Amicus y cuánto más fuerte habrá golpeado Cato a Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:763
translate spanish a2s2_f772f9cd:

    # "I start to move towards them again, in case Cato thinks of doing anything else, but the old wolf simply stands there, breathing heavily, head tilted down as he listens to Neferu moan."
    "Vuelvo a acercarme por si Cato intenta algo más, pero el viejo lobo solo respira agitadamente, con la cabeza baja, escuchando gemir a Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:765
translate spanish a2s2_3adf7842:

    # ca "\"For the kicks you gave me earlier...that should put your whoring out of commission for a few days, no?\""
    ca "\"Por las patadas que me diste antes...esto debería impedir tus andanzas de puto unos días, ¿no?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:766
translate spanish a2s2_e9abf46b:

    # "Neferu is curled up on his knees at this point, paws tucked into himself."
    "Neferu está encogido de rodillas, con las manos apretadas contra sí mismo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:767
translate spanish a2s2_9e94989c:

    # "It's at this point that I see a gush of red liquid overflow from his muzzle, and for one horrific moment, I wonder if somehow Cato had kicked him so hard that he'd ruptured his organs, or something..."
    "Veo brotar líquido rojo de su hocico; durante un momento horrible me pregunto si Cato le dio tan fuerte que le rompió algún órgano..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:768
translate spanish a2s2_95440210:

    # "...but no, it's the wine, and it spills across the marble."
    "...pero no, es vino que se derrama por el mármol."

# game/a2s2.rpy:769
translate spanish a2s2_36e15300:

    # "Cato wrinkles his nose at the retching sounds before carefully stepping around the jackal."
    "Cato arruga la nariz ante las arcadas y rodea cuidadosamente al chacal."

# game/a2s2.rpy:771
translate spanish a2s2_2b94f286:

    # ca "\"As I said, I won't withdraw my offer for you to stay, but there are many apartments open in the city...just know that you will not be able to take your new 'citizen' with you.\""
    ca "\"No retiraré mi oferta de alojamiento, pero hay muchos apartamentos libres en la ciudad...ten claro que no podrás llevarte a tu nuevo 'ciudadano'.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:772
translate spanish a2s2_de572135:

    # ca "\"Otherwise, I'd like to try this discussion again in the future, if you're willing to be more cooperative.\""
    ca "\"Por lo demás, me gustaría retomar la conversación más adelante, si estás dispuesto a cooperar más.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:773
translate spanish a2s2_051f1133:

    # "With that, the old wolf stalks out of the bedroom."
    "El viejo lobo se marcha con paso airado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:775
translate spanish a2s2_d70c7b73:

    # "At the same time, two white drones float in, hovering over Neferu."
    "Al mismo tiempo entran dos drones blancos y flotan sobre Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:776
translate spanish a2s2_34051599:

    # "One lowers itself to the ground to begin cleaning up the mess while the other holds out what looks like a couple capsules on a plate, which it balances on a metal appendage."
    "Uno baja a limpiar; el otro ofrece lo que parecen dos cápsulas en un plato, equilibrado sobre un apéndice metálico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:777
translate spanish a2s2_c3871582:

    # com "\"Neferu, you seem to have vomited. Would you like anti-nausea medication?\""
    com "\"Neferu, parece que has vomitado. ¿Quieres medicación contra las náuseas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:778
translate spanish a2s2_a51293c4:

    # "I stumble over to the jackal to kneel at his side and try to help in any way that I can."
    "Me acerco tambaleándome, me arrodillo a su lado e intento ayudar como puedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:779
translate spanish a2s2_2a14a374:

    # "He simply keeps his eyes screwed shut, holding up a paw before returning it to his sore spot."
    "Mantiene los ojos apretados; alza una mano y la devuelve a la zona dolorida."

# game/a2s2.rpy:780
translate spanish a2s2_7a64487e:

    # "Awkwardly, I rub at his shoulder, trying to ignore the smell as the drone does its work of cleaning up the puke."
    "Le froto torpemente el hombro, intentando ignorar el olor mientras el dron limpia el vómito."

# game/a2s2.rpy:781
translate spanish a2s2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:782
translate spanish a2s2_1ddd22fa:

    # "A few minutes later, I manage to help the jackal to the bed, his breath ragged the entire way."
    "Unos minutos después consigo ayudar al chacal a llegar a la cama; respira con dificultad durante todo el trayecto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:783
translate spanish a2s2_02940988:

    # "It's strange seeing him like this."
    "Es extraño verlo así."

# game/a2s2.rpy:784
translate spanish a2s2_57db973b:

    # "Usually so confident and in control."
    "Normalmente tan seguro y dueño de sí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:785
translate spanish a2s2_8f129225:

    # "I never expected anyone to do anything like this to him...but I guess if someone was going to do it, it was Cato."
    "Nunca esperé que alguien le hiciera algo así...aunque, si alguien iba a hacerlo, era Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:786
translate spanish a2s2_8ec45018:

    # m "\"Are you sure you're okay?\""
    m "\"¿Seguro que estás bien?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:787
translate spanish a2s2_331fa012:

    # "I ask for what's probably the third time as I sit next to him, and Neferu manages a smile despite the clear pain he's in."
    "Lo pregunto probablemente por tercera vez mientras me siento junto a él; Neferu logra sonreír pese al dolor evidente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:790
translate spanish a2s2_af2a9f64:

    # n "\"Ugh...no, but I'll have to go to the physician to be sure...all the way in the city since Cato saw fit to imprison the palace doctor.\""
    n "\"Ugh...no, pero tendré que ir al médico para asegurarme...hasta la ciudad, porque Cato decidió encarcelar al médico del palacio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:791
translate spanish a2s2_c15885b1:

    # m "\"Do you need like...ice, or something? I dunno, he hit you so fucking hard.\""
    m "\"¿Necesitas...hielo o algo? No sé; te ha golpeado tan fuerte, joder.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:793
translate spanish a2s2_b97cbccf:

    # n "\"I'll manage. I just miscalculated. I'll know how to handle him in the future.\""
    n "\"Me las arreglaré. Calculé mal. Sabré cómo manejarlo en el futuro.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:794
translate spanish a2s2_31733592:

    # "I frown, not really feeling like that's the case."
    "Frunzo el ceño, sin creer que sea así."

# game/a2s2.rpy:795
translate spanish a2s2_17e88264:

    # "As I'm trying to help him though, Com's voice comes over the intercom again."
    "Mientras intento ayudarlo, vuelve a sonar la voz de Com por el intercomunicador."

# game/a2s2.rpy:796
translate spanish a2s2_15b075bb:

    # com "\"Virginia requests access to your room, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Virginia solicita acceso a tu habitación, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:797
translate spanish a2s2_3c81a36f:

    # "Neferu suddenly straightens up, moving his paws from his crotch to his thighs."
    "Neferu se endereza de golpe y pasa las manos de la entrepierna a los muslos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:799
translate spanish a2s2_e35e7ce5:

    # n "\"Granted.\""
    n "\"Concedido.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:802
translate spanish a2s2_3cb7ae6c:

    # "She nods at the two of us before wrinkling her nose."
    "Nos saluda con un gesto y arruga la nariz."

# game/a2s2.rpy:804
translate spanish a2s2_3d555a62:

    # v "\"Ugh, smells like rancid wine in here.\""
    v "\"Ugh, aquí huele a vino rancio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:805
translate spanish a2s2_12a517e9:

    # n "\"Indeed. What did you need, Virginia?\""
    n "\"En efecto. ¿Qué necesitabas, Virginia?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:806
translate spanish a2s2_56b15f16:

    # "To my surprise, Virginia turns to me."
    "Para mi sorpresa, Virginia se vuelve hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:808
translate spanish a2s2_f1ffc131:

    # "Instead of the hostile expression she'd been wearing the last time we'd encountered each other, it's much kinder, much to my relief."
    "En lugar de la expresión hostil del último encuentro, tiene una mucho más amable, para mi alivio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:809
translate spanish a2s2_b772c142:

    # v "\"[mc]? I had a discussion with Cassius about seeing Amicus. He seems accepting of the idea, under one condition.\""
    v "\"¿[mc]? Hablé con Cassius sobre ver a Amicus. Parece dispuesto a aceptarlo, con una condición.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:810
translate spanish a2s2_f85b39eb:

    # "There's a pause."
    "Se hace una pausa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:811
translate spanish a2s2_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:813
translate spanish a2s2_edfe6f38:

    # v "\"Well, he wishes to speak with you in private.\""
    v "\"Quiere hablar contigo en privado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:814
translate spanish a2s2_bb870827:

    # m "\"Private?\""
    m "\"¿En privado?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:815
translate spanish a2s2_76421756:

    # "Neferu immediately speaks up next to me."
    "Neferu interviene enseguida a mi lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:816
translate spanish a2s2_3bb9c1a2:

    # n "\"That is not wise, [mc]. We should negotiate with him to allow me to be there.\""
    n "\"No es prudente, [mc]. Deberíamos negociar para que me deje estar presente.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:817
translate spanish a2s2_b9fb6640:

    # "Virginia laughs."
    "Virginia se ríe."

# game/a2s2.rpy:819
translate spanish a2s2_1ad5b297:

    # v "\"You really think Cassius would allow a Khemian in on a private conversation?\""
    v "\"¿De verdad crees que Cassius permitiría a un khemio asistir a una conversación privada?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:821
translate spanish a2s2_340b7a66:

    # "Virginia pauses, eying the jackal, Neferu currently still hunched up despite his attempts to keep straight."
    "Virginia mira al chacal, que sigue encorvado pese a intentar mantenerse derecho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:822
translate spanish a2s2_ced15569:

    # v "\"What happened to you?\""
    v "\"¿Qué te ha pasado?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:824
translate spanish a2s2_771a0cc2:

    # n "\"Nothing of note.\""
    n "\"Nada destacable.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:825
translate spanish a2s2_eabfc3a3:

    # "I raise an eyebrow, which Virginia sees."
    "Levanto una ceja y Virginia lo ve."

# game/a2s2.rpy:826
translate spanish a2s2_dcbb295e:

    # v "\"[mc], what happened?\""
    v "\"[mc], ¿qué ha pasado?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:827
translate spanish a2s2_63033175:

    # m "\"Well...\""
    m "\"Bueno...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:828
translate spanish a2s2_da968a2a:

    # "I pause, watching as Neferu raises his own eyebrow, but makes no attempt to stop me."
    "Vacilo al ver que Neferu también levanta una ceja, aunque no intenta detenerme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:829
translate spanish a2s2_1dcb22ae:

    # m "\"Well, Neferu pissed off Cato and Cato...hurt him.\""
    m "\"Neferu cabreó a Cato y Cato...le hizo daño.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:831
translate spanish a2s2_2d69350f:

    # v "\"What!?\""
    v "\"¡¿Qué?!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:833
translate spanish a2s2_fe82014e:

    # n "\"I was attempting to pry information from the old man about the staged trial...I was unsuccessful.\""
    n "\"Intentaba sacarle al viejo información sobre la prueba amañada...no lo conseguí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:835
translate spanish a2s2_99784616:

    # v "\"Why did you even think you {i}could{/i} be successful? Cato knows exactly what we're up to, no doubt. This is so unlike you; it jeopardizes everything, Neferu.\""
    v "\"¿Por qué creíste siquiera que {i}podías{/i} conseguirlo? Cato sabe perfectamente qué tramamos. Esto no es propio de ti; lo pone todo en peligro, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:836
translate spanish a2s2_f605ce70:

    # "Virginia seems completely bewildered, and now that I think about it, I have to agree."
    "Virginia parece desconcertada y, pensándolo bien, tengo que estar de acuerdo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:837
translate spanish a2s2_bba8771a:

    # "What {i}was{/i} Neferu thinking?"
    "¿En qué {i}estaba{/i} pensando Neferu?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:841
translate spanish a2s2_5f43a80a:

    # "But then Virginia narrows her eyes as she sees the jackal grinning, now openly covering his crotch."
    "Virginia entrecierra los ojos al ver la sonrisa del chacal, que ya se cubre abiertamente la entrepierna."

# game/a2s2.rpy:842
translate spanish a2s2_37fb03a1:

    # v "\"What?\""
    v "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:843
translate spanish a2s2_02f55aee:

    # n "\"Well, I may have not achieved {i}exactly{/i} what I wanted, but I attained something just as valuable.\""
    n "\"Puede que no lograra {i}exactamente{/i} lo que quería, pero conseguí algo igual de valioso.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:844
translate spanish a2s2_c18ac922:

    # "Neferu glances at the corner of the room, where his drone is."
    "Neferu mira la esquina donde está su dron."

# game/a2s2.rpy:845
translate spanish a2s2_ce2ae05f:

    # m "\"You recorded it all?\""
    m "\"¿Lo grabaste todo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:846
translate spanish a2s2_fd9e538d:

    # n "\"Yes, and an attack on the Pharaoh's son will not look very nice on the Khemian news channels, will it?\""
    n "\"Sí, y atacar al hijo del faraón no quedará muy bien en los canales de noticias khemios, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:848
translate spanish a2s2_35a71ac6:

    # v "\"Neferu...\""
    v "\"Neferu...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:849
translate spanish a2s2_b0ae740c:

    # "A dark tone enters the wolf's voice."
    "La voz de la loba adquiere un tono sombrío."

# game/a2s2.rpy:850
translate spanish a2s2_3e74f632:

    # v "\"That risks war.\""
    v "\"Eso puede provocar una guerra.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:852
translate spanish a2s2_845d8d9b:

    # "The jackal rolls his eyes, adjusting himself rather lewdly."
    "El chacal pone los ojos en blanco y se acomoda de manera bastante obscena."

# game/a2s2.rpy:853
translate spanish a2s2_257c6349:

    # n "\"I would never actually send it, but Cato does not know that. It's simply convenient blackmail material if things don't go as planned.\""
    n "\"Nunca lo enviaría de verdad, pero Cato no lo sabe. Es material útil para chantajear si las cosas no salen según lo previsto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:854
translate spanish a2s2_037ff8a3:

    # "Virginia squeezes the bridge of her snout, closing her eyes."
    "Virginia aprieta el puente de su hocico y cierra los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:856
translate spanish a2s2_58ed6a40:

    # v "\"You don't know Cato very well, do you...and neither do I. Sometimes I believe he {i}wants{/i} another war. Did he hit you...\""
    v "\"No conoces bien a Cato...ni yo tampoco. A veces creo que {i}quiere{/i} otra guerra. ¿Te golpeó...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:857
translate spanish a2s2_6cc15208:

    # "Virginia's eyes drift lower."
    "La mirada de Virginia baja."

# game/a2s2.rpy:859
translate spanish a2s2_28ac0b78:

    # n "\"Yes. Anyway, he's no longer the emperor. It's Cassius I'd use it against.\""
    n "\"Sí. En fin, ya no es emperador. Lo usaría contra Cassius.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:860
translate spanish a2s2_28829bec:

    # v "\"You know Cato is his advisor?\""
    v "\"¿Sabes que Cato es su asesor?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:862
translate spanish a2s2_7f9aac5c:

    # n "\"But still not the emperor. I would hope your brother has large enough stones—\""
    n "\"Pero no el emperador. Espero que tu hermano tenga los huevos lo bastante grandes—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:863
translate spanish a2s2_e6acf4b2:

    # "Again, the jackal adjusts himself."
    "El chacal vuelve a acomodarse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:864
translate spanish a2s2_7e6eb13f:

    # n "\"—to do his job and not listen to a war-mongering advisor.\""
    n "\"—para hacer su trabajo y no escuchar a un asesor belicista.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:865
translate spanish a2s2_a45d9c8f:

    # v "\"One would hope.\""
    v "\"Eso esperamos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:866
translate spanish a2s2_a1d88f50:

    # "Virginia continues to look unconvinced."
    "Virginia sigue sin parecer convencida."

# game/a2s2.rpy:867
translate spanish a2s2_8583d362:

    # "I shift around impatiently next to Neferu."
    "Me muevo impaciente junto a Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:868
translate spanish a2s2_dc4a188f:

    # m "\"So did he want to see me now?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿quería verme ahora?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:869
translate spanish a2s2_1e7982fe:

    # "Virginia turns to me, again looking as if she had forgotten that I was there."
    "Virginia se vuelve hacia mí, otra vez como si hubiese olvidado mi presencia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:871
translate spanish a2s2_8d192b18:

    # v "\"That seemed to be the case.\""
    v "\"Eso parecía.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:872
translate spanish a2s2_4f0442af:

    # "Neferu sighs loudly."
    "Neferu suspira ruidosamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:874
translate spanish a2s2_2dbdfdaa:

    # n "\"At least try to convince him to allow you to be present, Virginia. I don't want [mc] to be left alone with him.\""
    n "\"Al menos intenta convencerlo de que te deje estar presente, Virginia. No quiero dejar a [mc] solo con él.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:875
translate spanish a2s2_d4958b8f:

    # v "\"There is little to worry about. Cass is not Cato...but I can try.\""
    v "\"Hay poco que temer. Cass no es Cato...pero puedo intentarlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:876
translate spanish a2s2_c8cbd96c:

    # "Virginia looks to me."
    "Virginia me mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:878
translate spanish a2s2_87c2ea16:

    # v "\"Ready, [mc]?\""
    v "\"¿Listo, [mc]?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:879
translate spanish a2s2_7dcd7627:

    # "I quickly get up, following the wolf to the door."
    "Me levanto deprisa y sigo a la loba hasta la puerta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:880
translate spanish a2s2_ea7cbf16:

    # "I look back at Neferu, the jackal looking uncharacteristically disheveled as he's still hunched up around his junk."
    "Miro atrás a Neferu, inusualmente desaliñado y todavía encorvado sobre sus genitales."

# game/a2s2.rpy:883
translate spanish a2s2_720f3525:

    # "He gives me a meaningful look, probably meant to tell me to be careful, so I give him a quick nod before following the wolf out the door."
    "Me dirige una mirada significativa, seguramente para decirme que tenga cuidado; asiento deprisa y sigo a la loba fuera."

# game/a2s2.rpy:887
translate spanish a2s2_8b88a349:

    # "We walk in silence, the only sound being the birds and the swishing of our robes as we make our way through the halls."
    "Caminamos en silencio; solo se oyen los pájaros y el roce de las túnicas en los pasillos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:888
translate spanish a2s2_7a51525a:

    # "I'm not sure exactly where we're going, but after a while, I realize it must be the throne room."
    "No sé exactamente adónde vamos, pero comprendo al cabo de un rato que debe ser la sala del trono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:889
translate spanish a2s2_44a4e915:

    # "I stare at the back of the she-wolf's head, contemplating a few things."
    "Miro la nuca de la loba y pienso en varias cosas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:890
translate spanish a2s2_f0a28a0a:

    # "Virginia is the person I know the least about in this palace...which probably means she's doing the best job at playing this little game."
    "Virginia es la persona de la que menos sé en este palacio...probablemente porque es la mejor jugando a este jueguecito."

# game/a2s2.rpy:891
translate spanish a2s2_5c43c9eb:

    # "I want to ask her a lot of things, but I'm worried about over-stepping boundaries, something that seems rather easy to do with her."
    "Quiero preguntarle muchas cosas, pero temo traspasar límites; con ella parece fácil hacerlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:892
translate spanish a2s2_b491a252:

    # "As we get closer to that door, I can't help myself from asking at least one question."
    "Al acercarnos a la puerta no puedo evitar hacer al menos una pregunta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:893
translate spanish a2s2_7e4ac271:

    # m "\"So do you...do you care that Amicus is in the dungeons? Like, you want to get him out not just because you want to be his advisor, right?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿te importa que Amicus esté en las mazmorras? Quieres sacarlo no solo para ser su asesora, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:894
translate spanish a2s2_fc310d66:

    # "Immediately, I see the wolf's ears flick back in...hopefully mild annoyance and not extreme anger."
    "Enseguida veo sus orejas echarse atrás...espero que por una ligera molestia, no por una furia extrema."

# game/a2s2.rpy:895
translate spanish a2s2_97c7cabc:

    # "Her voice is steady when she answers me, though."
    "Su voz es firme al contestar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:897
translate spanish a2s2_6cb0e3c4:

    # v "\"First of all, it's not any of your business what my motivations are, [mc].\""
    v "\"Para empezar, mis motivos no son asunto tuyo, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:898
translate spanish a2s2_493400d0:

    # "Virginia doesn't follow that up immediately, so we're left in an awkward silence as we walk the last ten feet to the throne room door."
    "Virginia no añade nada enseguida; recorremos en un silencio incómodo los últimos diez pies hasta la puerta de la sala del trono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:899
translate spanish a2s2_5121d00d:

    # "She pauses there and finally looks at me, her eyes narrowed."
    "Se detiene y por fin me mira con los ojos entrecerrados."

# game/a2s2.rpy:900
translate spanish a2s2_0a2655b2:

    # v "\"But Amicus is my brother, and for that alone, I love him.\""
    v "\"Pero Amicus es mi hermano y, solo por eso, lo amo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:902
translate spanish a2s2_c3acaaab:

    # v "\"And though he's a complete dullard, he's one of the few to be genuinely kind to me in this palace. He is a good wolf.\""
    v "\"Aunque sea un completo zoquete, es uno de los pocos de este palacio que son sinceramente amables conmigo. Es un buen lobo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:904
translate spanish a2s2_de1bc55d:

    # "Virginia turns away, raising a paw to hover over the black panel."
    "Virginia se vuelve y alza una mano sobre el panel negro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:905
translate spanish a2s2_675f36cf:

    # v "\"But you would already know that.\""
    v "\"Pero eso ya lo sabes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:906
translate spanish a2s2_24a29e95:

    # "With that, she presses the panel and the doors slide open."
    "Aprieta el panel y las puertas se deslizan."

# game/a2s2.rpy:910
translate spanish a2s2_82996485:

    # "I immediately spot Cassius at the other end of the cavernous room, looking a bit small and insignificant on the extravagant throne."
    "Veo enseguida a Cassius al otro extremo de la enorme sala, un poco pequeño e insignificante en el extravagante trono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:911
translate spanish a2s2_03a502ea:

    # "Probably not the best impression for the emperor of Adastra to make."
    "No es la mejor impresión para el emperador de Adastra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:912
translate spanish a2s2_b076f0a9:

    # "As I'm thinking this, we begin to make our way toward him."
    "Mientras pienso eso, nos acercamos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:913
translate spanish a2s2_4a6c005e:

    # "A drone hovers in front of the white wolf, holding up a screen under his face."
    "Un dron flota ante el lobo blanco, sosteniendo una pantalla bajo su rostro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:914
translate spanish a2s2_80f5ec8b:

    # "He's not looking at it now though, instead narrowing his eyes at the two of us as Virgina escorts me to the base of the steps."
    "No la mira; nos observa con los ojos entrecerrados mientras Virginia me lleva al pie de los escalones."

# game/a2s2.rpy:917
translate spanish a2s2_968c9eb1:

    # v "\"Here he is, brother.\""
    v "\"Aquí está, hermano.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:918
translate spanish a2s2_bc1bf438:

    # "Cassius shifts around in his seat, and for a moment, I think I catch sight of some sort of booster seat under his rear."
    "Cassius se mueve en el asiento y creo ver un instante una especie de asiento elevador bajo su trasero."

# game/a2s2.rpy:920
translate spanish a2s2_0a834553:

    # c "\"Thank you, Virginia. You can leave us be, now.\""
    c "\"Gracias, Virginia. Puedes dejarnos solos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:921
translate spanish a2s2_c52303b6:

    # "Virginia hesitates, clasping her paws together in front of herself."
    "Virginia vacila, juntando las manos ante sí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:923
translate spanish a2s2_656bb656:

    # v "\"...Brother, I would feel more comfortable if I were allowed to stay. I'd rather not leave you alone with an un-profiled alien.\""
    v "\"...Hermano, me sentiría más tranquila si pudiera quedarme. Prefiero no dejarte solo con un alienígena aún sin evaluar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:924
translate spanish a2s2_f69900c3:

    # "Cassius snorts, waving his paw dismissively."
    "Cassius resopla y agita la mano con desdén."

# game/a2s2.rpy:926
translate spanish a2s2_6886d4c8:

    # c "\"I've interacted with it many times before. I will be fine. If not, then the drones will take care of him.\""
    c "\"Ya he tratado con eso muchas veces. Estaré bien. Si no, los drones se ocuparán de él.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:928
translate spanish a2s2_93ee6f07:

    # "Cassius makes eye-contact with me as he says that last part, clearly meaning for me to take it as a warning...or a threat."
    "Cassius me mira a los ojos al decir lo último; claramente quiere que lo tome como advertencia...o amenaza."

# game/a2s2.rpy:929
translate spanish a2s2_e93b18a5:

    # "Virginia hesitates again, and Cassius's eyes drift toward her in question."
    "Virginia vuelve a vacilar y Cassius la mira interrogante."

# game/a2s2.rpy:930
translate spanish a2s2_b57e333f:

    # "That's when the she-wolf bows deeply before turning away."
    "La loba hace una profunda reverencia antes de volverse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:931
translate spanish a2s2_94f3be6a:

    # "As she passes me, she gives me her own look, not unlike Neferu's."
    "Al pasar a mi lado me lanza una mirada similar a la de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:932
translate spanish a2s2_bd0a3f97:

    # "{i}Be careful.{/i}"
    "{i}Ten cuidado.{/i}"

# game/a2s2.rpy:935
translate spanish a2s2_27c2f01a:

    # "I continue to face Cassius as I listen to Virginia's soft footsteps recede behind me, then I hear the door open and close."
    "Sigo frente a Cassius mientras los suaves pasos de Virginia se alejan; luego oigo abrirse y cerrarse la puerta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:936
translate spanish a2s2_4e679c62:

    # "I keep my eyes low, on Cassius's feet, though I can tell he's looking directly at me."
    "Mantengo la mirada baja, en los pies de Cassius, aunque sé que me mira directamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:937
translate spanish a2s2_f38717ce:

    # "The silence drags on."
    "El silencio se alarga."

# game/a2s2.rpy:938
translate spanish a2s2_e9d7bc95:

    # "I wonder if the white wolf is using Cato's technique of using silence to intimidate."
    "Me pregunto si el lobo blanco usa el silencio para intimidar, como Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:939
translate spanish a2s2_56bb44bd:

    # "Finally though, he clears his throat loudly, almost making me jump."
    "Por fin se aclara la garganta ruidosamente y casi me hace saltar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:942
translate spanish a2s2_0c6e0d68:

    # c "\"First, I want to say that you may speak freely here. I only want the truth.\""
    c "\"Primero, quiero decir que puedes hablar libremente. Solo quiero la verdad.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:944
translate spanish a2s2_b260da1e:

    # "I look up at him then, and see that he's not looking at me anymore."
    "Levanto la vista y veo que ya no me mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:945
translate spanish a2s2_484a3096:

    # "Instead it's to the side, as if he's lost in thought."
    "Mira hacia un lado, como perdido en sus pensamientos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:946
translate spanish a2s2_c687f3ae:

    # c "\"I'm confused as to how all of this could have happened, so know that if you speak the truth, you will be free from any consequences.\""
    c "\"No comprendo cómo pudo pasar todo esto, así que debes saber que, si dices la verdad, no sufrirás consecuencias.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:947
translate spanish a2s2_93be9e0e:

    # "Consequences?"
    "¿Consecuencias?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:948
translate spanish a2s2_6a84473e:

    # "He's making it sound as if I've committed some sort of crime or conspiracy...I mean, maybe I've been a part of some, but it's definitely not my fault."
    "Habla como si hubiese cometido un delito o conspirado...quizá haya formado parte de algo, pero desde luego no es culpa mía."

# game/a2s2.rpy:949
translate spanish a2s2_02f3083d:

    # m "\"What do you want to know?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres saber?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:951
translate spanish a2s2_bb5a0ea9:

    # "Cassius's eyes flick to mine then, and I see mild surprise there."
    "Cassius me mira y veo cierta sorpresa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:952
translate spanish a2s2_ed450dd2:

    # "He's still probably not used to an alien like me speaking directly to him in full sentences."
    "Probablemente aún no está acostumbrado a que un alienígena como yo le hable directamente con frases completas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:953
translate spanish a2s2_9ec55a5a:

    # "He pauses again before resting his chin on a paw, clearly trying to look casual."
    "Vuelve a detenerse antes de apoyar la barbilla en una mano, intentando parecer despreocupado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:955
translate spanish a2s2_6fb20c57:

    # c "\"Who exactly are you.\""
    c "\"¿Quién eres exactamente?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:956
translate spanish a2s2_09722dcb:

    # "I raise an eyebrow."
    "Alzo una ceja."

# game/a2s2.rpy:957
translate spanish a2s2_93364a0b:

    # m "\"[mc], you already know this.\""
    m "\"[mc], ya lo sabes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:959
translate spanish a2s2_22b1f27e:

    # c "\"I know your name, but I want to know more beyond that. What is it that you're doing here? How did my brother find you?\""
    c "\"Sé tu nombre, pero quiero saber más. ¿Qué haces aquí? ¿Cómo te encontró mi hermano?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:960
translate spanish a2s2_91cdd30a:

    # "Immediately, our conversation reaches a point where I find myself unsure of what to say."
    "La conversación llega enseguida a un punto donde no sé qué decir."

# game/a2s2.rpy:961
translate spanish a2s2_67c07bd6:

    # "How much {i}can{/i} I say to him?"
    "¿Cuánto {i}puedo{/i} contarle?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:962
translate spanish a2s2_45fa0e08:

    # "Obviously I can't trust him at all."
    "Evidentemente no puedo confiar en él."

# game/a2s2.rpy:963
translate spanish a2s2_5c1f227f:

    # "I know that."
    "Lo sé."

# game/a2s2.rpy:964
translate spanish a2s2_4103832d:

    # "But I also know that he's in complete control over what happens to Amicus, and there may be a few things I have to give up to keep my wolf safe."
    "Pero también controla por completo lo que le ocurra a Amicus; quizá tenga que hacer concesiones para proteger a mi lobo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:965
translate spanish a2s2_ed29841e:

    # "So, I square my shoulders and look Cassius in the eye."
    "Enderezo los hombros y miro a Cassius a los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:966
translate spanish a2s2_043dbd6a:

    # m "\"I want to know that Amicus is okay first...and I want to see him.\""
    m "\"Primero quiero saber que Amicus está bien...y quiero verlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:967
translate spanish a2s2_3811efc5:

    # "Immediately Cassius's demeanor changes from sour suspicion to sour fury."
    "Su actitud cambia al instante de una suspicacia agria a una furia igualmente agria."

# game/a2s2.rpy:969
translate spanish a2s2_d4c8247b:

    # c "\"Excuse me!? You aren't the one to make demands here! I am the emperor, and you will answer my questions!\""
    c "\"¡¿Perdona?! ¡Aquí no eres tú quien exige! ¡Soy el emperador y responderás mis preguntas!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:970
translate spanish a2s2_31345f49:

    # "I get the vague sensation of my balls drawing up into my stomach as I realize how dangerous all of this is."
    "Siento vagamente que los huevos se me encogen hacia el estómago al comprender el peligro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:971
translate spanish a2s2_9693519b:

    # "My thoughts go to that physician...Felix, being sent to the dungeons without a second thought."
    "Pienso en aquel médico...Felix, enviado a las mazmorras sin pensárselo dos veces."

# game/a2s2.rpy:972
translate spanish a2s2_4a4e9e11:

    # "But I know I have protections, and I have to trust them now if I'm going to make any sort of deal with Cassius."
    "Pero sé que tengo protección y debo confiar en ella para pactar con Cassius."

# game/a2s2.rpy:973
translate spanish a2s2_1a36bdb3:

    # m "\"Yeah, but you're not {i}my{/i} emperor. I answer to the Pharaoh.\""
    m "\"Sí, pero no eres {i}mi{/i} emperador. Respondo ante el faraón.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:974
translate spanish a2s2_a6550882:

    # "I'm spitballing, but it seems to be working as it gives Cassius pause."
    "Improviso, pero parece funcionar: Cassius vacila."

# game/a2s2.rpy:976
translate spanish a2s2_1e5a0a6c:

    # "After a moment, it seems like he's able to collect himself."
    "Al cabo de un momento parece recuperar la compostura."

# game/a2s2.rpy:978
translate spanish a2s2_1c7e553a:

    # c "\"So I've heard. But remind yourself that you are on Adastra, therefore you are to abide by our laws and customs, and lying to the emperor is punishable by death.\""
    c "\"Eso he oído. Pero recuerda que estás en Adastra y debes cumplir nuestras leyes y costumbres. Mentir al emperador se castiga con la muerte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:979
translate spanish a2s2_6b0fdf8a:

    # "And again that feeling in my stomach."
    "Otra vez esa sensación en el estómago."

# game/a2s2.rpy:980
translate spanish a2s2_fdf1b1cc:

    # "But I have to remind myself; rules don't matter here, it's all about playing their game."
    "Debo recordar que las reglas no importan aquí; todo consiste en jugar a su juego."

# game/a2s2.rpy:981
translate spanish a2s2_eadc2301:

    # "I know that Cassius would never have me executed or imprisoned while Neferu is here."
    "Sé que Cassius no ordenaría ejecutarme ni encarcelarme mientras Neferu esté aquí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:982
translate spanish a2s2_f34e3227:

    # "That would be far too risky for the empire as a whole."
    "Sería demasiado arriesgado para todo el imperio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:983
translate spanish a2s2_d2bb9dfb:

    # "I can't be intimidated by empty threats...even if they threaten my life."
    "No puedo dejarme intimidar por amenazas vacías...aunque amenacen mi vida."

# game/a2s2.rpy:984
translate spanish a2s2_c73dc725:

    # "If I want to help Amicus, I have to push the limits."
    "Para ayudar a Amicus tengo que forzar los límites."

# game/a2s2.rpy:985
translate spanish a2s2_971f9c5b:

    # "At least within reason."
    "Al menos dentro de lo razonable."

# game/a2s2.rpy:986
translate spanish a2s2_bf7c7bda:

    # "I also remind myself that I'm not completely untouchable, as Neferu's balls can attest to."
    "También recuerdo que no soy totalmente intocable, como pueden atestiguar los huevos de Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:987
translate spanish a2s2_5a3a7f9c:

    # m "\"I just want to see my former master. If you can guarantee me that, then I'll tell you what happened.\""
    m "\"Solo quiero ver a mi antiguo amo. Si me lo garantizas, te contaré lo ocurrido.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:989
translate spanish a2s2_6ae75210:

    # "Another long pause as Cassius just glares at me, then he lets out a little huff."
    "Otra larga pausa mientras Cassius me fulmina con la mirada; luego resopla un poco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:991
translate spanish a2s2_a4d5ba04:

    # c "\"Fine.\""
    c "\"Está bien.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:992
translate spanish a2s2_b2ea9f0f:

    # "It's almost funny how he's still acting like a child despite now being the emperor of Adastra."
    "Casi resulta gracioso que siga comportándose como un niño siendo ya emperador de Adastra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:993
translate spanish a2s2_d3d64bc9:

    # "So, I take a deep breath."
    "Respiro hondo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:994
translate spanish a2s2_6c47567f:

    # "I consider lying, of course, but what Amicus did was an honest mistake...at least in my opinion."
    "Considero mentir, claro, pero Amicus cometió un error de buena fe...al menos en mi opinión."

# game/a2s2.rpy:995
translate spanish a2s2_b28a80d4:

    # "Lying will probably only make things worse when the truth should be so understandable."
    "Mentir probablemente empeoraría las cosas cuando la verdad debería resultar tan comprensible."

# game/a2s2.rpy:996
translate spanish a2s2_4a68462a:

    # "So I start at the beginning, how Amicus came upon the records of my people in the archives, how he rushed to my planet to find a willing pet."
    "Empiezo por el principio: cómo Amicus encontró los registros de mi pueblo en los archivos y corrió a mi planeta para buscar una mascota voluntaria."

# game/a2s2.rpy:997
translate spanish a2s2_c6179b35:

    # "How everything suddenly went south when he found out far too late that we were not part of the {i}Galaxias{/i}, and finally how we tried to keep it all a secret to keep the empire safe."
    "Cómo todo salió mal al descubrir demasiado tarde que no pertenecíamos a la {i}Galaxias{/i}; finalmente, cómo intentamos ocultarlo para proteger al imperio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:998
translate spanish a2s2_12eba6fe:

    # "I emphasize the \"keeping the empire safe\" part, even if it wasn't originally at the top my priorities."
    "Destaco la parte de \"proteger al imperio\", aunque originalmente no fuera mi mayor prioridad."

# game/a2s2.rpy:999
translate spanish a2s2_cfa4331a:

    # "I'm telling the truth, even if I'm stretching it a bit."
    "Digo la verdad, aunque la estire un poco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1001
translate spanish a2s2_1fdf223b:

    # "Cassius listens to all of this with various reactions; contempt, surprise, anger, then contemplation."
    "Cassius escucha con distintas reacciones: desprecio, sorpresa, ira y después reflexión."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1003
translate spanish a2s2_27d86b2c:

    # "I'm struck by the contrast between him and Cato."
    "Me impresiona su contraste con Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1004
translate spanish a2s2_a3fee1b8:

    # "While Cato keeps his emotions in check (aside from the occasional explosions of rage), Cassius wears it all on his sleeve."
    "Cato controla sus emociones, salvo estallidos ocasionales de furia; Cassius las muestra todas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1005
translate spanish a2s2_90d1b92b:

    # "Not that different from Amicus in that way, even if his personality is."
    "En eso no es tan distinto de Amicus, aunque su personalidad sí lo sea."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1006
translate spanish a2s2_0506e540:

    # "When Cassius still doesn't say anything, I sigh."
    "Como sigue sin hablar, suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1007
translate spanish a2s2_68509d13:

    # m "\"It was an honest mistake. You've got to understand that.\""
    m "\"Fue un error de buena fe. Tienes que entenderlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1008
translate spanish a2s2_94a95ede:

    # c "\"I already know that it was a mistake; even Amicus would not make First Contact on purpose. I had just wondered what sort of stupidity caused it.\""
    c "\"Ya sé que fue un error; ni Amicus haría el Primer Contacto a propósito. Me preguntaba qué estupidez lo causó.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1009
translate spanish a2s2_252c7360:

    # m "\"He had no reason to think we were un-contacted; we were recorded in the library, or whatever...\""
    m "\"No tenía motivos para pensar que no nos habían contactado; estábamos registrados en la biblioteca o lo que fuera...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1010
translate spanish a2s2_75cd1c27:

    # "Cassius suddenly shifts on his throne."
    "Cassius se mueve de pronto en el trono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1012
translate spanish a2s2_ea697611:

    # c "\"What are you? Species and planet name.\""
    c "\"¿Qué eres? Nombre de la especie y del planeta.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1013
translate spanish a2s2_84f15627:

    # "His last sentence has the inflection of an expectant demand."
    "Su última frase suena como una exigencia que espera respuesta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1014
translate spanish a2s2_01485bef:

    # "Now I'm left to stand in silence."
    "Ahora me quedo de pie en silencio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1015
translate spanish a2s2_48c2eb31:

    # "No fucking way am I telling this wolf brat where I'm from."
    "Ni de coña voy a decirle a este lobo mimado de dónde vengo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1016
translate spanish a2s2_bfa9af29:

    # "Cassius must see this on my face immediately, because his fur once again puffs out in anger."
    "Cassius debe notarlo enseguida en mi cara, porque vuelve a erizarse de ira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1018
translate spanish a2s2_543637c3:

    # c "\"Do you want to see Amicus, or not? I need to know this to verify that what you are saying is truthful.\""
    c "\"¿Quieres ver a Amicus o no? Debo saberlo para comprobar que dices la verdad.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1019
translate spanish a2s2_d3007c40:

    # m "\"Is that really why? I know what you wolves do to other aliens. Why would I give away my people like that?\""
    m "\"¿Ese es el verdadero motivo? Sé lo que los lobos hacéis a otros alienígenas. ¿Por qué entregaría así a mi pueblo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1021
translate spanish a2s2_79c643ae:

    # "Cassius puffs himself up even bigger, and I wonder if he's going to start screaming at me, then he suddenly just deflates."
    "Cassius se hincha aún más; me pregunto si empezará a gritar, pero de pronto se desinfla."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1023
translate spanish a2s2_46d56006:

    # c "\"The problem here is First Contact, yes? So why would I go out to find and...do whatever you think it is I'd do to your people? I have no interest in furthering the problem. I simply want to know.\""
    c "\"El problema es el Primer Contacto, ¿no? ¿Por qué iba a buscar a tu pueblo y...hacerle lo que crees que haría? No me interesa agravar el problema. Solo quiero saberlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1024
translate spanish a2s2_be8537ff:

    # m "\"But why do you care?\""
    m "\"Pero ¿por qué te importa?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1026
translate spanish a2s2_ed9b9763:

    # "Cassius snaps his eyes back up to mine."
    "Cassius vuelve a mirarme de golpe a los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1027
translate spanish a2s2_8a00cbc0:

    # c "\"Believe it or not, [mc], I am trying to help Amicus. Do you not know the consequence of such a crime? He could be executed for this!\""
    c "\"Lo creas o no, [mc], intento ayudar a Amicus. ¿No conoces las consecuencias de ese delito? ¡Podrían ejecutarlo!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1028
translate spanish a2s2_69613b65:

    # "Now my heart does a backflip."
    "Ahora el corazón me da un vuelco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1029
translate spanish a2s2_d58e4bda:

    # m "\"What!? Why?\""
    m "\"¡¿Qué?! ¿Por qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1030
translate spanish a2s2_67fda588:

    # c "\"Because it is a sacred rule created by the parents! Disobeying them risks our entire empire to abandonment!\""
    c "\"¡Es una regla sagrada creada por los Padres! ¡Desobedecerlos arriesga el abandono de todo el imperio!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1031
translate spanish a2s2_acf9009e:

    # m "\"But...you're the emperor. If you want him kept alive, can't you just do that?\""
    m "\"Pero...eres el emperador. Si quieres mantenerlo vivo, ¿no puedes hacerlo sin más?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1032
translate spanish a2s2_c7b9b83f:

    # "I feel myself starting to panic a little."
    "Empiezo a sentir un poco de pánico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1033
translate spanish a2s2_a6d0c424:

    # "I'd thought that maybe Amicus would be kept in the dungeons for a while, but never that he could be at risk of being executed."
    "Pensaba que podrían mantener a Amicus encarcelado un tiempo, pero nunca que corriese peligro de ejecución."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1035
translate spanish a2s2_ec470e98:

    # c "\"...If it were only I that knew of this...maybe. But there are others that know of his crime, and they expect me to terminate all evidence of the First Contact.\""
    c "\"...Si solo lo supiera yo...quizá. Pero otros conocen su delito y esperan que elimine todas las pruebas del Primer Contacto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1036
translate spanish a2s2_2ea734e9:

    # "Cassius stares at me, and I realize part of that evidence is of course...me."
    "Cassius me mira y comprendo que, claro, parte de esas pruebas soy...yo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1037
translate spanish a2s2_9bb3c809:

    # m "\"Are you talking about Cato? He's just your advisor, right? You can ignore him.\""
    m "\"¿Te refieres a Cato? Solo es tu asesor, ¿no? Puedes ignorarlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1038
translate spanish a2s2_5c502bb7:

    # "This time Cassius doesn't respond, looking away again."
    "Cassius no responde y vuelve a apartar la mirada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1039
translate spanish a2s2_cdeb6d62:

    # c "\"If I can make the case that this was a truly honest mistake, then maybe I have a chance of convincing these...others.\""
    c "\"Si puedo demostrar que fue de verdad un error de buena fe, quizá pueda convencer a esos...otros.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1041
translate spanish a2s2_48e7f22a:

    # c "\"Better yet, convince them that this wasn't First Contact at all. Are you even sure your people are completely unaware of the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    c "\"O mejor, convencerlos de que no fue un Primer Contacto. ¿Estás seguro de que tu pueblo no sabe absolutamente nada de la {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1042
translate spanish a2s2_adc432f8:

    # "I start to say that I am pretty sure, but he's looking at me in a strange way."
    "Empiezo a decir que estoy bastante seguro, pero me mira de una forma extraña."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1043
translate spanish a2s2_ed2e0458:

    # m "\"Um...our governments are pretty secretive. They might know something.\""
    m "\"Eh...nuestros gobiernos son bastante herméticos. Quizá sepan algo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1044
translate spanish a2s2_b51e9cab:

    # c "\"So it's possible that a crime wasn't committed at all, simply a misunderstanding, and knowing where you came from can help us determine that.\""
    c "\"Es posible, entonces, que no hubiera delito, solo un malentendido. Saber de dónde vienes puede ayudarnos a determinarlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1045
translate spanish a2s2_2a2e949f:

    # "I'm a bit caught off-guard by all of this."
    "Todo esto me toma un poco por sorpresa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1046
translate spanish a2s2_73864744:

    # "I guess I'd just expected Cassius to let Amicus rot in the dungeons while he enjoyed his emperorship."
    "Creo que esperaba que Cassius dejara pudrirse a Amicus en las mazmorras mientras disfrutaba del trono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1047
translate spanish a2s2_9dd3c25c:

    # "But I'm reminded of what Virginia had said earlier, that although they might stab each other in the back, they're still siblings."
    "Pero recuerdo lo que dijo Virginia: aunque se apuñalen por la espalda, siguen siendo hermanos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1048
translate spanish a2s2_5901ea27:

    # m "\"Didn't you once say that you don't care about the parents? Wouldn't it be part of your plan for them to abandon the empire?\""
    m "\"¿No dijiste que los Padres no te importaban? ¿No querías que abandonaran el imperio?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1049
translate spanish a2s2_a335bca4:

    # "Cassius sighs deeply."
    "Cassius suspira profundamente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1051
translate spanish a2s2_42122e84:

    # c "\"I've said many things, but I've found that once you become emperor, your perspective on things change.\""
    c "\"He dicho muchas cosas, pero he descubierto que, cuando te conviertes en emperador, cambia tu perspectiva.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1052
translate spanish a2s2_67014ef2:

    # m "\"Like...how much you need the parents?\""
    m "\"¿Como...cuánto necesitas a los Padres?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1054
translate spanish a2s2_e7aa8f87:

    # "Cassius glares at me, so I just go on."
    "Cassius me fulmina con la mirada y sigo hablando."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1055
translate spanish a2s2_2b2ef116:

    # m "\"How would they find out anyway? Amicus said something about monitors? Obviously we can just talk about it out in the open without anything happening.\""
    m "\"¿Cómo se enterarían? Amicus mencionó unos monitores. Podemos hablar abiertamente sin que pase nada.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1056
translate spanish a2s2_990e5d4d:

    # "I look around, as if expecting a monitor to poke its head out from behind one of the pillars."
    "Miro alrededor, como esperando que un monitor asome la cabeza tras una columna."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1057
translate spanish a2s2_f188e909:

    # c "\"I don't know, but what I do know is that the fewer who know, the better.\""
    c "\"No lo sé. Pero cuantos menos lo sepan, mejor.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1058
translate spanish a2s2_5c64b0f5:

    # m "\"What even is a monitor?\""
    m "\"¿Qué es siquiera un monitor?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1059
translate spanish a2s2_8864afe9:

    # "Cassius shrugs."
    "Cassius se encoge de hombros."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1061
translate spanish a2s2_ebb270ca:

    # c "\"Again, I don't know. None have appeared in living memory...but that does not mean we should not be cautious. The risk is far too great.\""
    c "\"No lo sé. Ninguno ha aparecido desde que se tiene memoria...pero debemos ser cautos. El riesgo es demasiado grande.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1062
translate spanish a2s2_7ba5465f:

    # "I don't really understand this."
    "No termino de entenderlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1063
translate spanish a2s2_2fe9441f:

    # "I feel like if the parents are as powerful and all-knowing as these aliens make them out to be, then they probably already know I'm here."
    "Si los Padres son tan poderosos y omniscientes como dicen estos alienígenas, probablemente ya saben que estoy aquí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1064
translate spanish a2s2_0275651a:

    # "Before I can bring this up to Cassius, though—"
    "Pero, antes de planteárselo a Cassius—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1065
translate spanish a2s2_8e3156f7:

    # c "\"So what are you, and where are you from?\""
    c "\"Entonces, ¿qué eres y de dónde vienes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1066
translate spanish a2s2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Reflexiono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1067
translate spanish a2s2_c8e659bb:

    # "He's right that it wouldn't make sense for the wolves to go after Earth."
    "Tiene razón: no tendría sentido que los lobos fueran a por la Tierra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1068
translate spanish a2s2_17a12f5f:

    # "It is technically the last thing that the empire would want, especially with Cassius as emperor considering his isolationist views."
    "Es lo último que querría el imperio, sobre todo con Cassius como emperador y sus ideas aislacionistas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1069
translate spanish a2s2_4aa458e7:

    # "But most importantly, it could help Amicus."
    "Lo más importante es que podría ayudar a Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1070
translate spanish a2s2_a5e8d1c4:

    # "I take a deep breath."
    "Respiro hondo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1071
translate spanish a2s2_58fd0999:

    # m "\"And if I tell you, you'll let me see Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Y si te lo digo me dejarás ver a Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1073
translate spanish a2s2_bebecefa:

    # c "\"...Yes.\""
    c "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1074
translate spanish a2s2_4a788f43:

    # "I don't like only being able to go on his word, but for some reason, I feel like he's being sincere."
    "No me gusta depender solo de su palabra, pero siento que habla sinceramente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1075
translate spanish a2s2_1bb5226a:

    # m "\"I'm a human, from the planet Earth.\""
    m "\"Soy humano, del planeta Tierra.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1077
translate spanish a2s2_fe647475:

    # c "\"Human...Earth...\""
    c "\"Humano...Tierra...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1078
translate spanish a2s2_134c430f:

    # "Cassius mumbles the words, the Lingua cutting off and allowing me to hear the wolf's accented voice un-filtered."
    "Cassius murmura las palabras; la Lingua se interrumpe y oigo su voz con acento, sin filtrar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1079
translate spanish a2s2_168b3f7c:

    # "He pulls the floating drone at his side toward himself, tapping at the screen a few times, probably making notes."
    "Atrae el dron flotante y toca varias veces la pantalla, probablemente tomando notas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1080
translate spanish a2s2_a3ec275c:

    # "It feels incredibly wrong at that moment, like I've betrayed all humans somehow...but again, I can't see why it would put Earth in danger."
    "Me parece increíblemente mal, como si hubiese traicionado a todos los humanos...pero sigo sin ver por qué pondría a la Tierra en peligro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1081
translate spanish a2s2_b11219c7:

    # "On top of that, I'm also counting on Amicus becoming emperor eventually, and I know he'd never do anything to my planet."
    "Además, cuento con que Amicus llegue a ser emperador y sé que nunca haría nada a mi planeta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1082
translate spanish a2s2_0b0e8109:

    # "I'm playing the game."
    "Estoy jugando al juego."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1083
translate spanish a2s2_a3e1504d:

    # "Cassius stares at the screen a while, and I shift around on my feet."
    "Cassius mira la pantalla un rato y cambio el peso de un pie al otro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1084
translate spanish a2s2_80513949:

    # m "\"So...I can go see him now?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿puedo verlo ahora?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1085
translate spanish a2s2_0e4620fa:

    # "He snaps his gaze up to mine."
    "Me mira de golpe."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1087
translate spanish a2s2_6be067b0:

    # c "\"Yes, now is best. Cato should not be back for a few more hours, but I can only give you twenty minutes, just to be safe.\""
    c "\"Sí, ahora es mejor. Cato tardará unas horas en volver, pero solo puedo darte veinte minutos, por precaución.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1088
translate spanish a2s2_845eef23:

    # m "\"Cato? What about him?\""
    m "\"¿Cato? ¿Qué tiene que ver?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1090
translate spanish a2s2_c09b8999:

    # c "\"What do you mean, 'what about him'?\""
    c "\"¿Qué quieres decir con 'qué tiene que ver'?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1091
translate spanish a2s2_5581ec29:

    # "I want to ask Cassius why it sounds like Cato is in charge and not he himself, but I know not to press those buttons right now."
    "Quiero preguntarle por qué parece que manda Cato y no él, pero sé que no debo provocarlo ahora."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1092
translate spanish a2s2_ff1cbaea:

    # m "\"Never mind. So, can I see him regularly?\""
    m "\"Da igual. ¿Podré verlo con regularidad?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1094
translate spanish a2s2_8b9b3738:

    # "Cassius sighs loudly again, standing up."
    "Cassius vuelve a suspirar fuerte y se levanta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1095
translate spanish a2s2_b74fa0aa:

    # c "\"If it's not often and you come to me first...and if Cato's away.\""
    c "\"Si no es a menudo y vienes antes a mí...y si Cato está fuera.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1096
translate spanish a2s2_aece2856:

    # "Yep, definitely not fully in charge."
    "Sí, definitivamente no tiene todo el mando."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1097
translate spanish a2s2_bccddb95:

    # "Cato's clearly got some control over Cassius."
    "Cato ejerce claramente cierto control sobre Cassius."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1098
translate spanish a2s2_be62fcc1:

    # "Either way, I'm too happy at the thought of being able to see Amicus semi-regularly to care at the moment."
    "De todos modos estoy demasiado contento por poder ver a Amicus con cierta regularidad para preocuparme ahora."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1100
translate spanish a2s2_f27f026b:

    # c "\"Anyway, Com, escort [mc] to the dungeons to visit Amicus for twenty minutes.\""
    c "\"Com, lleva a [mc] a las mazmorras para que visite a Amicus durante veinte minutos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1101
translate spanish a2s2_f6cc0fac:

    # "That's when I remember I have other questions."
    "Recuerdo que tengo otras preguntas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1102
translate spanish a2s2_fa6aacee:

    # m "\"Wait, uh...do you have contact with the parents now?\""
    m "\"Espera...¿ya tienes contacto con los Padres?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1104
translate spanish a2s2_5e2484b2:

    # "Cassius looks at me strangely."
    "Cassius me mira extrañado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1105
translate spanish a2s2_f227dffe:

    # c "\"Yes, we made contact after I became emperor. It was expected.\""
    c "\"Sí, contactamos después de mi ascenso al trono. Era lo esperado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1106
translate spanish a2s2_127c2f3b:

    # m "\"Oh! That's...good.\""
    m "\"¡Oh! Eso...está bien.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1107
translate spanish a2s2_007d1314:

    # c "\"Indeed. Though we had to implement the traditional technique. It's a bit archaic, but highly effective.\""
    c "\"En efecto. Tuvimos que emplear la técnica tradicional. Es algo arcaica, pero muy eficaz.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1108
translate spanish a2s2_4c3ca240:

    # m "\"Oh. So, do you have the stretch drive again?\""
    m "\"Oh. Entonces, ¿ya tenéis de nuevo la Propulsión Dilatatoria?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1109
translate spanish a2s2_94556ad1:

    # "Cassius looks at me suspiciously."
    "Cassius me mira con suspicacia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1110
translate spanish a2s2_ac0ed160:

    # m "\"Hey, I need to get home eventually, and you'd be getting rid of the problem if you got me there.\""
    m "\"Oye, tengo que volver a casa algún día; te librarías del problema si me llevases allí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1111
translate spanish a2s2_7fde3883:

    # c "\"Well, no not yet, but I've only spoken with them a few times. I'll be meditating on that today. I'll keep you updated when we discuss things in the future.\""
    c "\"Todavía no, pero solo he hablado con ellos unas pocas veces. Hoy meditaré sobre eso. Te informaré cuando volvamos a hablar.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1112
translate spanish a2s2_cfa91801:

    # m "\"You want to talk to me again?\""
    m "\"¿Quieres volver a hablar conmigo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1114
translate spanish a2s2_1fb96901:

    # c "\"Yes.\""
    c "\"Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1115
translate spanish a2s2_c4852865:

    # "Cassius then stalks off while a drone circles around me, telling me to follow it."
    "Cassius se marcha con paso airado y un dron gira a mi alrededor, diciéndome que lo siga."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1117
translate spanish a2s2_c3e30c9c:

    # "I think about apologizing then for the whole nervo incident, but then I realize if he's not going to mention it, then maybe I shouldn't either."
    "Pienso en disculparme por el incidente del nervo, pero si él no lo menciona quizá yo tampoco deba hacerlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1118
translate spanish a2s2_b903b68a:

    # "I realize then how strange the whole exchange has been."
    "Comprendo lo extraño que ha sido todo el intercambio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1120
translate spanish a2s2_284b6a36:

    # "Cassius had seemed like a whole different person...but I guess now he thinks of me more as an equal...at least in terms of intelligence."
    "Cassius parecía otra persona...supongo que ahora me considera más su igual, al menos en inteligencia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1121
translate spanish a2s2_660685f0:

    # "It makes him almost tolerable."
    "Eso lo hace casi tolerable."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1124
translate spanish a2s2_b4d00ffb:

    # "I'm lead to a part of the palace that I've never been to before."
    "Me llevan a una parte del palacio donde nunca he estado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1125
translate spanish a2s2_e8ac0645:

    # "We go through a small door, into a small room that has a small pit in it."
    "Cruzamos una puerta pequeña hacia una habitación pequeña con un pequeño pozo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1128
translate spanish a2s2_3f027a7a:

    # "A ladder leads down into this pit, a pit that I can only imagine leads to the dungeons."
    "Una escalera baja por el pozo; imagino que conduce a las mazmorras."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1129
translate spanish a2s2_031ba2df:

    # "The hole is dark, and as I pause, I can feel the drone hovering behind me."
    "El agujero está oscuro; al detenerme siento el dron flotando detrás."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1130
translate spanish a2s2_787ecfe3:

    # com "\"Please proceed down the ladder, [mc].\""
    com "\"Baja por la escalera, por favor, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1131
translate spanish a2s2_2df05ce3:

    # "I get a prickling sensation on the back of my neck, and I wonder for a moment if this is some sort of trap."
    "Siento un hormigueo en la nuca y me pregunto si será una trampa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1132
translate spanish a2s2_05efc97f:

    # "I mean, of course it feels like a trap; I have a creepy AI nudging me toward a pit of darkness, all set up by Cassius."
    "Claro que lo parece: una IA inquietante me empuja hacia un pozo oscuro y Cassius lo ha preparado todo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1133
translate spanish a2s2_3ae3dffa:

    # "Despite the feeling, I force myself downward, shakily lowering myself to the ladder, several times feeling as if I'm going to slip and fall."
    "Me obligo a bajar pese a esa sensación, descendiendo temblorosamente por la escalera y sintiendo varias veces que voy a resbalar y caer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1134
translate spanish a2s2_196286d8:

    # "I have no idea how deep this thing goes, but as I start to think it might be a significant drop, my foot hits solid ground."
    "No sé lo profundo que es, pero cuando empiezo a temer una gran caída, el pie toca suelo firme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1137
translate spanish a2s2_eba71bf7:

    # "To my surprise, I get exactly what I had been expecting."
    "Para mi sorpresa, encuentro exactamente lo que esperaba."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1138
translate spanish a2s2_9dfbe634:

    # "It's what looks like, well...a straight-up dungeon."
    "Parece...una auténtica mazmorra."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1139
translate spanish a2s2_7d8acb71:

    # "Dim, yellow lighting is cast across the stone walls and floor, the air musty and stale, the halls quiet."
    "Una tenue luz amarilla cubre las paredes y el suelo de piedra; el aire está viciado y huele a humedad, y los pasillos están silenciosos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1140
translate spanish a2s2_b24f0d1a:

    # "The air is cold and, fleetingly, I'm glad that Amicus has at least that."
    "Hace frío y me alegro fugazmente de que Amicus al menos tenga eso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1141
translate spanish a2s2_b7123140:

    # "And as I'm thinking this, I hear movement up ahead."
    "Mientras lo pienso, oigo movimiento más adelante."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1142
translate spanish a2s2_6e4e2e71:

    # "Shuffling footsteps and shadows being cast on the walls of the hallway in front of me."
    "Pasos arrastrados y sombras proyectadas en las paredes del pasillo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1143
translate spanish a2s2_7ea8c454:

    # "I take a few steps forward, but Com buzzes behind me."
    "Avanzo unos pasos, pero Com zumba detrás."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1144
translate spanish a2s2_73d04d17:

    # com "\"Remain close to the ladder, please.\""
    com "\"Permanece cerca de la escalera, por favor.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1145
translate spanish a2s2_68fd5c8f:

    # "I stop and wait impatiently, wondering if what's up ahead is indeed Amicus."
    "Me detengo y espero impaciente, preguntándome si lo que hay delante es Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1146
translate spanish a2s2_e2b736a2:

    # "Again, I get that creeping feeling that I've been betrayed somehow, that what's up ahead is some sort of monster Cassius decided to feed me to."
    "Vuelve la sensación de que me han traicionado y de que delante hay un monstruo al que Cassius decidió darme de comer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1147
translate spanish a2s2_0e71ea10:

    # "Instead though, what turns the corner is...Amicus."
    "Pero quien dobla la esquina es...Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1149
translate spanish a2s2_a03423ed:

    # "For a moment, my wolf stands there at the other end of the hall, staring at me."
    "Mi lobo se queda un instante al otro extremo del pasillo, mirándome."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1150
translate spanish a2s2_cd3e60d8:

    # "Then, before I know it, he's running at me."
    "Antes de darme cuenta corre hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1153
translate spanish a2s2_0d4fbcf5:

    # "I start to move forward, but Com tells me to stay put once again, more firmly this time."
    "Intento avanzar, pero Com vuelve a ordenarme que no me mueva, con más firmeza."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1154
translate spanish a2s2_8aac8bd8:

    # "So I force myself to wait, watching as my wolf sprints at me."
    "Me obligo a esperar y veo a mi lobo correr hacia mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1155
translate spanish a2s2_0e73a76d:

    # "As he gets closer, I open my arms and the next next thing I know, I'm caught up in a mass of fur, warmth, and tears."
    "Al acercarse abro los brazos y de pronto quedo envuelto en pelo, calor y lágrimas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1157
translate spanish a2s2_27b7f10b:

    # a "\"[mc]!\""
    a "\"¡[mc]!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1158
translate spanish a2s2_b6285003:

    # "I'm spun around in a circle, my face pressed hard against the wolf's neck before I'm set down again."
    "Me hace girar en círculo con la cara apretada contra su cuello, antes de volver a dejarme en el suelo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1159
translate spanish a2s2_f56f8bd4:

    # "Amicus doesn't let me go though, clutching me tightly to his body."
    "Pero Amicus no me suelta; me estrecha contra su cuerpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1160
translate spanish a2s2_cf097460:

    # "He'd sounded happy at first, but now I feel him gasp and shake."
    "Al principio sonaba feliz; ahora lo siento jadear y temblar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1161
translate spanish a2s2_2e87079d:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1162
translate spanish a2s2_8aa2d28e:

    # "I pull back as much as he'll let me so I can see his face."
    "Me aparto cuanto me permite para verle el rostro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1164
translate spanish a2s2_7546acef:

    # "I see then that he's crying, not even trying to hide it as he looks down at me with reddened eyes."
    "Veo que llora sin intentar ocultarlo y me mira con los ojos enrojecidos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1165
translate spanish a2s2_bbf83b9d:

    # "He looks...okay for the most part."
    "Parece...bastante bien."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1166
translate spanish a2s2_aaf62d89:

    # "His fur is a bit disheveled, and maybe he's a little thinner, but otherwise he looks healthy."
    "Tiene el pelo algo desordenado y quizá esté un poco más delgado; por lo demás parece sano."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1167
translate spanish a2s2_756123c4:

    # "The most noticeable change is actually his smell; a hint of musk without any scent of lavender."
    "Lo más distinto es su olor: un toque de almizcle sin rastro de lavanda."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1168
translate spanish a2s2_0d4a74bb:

    # "Amicus is looking at me just as closely, and one of his paws comes up to brush a thumb pad across my cheek."
    "Amicus me examina con la misma atención y alza una mano para acariciarme la mejilla con la almohadilla del pulgar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1169
translate spanish a2s2_df47693d:

    # "It's then that I realize that I'm crying too."
    "Entonces comprendo que yo también lloro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1170
translate spanish a2s2_7c7401dd:

    # "So I press my face against his chest again and we stay like that for a while."
    "Vuelvo a apretar la cara contra su pecho y nos quedamos así un rato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1171
translate spanish a2s2_05d3000d:

    # "After about ten minutes, our breathing is under control and the wolf's grip on me loosens, though he doesn't let go."
    "Después de unos diez minutos controlamos la respiración y el lobo afloja el abrazo, pero no me suelta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1172
translate spanish a2s2_e65ff725:

    # "Finally, Amicus is the first to speak."
    "Amicus es el primero en hablar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1174
translate spanish a2s2_29f34300:

    # a "\"[mc], I am so, so sorry. What are you still doing here? You're a Khemian. You need to go to Neferu and tell him that you want to be taken home...or at least to Khemia.\""
    a "\"[mc], lo siento muchísimo. ¿Qué haces todavía aquí? Eres khemio. Debes decirle a Neferu que quieres volver a casa...o al menos ir a Khemia.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1175
translate spanish a2s2_5aa47945:

    # "His voice breaks."
    "Se le quiebra la voz."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1177
translate spanish a2s2_dcea8d95:

    # a "\"You need to get off of Adastra; it is not safe for you here. At the very least, have Virginia help smuggle you from the palace, you could—\""
    a "\"Tienes que salir de Adastra; no estás a salvo aquí. Al menos pide a Virginia que te saque a escondidas del palacio, podrías—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1178
translate spanish a2s2_22a49b55:

    # "I reach up a hand and press it against his muzzle, both to stop him from telling me to do things I won't be doing, and also because I feel like Com is recording this, even if Cassius doesn't mean to monitor us."
    "Levanto una mano y la aprieto contra su hocico para que deje de pedirme cosas que no haré y porque creo que Com lo graba, aunque Cassius no pretenda vigilarnos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1180
translate spanish a2s2_43314322:

    # "Amicus pauses in surprise as I clamp his muzzle shut, then I see his eyes well up again as he reaches up to cup my hand and press his face into it, closing his eyes."
    "Amicus se detiene sorprendido cuando le cierro el hocico; vuelven las lágrimas mientras toma mi mano y aprieta el rostro contra ella, cerrando los ojos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1182
translate spanish a2s2_318e9a2f:

    # m "\"I'm fine...I'm here to...help you.\""
    m "\"Estoy bien...estoy aquí para...ayudarte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1183
translate spanish a2s2_6bdc9e71:

    # "I choose my words carefully."
    "Elijo mis palabras con cuidado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1184
translate spanish a2s2_007d9b26:

    # m "\"I'm GOING to help you, and I'm not leaving until I do.\""
    m "\"VOY a ayudarte y no me iré hasta hacerlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1186
translate spanish a2s2_5555655e:

    # a "\"[mc]—\""
    a "\"[mc]—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1187
translate spanish a2s2_d220ec8f:

    # m "\"I'm not leaving.\""
    m "\"No me voy.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1189
translate spanish a2s2_951c6fc7:

    # a "\"Please—\""
    a "\"Por favor—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1191
translate spanish a2s2_d5ac55ca:

    # "This time, I bring my other hand up to his mouth."
    "Esta vez le llevo la otra mano a la boca."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1192
translate spanish a2s2_e13623cb:

    # m "\"I'm safe. Neferu is keeping me very safe. Nothing can be done to me. I'm a Khemian, now.\""
    m "\"Estoy a salvo. Neferu me protege muy bien. No pueden hacerme nada. Ahora soy khemio.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1193
translate spanish a2s2_7a61a916:

    # com "\"Ten minutes remaining, [mc].\""
    com "\"Quedan diez minutos, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1194
translate spanish a2s2_a0520921:

    # "Already?"
    "¿Ya?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1195
translate spanish a2s2_108e34be:

    # "Suddenly I'm pressed up against the wolf's chest again as Amicus hugs me tightly."
    "Amicus vuelve a estrecharme de golpe contra su pecho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1198
translate spanish a2s2_f0be3f5e:

    # a "\"I'm such a damn fool. I never think of others. I ruined your life, and for what?\""
    a "\"Soy un maldito imbécil. Nunca pienso en otros. Arruiné tu vida, ¿y para qué?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1199
translate spanish a2s2_c651d0c8:

    # m "\"No.\""
    m "\"No.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1200
translate spanish a2s2_90d07e1a:

    # "I press back again."
    "Vuelvo a apartarme un poco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1201
translate spanish a2s2_1586c36d:

    # m "\"I know that I can leave with Neferu's help, but I'm choosing not to.\""
    m "\"Sé que puedo irme con ayuda de Neferu, pero elijo no hacerlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1202
translate spanish a2s2_42c2d6c6:

    # "Amicus opens his mouth to say more, but I cut in before he can."
    "Amicus abre la boca para seguir, pero lo interrumpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1203
translate spanish a2s2_16f9f2aa:

    # m "\"I want to be here, and I'm going to—\""
    m "\"Quiero estar aquí y voy a—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1204
translate spanish a2s2_98678438:

    # "I'm about to say \"take down Cato\", but I cut myself off."
    "Estoy a punto de decir \"derribar a Cato\", pero me detengo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1205
translate spanish a2s2_7c5caf8b:

    # m "\"—help you, even Cassius wants to. I'm gonna get you out of here no matter what.\""
    m "\"—ayudarte; hasta Cassius quiere hacerlo. Te sacaré de aquí pase lo que pase.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1206
translate spanish a2s2_5c4af324:

    # "More tears start to well up, so I just hug him and we stay like that for a while."
    "Vuelven las lágrimas, así que lo abrazo y nos quedamos así un rato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1208
translate spanish a2s2_c520bf0b:

    # "I wish I'd thought of things to say...I'm sure there are things I could have brought up that might have helped me, or Amicus..."
    "Ojalá hubiera pensado qué decir...seguro que podría haber mencionado cosas que nos ayudaran..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1209
translate spanish a2s2_9d509a56:

    # "...but my mind is blank as all I want to do is hold my wolf."
    "...pero tengo la mente en blanco y solo quiero abrazar a mi lobo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1210
translate spanish a2s2_f740bb8a:

    # a "\"Please, just...just don't involve yourself too much. Keep yourself safe. Being a Khemian doesn't guarantee all that if you...meddle.\""
    a "\"Por favor...no te involucres demasiado. Protégete. Ser khemio no lo garantiza si...te entrometes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1211
translate spanish a2s2_0c8706bc:

    # "I can hear Amicus trying to choose his own words carefully."
    "Oigo a Amicus elegir sus propias palabras con cuidado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1212
translate spanish a2s2_391e603b:

    # m "\"Yeah, Cato's already shown me that.\""
    m "\"Sí, Cato ya me lo ha demostrado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1213
translate spanish a2s2_4308e229:

    # "Amicus jerks back, looking at me."
    "Amicus se aparta de golpe y me mira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1215
translate spanish a2s2_26bb83d4:

    # a "\"Did he do something to you?\""
    a "\"¿Te ha hecho algo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1216
translate spanish a2s2_cea65ed2:

    # m "\"Not me, Neferu.\""
    m "\"A mí no, a Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1217
translate spanish a2s2_9dcfb04f:

    # a "\"What happened?\""
    a "\"¿Qué pasó?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1218
translate spanish a2s2_074fdf43:

    # m "\"Uh...Neferu was kind of being...forward, and he got kicked in the nuts.\""
    m "\"Eh...Neferu se puso un poco...atrevido y recibió una patada en los huevos.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1220
translate spanish a2s2_946a040d:

    # a "\"What!?\""
    a "\"¡¿Qué?!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1221
translate spanish a2s2_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Sí.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1223
translate spanish a2s2_f1b83b89:

    # a "\"But he's the Pharaoh's son...\""
    a "\"Pero es hijo del faraón...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1224
translate spanish a2s2_200b459d:

    # m "\"Yeah, so I know that I need to be especially careful.\""
    m "\"Sí, sé que debo tener especial cuidado.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1225
translate spanish a2s2_94f1b43f:

    # "The look of shock on Amicus's face slowly changes to one of slight amusement."
    "La sorpresa de Amicus cambia despacio a una leve diversión."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1227
translate spanish a2s2_c68234f8:

    # a "\"Well, that's something I can't imagine.\""
    a "\"Eso sí que no puedo imaginarlo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1228
translate spanish a2s2_2f0a4cbb:

    # m "\"It was definitely something.\""
    m "\"Fue todo un espectáculo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1229
translate spanish a2s2_27ebcb7e:

    # "I'm glad to see Amicus smiling at least a little."
    "Me alegra verlo sonreír al menos un poco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1230
translate spanish a2s2_e235e45e:

    # com "\"One minute.\""
    com "\"Un minuto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1232
translate spanish a2s2_bfe94f78:

    # "I feel a flash of annoyance at the AI before Amicus is hugging me tightly again."
    "La IA me irrita por un instante antes de que Amicus vuelva a abrazarme con fuerza."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1233
translate spanish a2s2_2096b2c3:

    # m "\"I'm going to be careful...I'm just gonna help everyone figure out how best to clear your name.\""
    m "\"Tendré cuidado...solo ayudaré a los demás a descubrir la mejor forma de limpiar tu nombre.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1234
translate spanish a2s2_6a76c69b:

    # a "\"I love you...so much.\""
    a "\"Te amo...muchísimo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1235
translate spanish a2s2_58124b9d:

    # m "\"I love you, too.\""
    m "\"Yo también te amo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1236
translate spanish a2s2_fc145c15:

    # com "\"Time limit has been reached. Please proceed to the ladder, [mc]. Please proceed to your cell, Amicus.\""
    com "\"Se ha alcanzado el límite de tiempo. Dirígete a la escalera, [mc]. Dirígete a tu celda, Amicus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1237
translate spanish a2s2_48313199:

    # "Amicus's embrace doesn't loosen and instead, he lowers his head to kiss me."
    "Amicus no afloja el abrazo; baja la cabeza para besarme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1238
translate spanish a2s2_5ffbfc3d:

    # "I kiss back."
    "Le devuelvo el beso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1239
translate spanish a2s2_ac1fb6de:

    # com "\"Please untangle your limbs and oral cavities and proceed to your respective directives.\""
    com "\"Desenredad las extremidades y cavidades orales y cumplid vuestras respectivas órdenes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1241
translate spanish a2s2_dc3eb339:

    # "Amicus huffs in annoyance before drawing back."
    "Amicus resopla molesto y se aparta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1242
translate spanish a2s2_67ab9a54:

    # m "\"And I'll be back! I just need to ask Cassius for the right times.\""
    m "\"¡Volveré! Solo tengo que preguntar a Cassius cuándo puedo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1244
translate spanish a2s2_64f873ff:

    # a "\"Alright, there's much more I want to say to you, so please...return soon, if you possibly can.\""
    a "\"Está bien; quiero decirte mucho más, así que vuelve pronto...si puedes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1246
translate spanish a2s2_8248afcb:

    # m "\"Of course! As soon as I can.\""
    m "\"¡Claro! En cuanto pueda.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1248
translate spanish a2s2_2f295915:

    # "Amicus gives me a small smile, and though I see tears in his eyes, they don't overflow this time."
    "Amicus me sonríe un poco; veo lágrimas en sus ojos, pero esta vez no se derraman."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1252
translate spanish a2s2_977f3e21:

    # "The journey back to Neferu's room is when it all hits me at once, and I have to constantly wipe my eyes in case someone like Alex, Neferu...or Cato comes around the corner and sees me."
    "Todo me golpea a la vez al volver a la habitación de Neferu; tengo que secarme continuamente los ojos por si Alex, Neferu...o Cato doblan una esquina y me ven."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1253
translate spanish a2s2_8150136d:

    # "I already desperately miss Amicus, and now that I've just left him, I'm reminded of how alone I feel now that he's not always by my side."
    "Ya echo desesperadamente de menos a Amicus; acabar de dejarlo me recuerda lo solo que me siento sin tenerlo siempre a mi lado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1254
translate spanish a2s2_440d4842:

    # "Next time I visit, I'll bring a bunch of stuff to say, do, and eat."
    "La próxima visita llevaré muchas cosas que decir, hacer y comer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1255
translate spanish a2s2_0074dba9:

    # "I can't imagine the dungeon food is any good."
    "No puedo imaginar que la comida de las mazmorras sea buena."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1256
translate spanish a2s2_47b3acef:

    # "Maybe we can find more privacy next time, and we'll be able to plan things out, maybe pass information on to him somehow."
    "Quizá encontremos más intimidad la próxima vez para planear cosas o pasarle información de algún modo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1257
translate spanish a2s2_127a6fd8:

    # "The thought of this makes me feel a little bit better, and my eyes are mostly dry as I near the jackal's room."
    "Pensarlo me alivia un poco; tengo los ojos casi secos al acercarme a la habitación del chacal."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1258
translate spanish a2s2_a98c1efe:

    # "It's at that moment that I get a strange wiff of something in the air."
    "Entonces percibo un olor extraño en el aire."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1261
translate spanish a2s2_ad57f7b3:

    # "Like...mothballs?"
    "¿Como...bolas de naftalina?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1262
translate spanish a2s2_7b4eca0d:

    # "That's all that comes to mind."
    "Es lo único que se me ocurre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1263
translate spanish a2s2_458fe5b3:

    # "It's something that I've never smelled in the palace before, so I find myself pausing in the hallway, looking around."
    "Nunca lo había olido en el palacio, así que me detengo en el pasillo y miro alrededor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1264
translate spanish a2s2_dc5667ae:

    # "Nothing seems out of place."
    "Nada parece fuera de lugar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1265
translate spanish a2s2_e82a7bc6:

    # "It's quiet and bright, as it usually is, but that's when I realize where I am."
    "Todo está tranquilo y luminoso como siempre, pero entonces comprendo dónde estoy."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1266
translate spanish a2s2_ca9ffcb4:

    # "There's a door to my left, and I immediately know that's the meditation room."
    "Hay una puerta a mi izquierda; sé enseguida que es la sala de meditación."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1267
translate spanish a2s2_8ab85954:

    # "I remember then that Cassius mentioned that he wanted to meditate, to talk to the parents."
    "Recuerdo que Cassius dijo que quería meditar para hablar con los Padres."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1268
translate spanish a2s2_4cbb4f01:

    # "Is he in there doing that right now...and is that smell part of it?"
    "¿Está haciéndolo ahora...y ese olor forma parte del proceso?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1269
translate spanish a2s2_56f31f18:

    # "I'm reminded of the night I first met Amicus, that I'd smelled something like burning rubber in the air."
    "Recuerdo haber olido algo como goma quemada la noche que conocí a Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1270
translate spanish a2s2_d493559a:

    # "This isn't that, but I have to wonder if maybe the...parents emit this odd smell when they arrive?"
    "No es lo mismo, pero me pregunto si los...Padres emiten este extraño olor al llegar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1271
translate spanish a2s2_0b523dc8:

    # "I stand there for a while, listening."
    "Me quedo un rato escuchando."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1272
translate spanish a2s2_10c27758:

    # "I don't hear anything, but that smell continues, and I know now that it's definitely coming from that room."
    "No oigo nada, pero el olor persiste y sé que viene de esa habitación."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1273
translate spanish a2s2_d57ac0bd:

    # "My eyes are squarely locked on the black panel."
    "Mis ojos están fijos en el panel negro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1274
translate spanish a2s2_5ee0b41c:

    # "I want to open it, but I know I can't."
    "Quiero abrir la puerta, pero sé que no puedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1275
translate spanish a2s2_435ec8b7:

    # "If Cassius really is in the middle of talking to the parents, I could ruin everything."
    "Si Cassius habla con los Padres, podría estropearlo todo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1276
translate spanish a2s2_f068a50f:

    # "So, I start to turn away, deciding that I'll ask Neferu what might be going on in there."
    "Empiezo a apartarme y decido preguntar a Neferu qué estará pasando dentro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1277
translate spanish a2s2_1d25761c:

    # "But as I do, the door opens, and a cloud of billowing, white smoke comes out."
    "Pero la puerta se abre y sale una nube de humo blanco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1281
translate spanish a2s2_fb218f0b:

    # "I gasp and jump back, seeing a figure standing in the doorway."
    "Jadeo y salto atrás al ver una figura en la entrada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1282
translate spanish a2s2_c16ba91d:

    # "It's Cassius, and he's hacking and coughing, gasping for breath."
    "Es Cassius, tosiendo violentamente y buscando aire."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1283
translate spanish a2s2_b9680cbf:

    # "I can see that he's shaking too, and I'm about to back away when he locks eyes on me."
    "También tiembla; estoy a punto de apartarme cuando fija los ojos en mí."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1284
translate spanish a2s2_efba35b5:

    # "His eyes are wide, bloodshot, and I can see what looks like vomit on his chest."
    "Los tiene muy abiertos y enrojecidos, y veo algo parecido a vómito en su pecho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1285
translate spanish a2s2_fa4c67ed:

    # "His muzzle hangs open, as if trying to talk to me."
    "Tiene el hocico abierto, como intentando hablar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1286
translate spanish a2s2_71d140fd:

    # "He's hyperventilating though, and that's finally when I step forward."
    "Pero hiperventila y finalmente doy un paso adelante."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1287
translate spanish a2s2_f388506e:

    # m "\"Cassius...are you okay?\""
    m "\"Cassius...¿estás bien?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1288
translate spanish a2s2_f6e99dc7:

    # "I have to walk into the cloud to get to him, and I'm enveloped in that chemical smell, immediately coughing out the acrid smoke."
    "Para llegar a él entro en la nube; el olor químico me envuelve y enseguida toso por el humo acre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1289
translate spanish a2s2_29487704:

    # c "\"H—h—help...me...\""
    c "\"A—a—ayúda...me...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1291
translate spanish a2s2_57b471f7:

    # "Cassius reaches out to me and I catch his paw."
    "Cassius me tiende una mano y la agarro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1293
translate spanish a2s2_3d57563e:

    # "Immediately, he slumps against me and I stumble under his significant weight."
    "Se desploma contra mí inmediatamente y tropiezo bajo su considerable peso."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1294
translate spanish a2s2_04ad15c0:

    # "Nowhere near to that of Amicus, but he is a wolf after all."
    "Mucho menor que el de Amicus, pero sigue siendo un lobo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1295
translate spanish a2s2_8059cacc:

    # m "\"What happened?\""
    m "\"¿Qué pasó?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1296
translate spanish a2s2_4cd77819:

    # "I try to peer into the room, but it's so smokey...I see what looks like a little fire in the middle though, a pot burning something inside."
    "Intento mirar dentro, pero hay tanto humo...veo algo parecido a un pequeño fuego en el centro, una olla donde arde algo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1297
translate spanish a2s2_15d03103:

    # "Did...did Cassius hotbox himself with something?"
    "¿Cassius...se ha colocado encerrándose con algún humo?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1298
translate spanish a2s2_71f0dae4:

    # c "\"P—P—Parents...demons...\""
    c "\"P—P—Padres...demonios...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1299
translate spanish a2s2_2c1b407f:

    # "I don't know what to do."
    "No sé qué hacer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1300
translate spanish a2s2_f0bee6be:

    # "At first, I start to try and pull Cassius along toward Neferu's room, but I immediately switch course, deciding that I definitely won't make it."
    "Empiezo a arrastrar a Cassius hacia la habitación de Neferu, pero cambio de rumbo al comprender que no llegaré."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1301
translate spanish a2s2_c6c7c0a7:

    # "Amicus's room is closer."
    "La habitación de Amicus está más cerca."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1302
translate spanish a2s2_988b26d9:

    # "I just hope I can still get in there."
    "Solo espero poder entrar todavía."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1303
translate spanish a2s2_b733949b:

    # c "\"I can't...I can't...\""
    c "\"No puedo...no puedo...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1304
translate spanish a2s2_77b36f73:

    # "Cassius whines and then suddenly lets out a retch."
    "Cassius gime y de pronto tiene una arcada."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1305
translate spanish a2s2_5c00268e:

    # "I try to ignore it, just kind of hoping that someone else will come around the corner to help me, even if it's Cato."
    "Intento ignorarlo, esperando que alguien doble la esquina y me ayude, aunque sea Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1306
translate spanish a2s2_a1c80d87:

    # "As I'm thinking this, I realize that the hall seems to stretch further and further ahead of me."
    "Mientras lo pienso, el pasillo parece alargarse cada vez más."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1307
translate spanish a2s2_763db420:

    # "The light takes on an odd quality, strangely sharp and bright...and just like that, I instantly fall into what feels like a dream."
    "La luz adquiere una cualidad extraña, nítida y brillante...y de golpe caigo en algo parecido a un sueño."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1309
translate spanish a2s2_a478a500:

    # m "\"Goddammit, what were you smoking?\""
    m "\"Joder, ¿qué estabas fumando?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1310
translate spanish a2s2_b55c3fef:

    # c "\"Parents!\""
    c "\"¡Padres!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1311
translate spanish a2s2_6b3b9fe2:

    # "Cassius squeaks."
    "Cassius chilla."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1312
translate spanish a2s2_8a01cd35:

    # "I'm angry, not just because this dumb wolf got me high on who-knows-what—"
    "Estoy enfadado, no solo porque este lobo idiota me ha colocado con vete a saber qué—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1313
translate spanish a2s2_3837dac2:

    # "—but because I'm realizing that this is what Cassius was referring to when he said the \"traditional technique\" of contacting the parents had worked."
    "—sino porque comprendo a qué se refería al decir que la \"técnica tradicional\" para contactar con los Padres había funcionado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1314
translate spanish a2s2_ad2112e2:

    # "All he was doing was getting high on some DMT shit."
    "Solo se colocaba con alguna mierda de DMT."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1315
translate spanish a2s2_31aee648:

    # "Is this how it's always been?"
    "¿Siempre ha sido así?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1316
translate spanish a2s2_6d574a4e:

    # "Are the wolves...all the aliens just getting their crazy parent ideas from some drug?"
    "¿Los lobos...todos los alienígenas sacan esas locas ideas sobre los Padres de una droga?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1317
translate spanish a2s2_46998d9d:

    # "The hall continues to extend ahead of me, and suddenly I feel like I'm looping in time, like time doesn't matter at all anymore."
    "El pasillo sigue alargándose y siento de pronto un bucle temporal, como si el tiempo ya no importara."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1318
translate spanish a2s2_d8536067:

    # "I can see why Cassius is panicking; I'm starting to myself."
    "Entiendo el pánico de Cassius; yo también empiezo a sentirlo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1319
translate spanish a2s2_6e0062b7:

    # "After what seems like an eternity, I manage to find Amicus's door."
    "Tras lo que parece una eternidad, encuentro la puerta de Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1320
translate spanish a2s2_56f8dc4c:

    # "Shakily, I reach out and press the panel, the door sliding open."
    "Aprieto el panel con una mano temblorosa y la puerta se abre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1323
translate spanish a2s2_3893e2da:

    # "I practically throw Cassius onto the bed."
    "Prácticamente arrojo a Cassius sobre la cama."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1324
translate spanish a2s2_7bd459ae:

    # "He seems to have stopped blubbering at this point."
    "Parece haber dejado de lloriquear."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1325
translate spanish a2s2_d39da6b9:

    # "I collapse onto the sofa, my anger at the wolves and so-called parents dissipating from my mind as the high increases."
    "Me desplomo en el sofá y se disipa mi enfado contra los lobos y los supuestos Padres mientras aumenta el efecto de la droga."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1326
translate spanish a2s2_84e158ff:

    # "I raise my hands in front of my face and immediately regret it as they start to stretch and bend."
    "Levanto las manos ante mi rostro y me arrepiento al ver que empiezan a estirarse y doblarse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1327
translate spanish a2s2_d4667060:

    # "Quickly, I jerk them back to my chest, hugging myself, trying to keep my breathing under control."
    "Las retiro al pecho y me abrazo, intentando controlar la respiración."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1328
translate spanish a2s2_07563632:

    # "It feels like I'm sinking into a crater, like the ceiling is raising up above me, and that time won't start moving again."
    "Siento que me hundo en un cráter, que el techo se eleva sobre mí y que el tiempo no volverá a avanzar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1329
translate spanish a2s2_c036a09c:

    # "I gasp and clutch at the cushions, shutting my eyes, trying to calm myself down."
    "Jadeo y me aferro a los cojines, cerrando los ojos para intentar calmarme."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1330
translate spanish a2s2_da56184e:

    # com "\"You seem to be worried about something. Wanna stress tablet to help you out?\""
    com "\"Pareces preocupado por algo. ¿Quieres una pastilla para el estrés que te ayude?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1331
translate spanish a2s2_1a3a0fca:

    # "That voice...sounds kinda like Com...kinda not."
    "Esa voz...suena un poco a Com...y un poco no."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1332
translate spanish a2s2_9046708a:

    # m "\"I—\""
    m "\"Yo...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1333
translate spanish a2s2_5954ba2b:

    # com "\"They help you chill.\""
    com "\"Te ayudan a relajarte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1334
translate spanish a2s2_bb392094:

    # m "\"Wha—\""
    m "\"Qué...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1335
translate spanish a2s2_58c3b4a3:

    # "My confusion over Com's voice melts away as mercifully, darkness takes me..."
    "Mi confusión por la voz de Com se desvanece cuando, por fortuna, la oscuridad me envuelve..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1338
translate spanish a2s2_20c56fa2:

    # "I'm relieved to find myself back up in space."
    "Me alivia encontrarme de nuevo en el espacio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1339
translate spanish a2s2_b8b9fb0e:

    # "I float; content, calm, happy, even though I sense someone watching me, just behind me..."
    "Floto, satisfecho, tranquilo y feliz, aunque siento que alguien me observa justo detrás..."

